ane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/66f39432e5191bc2049f93448f37c285b1759842/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:22:41Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:22:41Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"chore: peerDependencies 를 빼고 peers 카탈로그를 없앤다\n\npnpm 12.1.0 의 `pnpm peers check` 가 peerDependencies 안의 카탈로그\n프로토콜을 해석하지 않는다. 설치·빌드는 정상인데 진단만 거짓말한다.\n\n  ✕ unmet peer react\n    Installed: 19.2.8\n    Wanted:\n      catalog:peers:     ← 범위가 아니라 프로토콜 문자열 그대로\n\n`catalog:` 로 바꿔도 같다(`catalog::`). main 과 대조해 카탈로그 전환이\n만든 오탐임을 확인했다. 오탐 3건이 상주하면 진짜 미충족 peer\n(eslint-plugin-react)가 그 사이에 묻힌다.\n\npeer 선언 자체를 뺀다. @mfa/store · @mfa/ui 는 private 이고 소비자가\n워크스페이스 안 세 앱뿐인데 그 셋이 전부 같은 카탈로그를 본다 — react\n인스턴스가 하나라는 보장을 이제 카탈로그가 구조적으로 준다. peer 는 같은\n것을 관례로 바라기만 했다.\n\npnpm-lock.yaml 은 한 글자도 안 바뀐다. pnpm 이 워크스페이스 패키지의\npeer 도 catalogs.peers 항목도 락파일에 기록하지 않았다 — 그 선언이 해석\n그래프에 아무 영향이 없었다는 증거다.\n\ndevDependencies.react 는 빌드·타입체크에 필요하므로 그대로 둔다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"e91dca9afa9fc3ee055ea12eade725395a427dd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/e91dca9afa9fc3ee055ea12eade725395a427dd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/66f39432e5191bc2049f93448f37c285b1759842","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/66f39432e5191bc2049f93448f37c285b1759842","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDY2ZjM5NDMyZTUxOTFiYzIwNDlmOTM0NDhmMzdjMjg1YjE3NTk4NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a","sha":"b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a"}],"sha":"66f39432e5191bc2049f93448f37c285b1759842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/66f39432e5191bc2049f93448f37c285b1759842"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:46:16Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:46:16Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: catalog 전환을 ADR·진행·버전 문서에 남긴다\n\n- ADR-027: 공용 의존성 버전은 catalog 한 곳에만 적는다. overrides·syncpack·\n  전량 등록을 기각한 이유 포함\n- 00-progress.md 46차\n- 03-setup/02-versions.md: 표의 버전을 어디서 고치는지 맨 위에 명시\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"4e8059a0b6ba591844e3f0bd45241283a0359b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/4e8059a0b6ba591844e3f0bd45241283a0359b99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGI2ZDAyOGY5MzcyOTM0ZDY3MjQ3NzY3NTUxYjQ3ZjM3ZWVhZWNkMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0","sha":"c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0"}],"sha":"b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b6d028f9372934d67247767551b47f37eeaecd0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:46:16Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:46:16Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"chore: 공용 의존성 버전을 pnpm catalog 로 모은다\n\ntypescript 9곳, eslint 10곳, @types/react 8곳에 같은 버전 문자열이 복제돼\n있었다. 한 곳을 빠뜨려도 설치는 성공하므로 어긋남이 런타임까지 밀린다 —\nReact 인스턴스가 갈라지면 hook 이 깨지고, MF 패키지 세대가 어긋나면\nremoteEntry 를 못 읽는다. 실제로 react 가 ^19.2.8(deps)과 ^19.0.0(peer)로\n갈라져 있었다.\n\n- pnpm-workspace.yaml 에 catalog 를 두고 21종을 등록. 공유되는 것과 계열\n  버전이 어긋나면 사고가 되는 것만 올린다. @rsbuild/*, vite, zustand 처럼\n  소유자가 하나뿐인 의존성은 그 package.json 에 남긴다.\n- peerDependencies.react 는 catalogs.peers(^19.0.0)로 나눈다. 소비자에게\n  요구하는 범위는 우리가 쓰는 범위보다 느슨해야 한다.\n- catalogMode: strict — pnpm add 가 카탈로그를 우회하면 설치가 실패한다.\n\nlockfile 해석 그래프 대조: 패키지 591개, 추가·제거 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"e26aaf423957cfc597530ce53417552365defcdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/e26aaf423957cfc597530ce53417552365defcdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGMxMTBjYjA4ZjdkZWY3NTJiYzE2M2ZhNzA0MzFjYjQ2NTdiNGM1YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/bc2b262440e68b6efce16709fefdb696c2457c27","sha":"bc2b262440e68b6efce16709fefdb696c2457c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/bc2b262440e68b6efce16709fefdb696c2457c27"}],"sha":"c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/c110cb08f7def752bc163fa70431cb4657b4c5b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/recei