"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/bc2b262440e68b6efce16709fefdb696c2457c27","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGJjMmIyNjI0NDBlNjhiNmVmY2UxNjcwOWZlZmRiNjk2YzI0NTdjMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50","sha":"6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50"}],"sha":"bc2b262440e68b6efce16709fefdb696c2457c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/bc2b262440e68b6efce16709fefdb696c2457c27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:16:16Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:16:16Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 문서 지도와 규칙을 새 배치에 맞춘다\n\n새 그림 셋을 README · 문서 지도 · CLAUDE.md 표에 올리고, 그림 경로와 Pages 주소를\n`docs/visual/` 기준으로 고친다. 규칙 파일에는 \"시네마 판\" 절을 넣어 새 판을 만들 때\n엔진을 복제하지 말고 데이터만 쓰라는 계약을 남긴다.\n\n진행 기록 43~45차: 배포 편 · 요청 편 · (폴더 분리 + 엔진 공통화 + 번들러 편).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"2fa07467c2651f410b60a1decbe988ba82ccb0d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/2fa07467c2651f410b60a1decbe988ba82ccb0d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDZhZGRjOWU3NGIwN2JlN2JjOWM5ZTA5ZjkzNTJjZDFmMjcyM2RmNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7","sha":"2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7"}],"sha":"6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/6addc9e74b07be7bc9c9e09f9352cd1f2723df50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:16:07Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:16:07Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 배포 · 요청 · 번들러 시네마 세 판을 넣는다\n\n정지 그림으로는 안 보이는 것이 셋 있었다. 배포는 순서가 곧 정확성이고(remote 를 host 보다\n먼저, warm 을 무효화보다 먼저), 요청은 경로가 요점이며(브라우저는 host 하나만 친다),\n번들러는 같은 계약을 서로 다르게 만족시킨다. 셋 다 \"그 반대로 하면 무엇이 깨지는가\" 라서\n움직여야 읽힌다.\n\n각 판은 장면 단위로 재생되고, 상자마다 정의 · 실제 설정값 · 근거 파일이 붙는다.\n수치와 재현 조건은 전부 기존 문서와 워크플로에서 가져왔다 — 이 파일들은 SSOT 가 아니다.\n\n엔진과 스타일은 `visual/cinema/` 한 벌을 공유한다. 판이 셋이라 복제하면 반드시 갈린다.\nanatomy.html 은 참여하지 않는다 — 단독 HTML 계약을 유지한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"e689ea9efaf4e861062a9603f56e5045f14b21c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/e689ea9efaf4e861062a9603f56e5045f14b21c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDJmNWQwNDk1M2Y4NmMxOWJjYWViZGEyYjY0YmFmZmZmNDRjOGViZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/69c9ddc13c7cb24671056ffcaa8a8c9afa0115af","sha":"69c9ddc13c7cb24671056ffcaa8a8c9afa0115af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/69c9ddc13c7cb24671056ffcaa8a8c9afa0115af"}],"sha":"2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2f5d04953f86c19bcaebda2b64baffff44c8ebe7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/69c9ddc13c7cb24671056ffcaa8a8c9afa0115af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:15:55Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:15:55Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 그림을 docs/visual 로 모으고 Pages 는 그 폴더만 올린다\n\n브라우저로 볼 것(HTML)과 에디터로 볼 것(마크다운)이 한 폴더에 섞여 목록이 안 읽혔다.\nPages 는 마크다운을 렌더링하지 않으므로 올려도 소스가 노출될 뿐이라, 그림만 올리고\n그 폴더를 사이트 루트로 삼는다 — 공개 주소는 그대로 평평하다.\n\n대신 근거 문서가 같이 올라가지 않으므로 `.md` 링크 치환이 필수가 됐다.\n판정을 github.io 호스트명에서 프로토콜로 바꾼다 — file: 이면 상대 경로가 맞으니 두고,\n서빙된 페이지는 전부 GitHub blob 으로 바꿔 단다(커스텀 도메인에서도 안 깨진다).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"b687db1026a789791eb3d58f7e7f4bc9f28aabd9","url":"https://api.github