eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/68dbceb127bd50dffd5b80ae22594169ed6eac1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:39:40Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:39:40Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: @mfa/utils 의 범위를 ADR-026 으로 다시 긋는다\n\nADR-025 가 이 패키지를 테스트 헬퍼 패키지로 기술해서, 42차에 `hueVar` 를 둘 자리를\n고를 때 \"테스트 전용이니 안 된다\" 는 판단이 먼저 나왔다. 정작 그 ADR 의 마지막 줄은\n\"프로덕션 유틸이 들어와도 배포 판별이 이미 맞다\" 였다.\n\n기록이 범위를 좁게 말하면 다음 사람이 그 범위로 판단한다. `@mfa/utils` 는 소유자가\n없는 범용 유틸의 자리고 `src/test/` 는 그중 한 갈래다 — 배럴 없음과 빌드 없음은\n그대로 간다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2145d825fe9649b76285cf73943eb20415cb9b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/b2145d825fe9649b76285cf73943eb20415cb9b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/68dbceb127bd50dffd5b80ae22594169ed6eac1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/68dbceb127bd50dffd5b80ae22594169ed6eac1c","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDY4ZGJjZWIxMjdiZDUwZGZmZDViODBhZTIyNTk0MTY5ZWQ2ZWFjMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f","sha":"67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f"}],"sha":"68dbceb127bd50dffd5b80ae22594169ed6eac1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/68dbceb127bd50dffd5b80ae22594169ed6eac1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:39:40Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:39:40Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(utils): hueVar 를 @mfa/utils 로 옮긴다\n\n`@mfa/ui` 에서 export 했다가 옮긴다. 그 패키지는 **컴포넌트를 내보내는 자리**인데\n`hueVar` 는 컴포넌트가 아니고, 소비처 셋 중 둘은 프리미티브를 안 쓰면서 이 값만\n필요하다 — 거기 두면 \"컴포넌트를 안 쓰는데 컴포넌트 패키지를 의존한다\" 가 된다.\n\n런타임 코드라 쓰는 쪽은 devDependencies 가 아니라 dependencies 에 적는다.\n빌드는 두지 않는다 — 세 앱 번들러가 워크스페이스 소스를 직접 삼킨다\n(실측: host·cart 양쪽 번들에 태우고 `pnpm build` 통과, transpilePackages 무변경).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79a79f03d9e6275f8271d614063f6218f276019f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/79a79f03d9e6275f8271d614063f6218f276019f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDY3MzcxZGNkZjRlZTllZDU0NzhhM2RlY2VjZDhkYTRiOWE5MzRiOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73","sha":"86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73"}],"sha":"67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/67371dcdf4ee9ed5478a3dececd8da4b9a934b8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:38Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:38Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 42차 — 호출자에게 시키던 판단을 소유자에게 돌려준다\n\n나온 것 넷이 같은 모양이었다 — 어떤 값을 \"누가 고르는가\" 가 잘못 놓여 있고,\n그래서 고르는 쪽이 틀릴 수 있었다. 첫 번째는 실재하는 버그였고(J-1) 나머지 셋은\n터질 때 실패가 아니라 오작동으로 나타난다.\n\nknown-issues 에 J 절(+증상 색인 두 줄), 테스트 계획 46·47, 그리고 영역 규칙 둘을\n지금 코드에 맞춘다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e93e5206772b39b2a17a20b9b67964cfbccfc2b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/e93e5206772b39b2a17a20b9b67964cfbccfc2b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDg2ZTYyZjRmNjM2ODE5MjUwZWEzN2E5YjZhN2FhMWViYTNjOWRjNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/3732fcfed1d505f46781f3ff2d441bc63e9349e7","sha":"3732fcfed1d505f46781f3ff2d441bc63e9349e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/3732fcfed1d505f46781f3ff2d441bc63e9349e7"}],"sha":"86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/86e62f4f636819250ea37a9b6a7aa1eba3c9dc73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/3732fcfed1d505f46781f3ff2d441bc63e9349e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:29Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:29Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"test(host): MF 초기화가 init 에 넘긴 인자를 검사한다\n\n`loader/index.ts` 는 `mf/**` 에서 테스트가 없는 유일한 소스였다. seam 이 한 칸 위에\n있었다 — 정규화 프로브에는 테스트가 있는데, 이 저장소가 기록한 사고는 그 규칙 안이\n아니라 \"규칙이 다섯 개 전부에 똑같이 입혀졌는가\" 쪽이다.\n\n그래서 순수 함수가 아니라 `init()` 이 실제로 받은 인자를 본다 — shared 5키와 공통\n설정(`react-dom/client` 포함, 빼면 #RUNTIME-015), `remotes` 가 `pinnedEntry` 를\n쓰는지, 초기화가 한 번인지, `typeof window` 두 갈래.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df2aa0b6e98fa499bc3ec4b4aa9cbf395e8de50f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/df2aa0b6e98fa499bc3ec4b4aa9cbf395e8de