hub.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/398288a487604facbe1f64dbc2d467beb5a60190/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:29Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:29Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(remote-config): @mf-types 경로를 쓰는 쪽·읽는 쪽이 같이 본다\n\n`mf dts` 가 푸는 자리(`typesFolder`)와 `gen-module-ids` 가 읽는 자리가 각자 문자열을\n들고 있었다. 한쪽만 바꾸면 실패 메시지가 \"`pnpm mf:types` 를 먼저 돌리세요\" 로 나온다 —\n원인이 경로 불일치라는 힌트가 없어서 remote 를 띄워 다시 돌려도 같은 말만 반복된다.\n\n`CONTRACTS_TYPES_DIR` 하나로 모은다. tsconfig 와 `contract-check.ts` 의 리터럴은\n정적 해석이 필요해 남는다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"565a60069a8ecf944ab190dbd27957487a374722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/565a60069a8ecf944ab190dbd27957487a374722"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/398288a487604facbe1f64dbc2d467beb5a60190","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/