mment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:13Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(ui): hueVar 를 내보내 --hue 계약을 한 곳에 둔다\n\n비공개로 두자 `Panel`·`Badge` 로 감쌀 수 없는 자리 셋이\n`style={{ ''--hue'': x } as CSSProperties}` 를 그대로 베껴 갔다. 감추는 건 4줄짜리\n함수가 아니라 **변수 이름이 계약이라는 사실**이다 — 이름을 바꾸면 이 패키지의\n컴포넌트는 따라오고 베껴 간 쪽만 색을 잃는다. 타입 오류도 테스트 실패도 없이\n화면에서만 나타나는데, 여기서 hue 는 \"어느 remote 가 그렸나\" 를 판별하는 관측\n수단이라 관측 장치가 조용히 거짓말을 하게 된다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"478eb74b6f3233264f907f1126337327fcebeb52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/478eb74b6f3233264f907f1126337327fcebeb52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/42363fbfdc82afb608dc421f9654f59092f6e0fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/42363fbfdc82afb608dc421f9654f59092f6e0fa","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDQyMzYzZmJmZGM4MmFmYjYwOGRjNDIxZjk2NTRmNTkwOTJmNmUwZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10","sha":"5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10"}],"sha":"42363fbfdc82afb608dc421f9654f59092f6e0fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/42363fbfdc82afb608dc421f9654f59092f6e0fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:13Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:26:13Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(host): 콜백 없는 Section 래퍼를 걷어낸다\n\n`ProductDetailSection` 은 13줄 전부가 `RemoteComponent` 위임 한 번이었다.\n`useRouter` 콜백이 없어 `''use client''` 선언조차 필요 없었고, 감추는 것 없이\n새 remote 모듈에 세는 파일 수만 늘렸다.\n\n규칙으로 남긴다 — 콜백이 필요할 때만 Section 을 만든다(ADR-020 의 연장).\n관련 상품은 `onSelect` 가 있어 Section 이 남는다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c52d17132af5d57d5acfebd69b4623a8736918ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/c52d17132af5d57d5acfebd69b4623a8736918ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDViNWJiZWMxOWVmMzNkYTNmNDAyODc0MTIzZTJkZDkyZmE0ODRiMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/90db86d49fdf52b5ee2d71236673cc9fbc4f73d5","sha":"90db86d49fdf52b5ee2d71236673cc9fbc4f73d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/90db86d49fdf52b5ee2d71236673cc9fbc4f73d5"}],"sha":"5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5b5bbec19ef33da3f402874123e2dd92fa484b10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/90db86d49fdf52b5ee2d71236673cc9fbc4f73d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:25:59Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:25:59Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(host): 심어준 버전의 모양을 읽는 쪽이 소유하게 한다\n\n전역 이름(`REMOTE_VERSIONS_GLOBAL`)은 한 곳이었는데 그 전역에 들어가는\n`{ version, entry }` 모양은 `RemoteVersionSync` 안의 리터럴이라 `InjectedEntry` 와\n타입으로 묶여 있지 않았다. 필드 이름이 하나 어긋나면 컴파일은 통과하고 `?.entry` 만\nundefined 가 된다 — 증상은 에러가 아니라 버전 없는 폴백으로 조용히 붙는 것이다(G-1).\n\n직렬화를 `injectionScript` 로 읽는 쪽 옆에 뒀다. 그래서 왕복 테스트가 붙는다 —\n한쪽만 시험하면 어긋나도 양쪽이 초록이다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"413618dddcf0b7daad9300f5bbbf4b1d9f605996","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/413618dddcf0b7daad9300f5bbbf4b1d9f605996"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/90db86d49fdf52b5ee2d71236673cc9fbc4f73d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",