81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5fccfab8441adfb0cd86a1698abcb0e3d9311337/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:25:59Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:25:59Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(docker): 공유 엔트리포인트의 포트 폴백을 없앤다\n\n두 remote 가 같이 쓰는 스크립트에서 기본값은 곧 어느 한쪽의 포트다. 새 remote 의\nDockerfile 이 `ENV PORT` 를 빠뜨리면 컨테이너는 정상 기동하고 남의 포트로 뜬다 —\n증상이 부팅 실패가 아니라 \"host 만 그 remote 를 못 찾음\" 이라 원인까지 멀다.\n\n`remote-wiring.test.ts` 에 둘을 더한다. compose 헬스체크가 `versionManifest` 를\n찌르는지(파일명이 어긋나도 정적 서버 폴백이 200 이라 통과해 버린다), 그리고\n엔트리포인트에 폴백이 없는지.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f8ec63a2e52676a8fa1c8c884fc2932cd19e516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/3f8ec63a2e52676a8fa1c8c884fc2932cd19e516"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/5fccfab8441adfb0cd86a1698abcb0e3d9311337","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gi