sers/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/9957141877fb4f9a0dca666982f53c508bc4b197/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:25:45Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:25:45Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(host): 에러 경계가 런타임이 실제로 쓰는 주소를 찍게 한다\n\n`entry` 를 prop 으로 받았고 호출부 둘이 똑같이 `WEB_ENTRIES[remote]` 를 넘겼다.\n그건 dev 에만 실재하는 폴백이라, 배포에서 remote 가 죽으면 상자에 404 나는 주소가\n찍히고 정작 실패한 `/v<version>/mf-manifest.json` 은 어디에도 안 나왔다.\n\n경계가 `remoteName` 만 받고 에러 분기에서 `pinnedEntry` 를 스스로 부른다.\n`MfDiagnostics` 가 같은 함정을 먼저 밟고 고친 자리인데 경계만 남아 있었다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46e7a785bd0b1643797c847186ff17a4b16cbae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/46e7a785bd0b1643797c847186ff17a4b16cbae4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/9957141877fb4f9a0dca666982f53c508bc4b197","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}