ane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/afa4b46d862e3bfdaed0e885dfa9f7ffb52722c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:19:46Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:19:46Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"chore: graft 심볼 그래프를 저장소에 붙인다\n\ngrep·전체 읽기 대신 심볼 그래프로 코드를 찾게 한다. `graft init --no-statusline\n--agents claude` 로 Claude Code 배선만 넣었다 — statusLine 은 사용자 설정을\n덮어쓰지 않도록 뺐다.\n\nMCP 서버·훅·스킬은 커밋하고, 그래프 캐시(`/graft/`)는 재생성물이라 뺀다 —\n대신 `.ignore` 로 ripgrep 에는 다시 보이게 한다(카드는 검색돼야 한다).\n\n설치기가 넣은 파일은 prettier 대상에서 뺐다. 포맷하면 graft 를 재설치할\n때마다 원본과 어긋나 `format:check` 가 엉뚱한 곳에서 깨진다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0831f77eb5a574fe2903dd270076e7a0e70f08be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/0831f77eb5a574fe2903dd270076e7a0e70f08be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/afa4b46d862e3bfdaed0e885dfa9f7ffb52722c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane