뀌면 계속 충돌한다.\n\n같이: `visible()` 도 줄 앞에 온 `<details>` 만 블록으로 본다. 앞선 커밋에서\n`details_blocks` · `outside_details` 만 고쳐서, 첫 화면 산문 줄이 12줄로\n잘못 세어지고 있었다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"49d66b20150766cffad44a640448565dfaee8e18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/49d66b20150766cffad44a640448565dfaee8e18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/97e27b39229041168779031508ffd8918495baa5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/97e27b39229041168779031508ffd8918495baa5","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDk3ZTI3YjM5MjI5MDQxMTY4Nzc5MDMxNTA4ZmZkODkxODQ5NWJhYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/f94f895cba8844380eda30b1353dd0fd578c3cc7","sha":"f94f895cba8844380eda30b1353dd0fd578c3cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f94f895cba8844380eda30b1353dd0fd578c3cc7"}],"sha":"97e27b39229041168779031508ffd8918495baa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/97e27b39229041168779031508ffd8918495baa5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f94f895cba8844380eda30b1353dd0fd578c3cc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:44:30Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:44:30Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs(skill): 분량 숫자를 지킬 선이 아니라 되돌아볼 신호로 낮춘다\n\n\"첫 화면 산문 20줄\" 을 선으로 읽으면 숫자를 맞추려고 표를 문장으로 되돌리게 된다.\n그건 이 규칙이 막으려던 바로 그 행동이다.\n\n- 진짜 기준을 한 줄로 못박는다 — 핵심이 눈에 들어오나. 판단 넷이 또렷하면 30줄이어도\n  되고, 같은 말을 돌려 하면 20줄이 안 돼도 실패다\n- 눈에 보이는 쪽이 낫다는 것을 명시한다. 표를 넣을지 고민되면 넣는 쪽\n- 배선·흐름이 바뀌는 PR 을 위해 mermaid 를 형태 표에 넣는다 (노드 5~6개까지)\n- 채점기의 산문 줄 지표도 1.5배까지는 통과시킨다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"5b48b68e0157ee2b1ee1fbc05002d