events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/1654b0724f698ff82cff05ae4eed6ced93fc4276/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:38:50Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:38:50Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(skill): 본문이 <details> 를 언급만 해도 섹션이 사라지던 채점 버그를 고친다\n\n`<details>.*?</details>` 를 줄 위치 없이 매치해서, 본문에 그 태그 이름이 글로\n나오면 거기서부터 접힌 블록 끝까지가 통째로 잘렸다. 이 PR 본문처럼 섹션 제목에\n`<details>` 가 들어가면 뒤 섹션이 전부 없는 것으로 채점된다.\n\n- 줄 앞에 온 것만 블록으로 본다\n- 평행 열거 검사는 \"앞 35줄 아래\" 라는 위치 대신 번호 섹션 안을 본다.\n  요약 표를 앞에 둔 본문이 잘못 걸렸다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"cb436bf9e761a297e3cce68308408daba965bc90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/cb436bf9e761a297e3cce68308408daba965bc90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/1654b0724f698ff82cff05ae4eed6ced93fc4276","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av