ps://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/cd875925f5a6f12ad013865435a7678d19ed9d35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:36:49Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:36:49Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"test(skill): PR 본문 채점을 총 줄이 아니라 산문 줄로 한다\n\n채점기가 총 줄만 세면 표를 문장으로 되돌린 본문이 더 높은 점수를 받는다.\nprose_only() 로 표·인용·불릿·코드를 걷어낸 뒤 남는 줄만 센다.\n\n- 형태 assertion 둘을 추가한다 (섹션의 위험 문장이 인용·굵게인가,\n  평행 열거가 표·불릿인가)\n- 장황한 본문 다시 쓰기 케이스의 감축률을 글자 수에서 산문 줄로 바꾸고,\n  원문 표를 문장으로 되돌리지 않았는지 본다\n\n실제 PR 본문 세 판본으로 대조하면 갈린다 — 형태로 쓴 것 14/14,\n산문으로 압축한 것 11/14.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"ff3584c6303a1da3429cbea15f915e3a953f1244","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/ff3584c6303a1da3429cbea15f915e3a953f1244"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/cd875925f5a6f12ad013865435a7678d19ed9d35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/cd875925f5a6f12ad013865435a7678d19ed9d35","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGNkODc1OTI1ZjVhNmYxMmFkMDEzODY1NDM1YTc2NzhkMTllZDlkMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/951ae81339a99972a2e6889867cdadca7618dfd4","sha":"951ae81339a99972a2e6889867cdadca7618dfd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/951ae81339a99972a2e6889867cdadca7618dfd4"}],"sha":"cd875925f5a6f12ad013865435a7678d19ed9d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/cd875925f5a6f12ad013865435a7678d19ed9d35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/951ae81339a99972a2e6889867cdadca7618dfd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:36:49Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:36:49Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs(skill): PR 본문을 산문이 아니라 형태로 쓰게 한다\n\n분량 기준이 \"첫 화면 50줄\" 하나뿐이라, 스킬을 따르면 표·인용을 문장으로 풀어\n줄 수만 줄이는 쪽으로 최적화된다. 같은 PR 을 두 벌로 써 보니 총 14줄을 줄이면서\n읽어야 하는 산문은 16 → 29줄로 늘었다.\n\n- 형태별 용도 표를 추가한다 (인용 = 섹션의 가장 위험한 문장, 섹션 안 표 = 평행 열거,\n  ```ts = 바뀐 뒤의 호출 모양)\n- 분량 기준을 총 줄에서 산문 줄로 바꾼다 (첫 화면 산문 20줄, 전체는 100줄까지)\n- <details> 를 3~5줄로 깎으라는 규칙을 뺀다. 접힌 블록은 첫 화면 비용이 0 이라\n  길이 대신 개수를 제한하고, 안쪽 표는 그대로 둔다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"6d5f2254545a76d0a18bc4e24b6c3e3d45ae66eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/6d5f2254545a76d0a18bc4e24b6c3e3d45ae66eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/951ae81339a99972a2e6889867cdadca7618dfd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cha