"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/f11d1bd8c08667b6f5ab0529dd0dbf03cb466030","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGYxMWQxYmQ4YzA4NjY3YjZmNWFiMDUyOWRkMGRiZjAzY2I0NjYwMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/eecacf60ab4f62501b4bd38ca4ebdc214e2fd7f2","sha":"eecacf60ab4f62501b4bd38ca4ebdc214e2fd7f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/eecacf60ab4f62501b4bd38ca4ebdc214e2fd7f2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33","sha":"86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33"}],"sha":"f11d1bd8c08667b6f5ab0529dd0dbf03cb466030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f11d1bd8c08667b6f5ab0529dd0dbf03cb466030"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:09:53Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:09:53Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs(skill): 섹션 규칙을 줄 수가 아니라 \"판단 하나\" 로 바꾸고 예시를 갱신한다\n\n세 케이스가 전부 섹션 산문 6~7줄에서 걸렸는데 결과물은 문제가 없었다.\n상한 5가 현실과 안 맞는 숫자였던 것이다. 숫자를 세는 것보다 \"한 섹션 =\n판단 하나\" 가 실제 규칙이고, 섹션이 길어졌다면 대개 판단 둘이 섞였거나\n접을 배경이 붙은 것이다 — 그쪽을 먼저 보게 했다.\n\n- 분량 표: 섹션 산문 \"2~4줄\" → \"짧은 문단 2~3개\"\n- 채점: 5줄 상한 → 참고 지표 8줄\n- 예시를 iteration-4 산출물로 교체 — ③ 확인 부탁과 3줄 diff 가 둘 다 들어 있다\n\niteration-4 기준 48/49 (98%). 남은 1건은 첫 화면 1줄 초과라는 참고 지표다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"e9b2eb584626fd84445a33e07f3966557d5523a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/e9b2eb584626fd84445a33e07f3966557d5523a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDg2YmNjZjQ2MWY1NmU3OWQ3M2ZkYTFkMmYwZjI0Yzc4ZGFmZTFiMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130","sha":"7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130"}],"sha":"86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/86bccf461f56e79d73fda1d2f0f24c78dafe1b33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:05:59Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:05:59Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"feat(skill): 짧은 before/after diff 를 ① 의 주력 장치로 승격한다\n\n축을 \"리뷰를 잘 받는 것\" 으로 옮기면서 diff 조언을 뼈대 절 끝으로 밀었더니,\n기계적 치환 케이스에서 대표 diff 가 통째로 사라졌다(eval-2: i1 2줄 → i2 2줄 →\ni3 0개). 사용자가 그 회귀를 짚었다.\n\n치환이 33곳이면 그 모양을 두 줄로 한 번만 보여주는 게 ① 을 가장 싸게 한다 —\n리뷰어가 나머지 32곳을 패턴으로 확인하고 한 줄씩 읽지 않는다. \"moment 호출을\nformatDate 로 바꿨습니다\" 라는 문장은 같은 일을 못 한다. 읽고 나서도 실제 모양을\n모르니 결국 diff 를 열어봐야 한다.\n\n- ① 절 안으로 옮기고 예시와 근거를 붙였다\n- \"바뀐 줄만 넣는다 — 컨텍스트 줄도 함수 전체도 아니다\" 로 규칙을 구체화했다\n- assertion 둘 추가: diff 블록 6줄 이하 / 치환 케이스에 대표 diff 존재\n- 재실행에서 회귀 해소 확인 (eval-2 FAIL → PASS)\n\nevals/render_compare.py 를 같이 넣는다. 기본 eval 뷰어가 .md 를 raw 텍스트로\n넣어서 표·details·diff 가 안 보였다 — 마크다운을 렌더해 나란히 비교한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"c9007a50383e3e58695bef0ebd4ee9e49873d001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/c9007a50383e3e58695bef0ebd4ee9e49873d001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDdiZjA3MjI0ODE0ZjY0MGU4YjUwNzZlM2IyYjUwNDg0NzMwOWExMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c","sha":"ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c"}],"sha":"7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7bf07224814f640e8b5076e3b2b504847309a130"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:00:29Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:00:29Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(skill): PR 스킬의 축을 분량에서 \"리뷰를 잘 받는 것\" 으로 옮긴다\n\niteration-2 까지 스킬이 \"예산 준수 도구\" 가 돼 있었다. 짧게는 만드는데\n리뷰어는 여전히 어디를 봐야 할지 모른다 — 목적을 수단으로 바꿔놓은 것이다.\n\n본문이 할 일은 리뷰어의 시선을 배분하는 것이고, 그러려면 셋이 필요하다.\n① 어디를 봐야 하나 (판단이 들어간 자리 / 기계적인 자리를 갈라준다)\n② 무엇이 위험한가 (동작 변경·되돌리기 어려운 곳)\n③ 무엇을 확인해 달라는가 (확신 없는 것 — 없으면 LGTM 만 온다)\n\n분량 표는 남기되 \"목표가 아니라 안 읽히지 않으려고 지키는 선\" 으로 격하했다.\n\n채점도 같이 바꿨다. 줄 수 대신 위 셋을 직접 잰다. 그랬더니 ③ 이 이전 두\n버전에서 0/3 이었다 — 리뷰를 구체적으로 받아내는 가장 강한 장치인데 스킬이\n아예 안 가르치고 있었다. 새 스킬로 3/3 이 됐고, eval-2 는 ③ 을 넣고도\n51→44줄로 짧아졌다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"63c44d98a5bc1994c2594a8faef429e370674f03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/63c44d98a5bc1994c2594a8faef429e370674f03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGVjNmMzMGIxZTA1MDZmZTU2MjM3NjdjNjk1MzE5YzFmZTk0N2MwMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c","sha":"8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c"}],"sha":"ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/ec6c30b1e0506fe5623767c695319c1fe947c00c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:27:33Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:27:33Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"feat(skill): PR 스킬에 분량 예산과 \"무엇을 버리나\" 를 넣는다\n\neval 3케이스로 스킬 있음/없음을 돌렸더니, 스킬이 핵심 주장을 못 지키고 있었다 —\n첫 화면(details 접힌 상태) 줄 수가 오히려 baseline 보다 길었고(93 vs 71),\n\"장황해서 다시 써줘\" 케이스에서 원문의 88% 밖에 못 줄였다(baseline 58%).\n\n원인은 \"접는 건 버리는 게 아니다\" 한 문장이었다. 모델이 이걸 \"전부 보존하라\" 로\n읽어서 원문 문단마다 <details> 로 갈 곳을 만들어줬다. 접기만 가르치고 버리기를\n안 가르친 것이다.\n\n- 예산 표를 넣었다 (첫 화면 50줄 · 섹션 3~4개 · details 3개) + 쓰고 나서 세게 했다\n- \"무엇을 버리나\" 절을 새로 넣었다 — 표/diff/커밋 탭에 이미 있는 것\n- <details> 를 \"창고가 아니라 각주\" 로 다시 정의했다\n- 섹션 단위를 커밋이 아니라 \"리뷰어가 따로 이해해야 하는 것\" 으로 바꿨다\n- 예시를 예산 지킨 것으로 교체했다 (무엇이 버려졌는지 대조표 포함)\n\n결과: 첫 화면 93→47 · 63→34 · 64→51, rewrite 압축률 88%→42%,\nassertion 통과율 82%→92%. 비용은 거의 같다(+2k 토큰).\n\nevals/ 에 픽스처 3개와 채점 스크립트를 같이 둔다 — 다음에 고칠 때 다시 돌린다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"a0e26df01f3509f619bf77ddac080ceb8c2d3003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/a0e26df01f3509f619bf77ddac080ceb8c2d3003"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDhmZDhkZDNkMTg5OWZkZWNlNjAzNzQyMjkzMWI2MjQxZDQ5ZjVjNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5","sha":"f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5"}],"sha":"8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/8fd8dd3d1899fdece6037422931b6241d49f5c4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:02:01Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:02:01Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"feat(skill): PR 작성 스킬을 프로젝트에 넣는다\n\nPR 본문을 쓰다 보면 작업하며 알게 된 것을 전부 적게 되는데, 리뷰어는 그 맥락이\n없어서 긴 본문을 만나면 읽지 않고 diff 로 내려간다. 본문의 목적을 \"설명문\" 이\n아니라 \"리뷰어를 diff 의 올바른 자리로 데려가는 안내판\" 으로 다시 잡고,\n근거·기각한 대안·밟은 함정은 <details> 로 접는 규칙을 담았다.\n\nreferences/example.md 에 실제 PR 본문(#13) 을 예시로 붙였다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"135694661673e240bc587a34a243a8caacbd8563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/135694661673e240bc587a34a243a8caacbd8563"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGY1YTI1ZGQ3NTFlYThkYjkyOTcxZTFmZmRhYWZjYmQ2YjlkODlhYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/eecacf60ab4f62501b4bd38ca4ebdc214e2fd7f2","sha":"eecacf60ab4f62501b4bd38ca4ebdc214e2fd7f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/eecacf60ab4f62501b4bd38ca4ebdc214e2fd7f2"}],"sha":"f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f5a25dd751ea8db92971e1ffdaafcbd6b9d89ab5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/a4e83ce7574fa1811f54da360f6fd69625e0fadb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:31:53Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:31:53Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 배포 예외를 두지 않기로 한 근거를 ADR-025 에 남긴다\n\n기각한 안과 그 사고 방향을 표로 남겨, 다음에 같은 구멍을 파려 할 때\n읽을 것이 있게 한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"3def21db94d31a070bd234c50b8c5ce8adcc74a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/3def21db94d31a070bd234c50b8c5ce8adcc74a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/a4e83ce7574fa1811f54da360f6fd69625e0fadb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/a4e83ce7574fa1811f54da360f6fd69625e0fadb","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGE0ZTgzY2U3NTc0ZmExODExZjU0ZGEzNjBmNmZkNjk2MjVlMGZhZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5","sha":"d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5"}],"sha":"a4e83ce7574fa1811f54da360f6fd69625e0fadb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/a4e83ce7574fa1811f54da360f6fd69625e0fadb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:31:53Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:31:53Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"Revert \"fix(deploy): 이미지에 안 들어가는 패키지가 전체 재배포를 부르지 않게 한다\"\n\nThis reverts commit cdb4c8f.\n\n두 선택의 사고가 대칭이 아니다. 통짜로 두면 안 바뀐 이미지를 다시 올릴 뿐이고\n즉시 무해하지만, 구멍을 파면 바뀐 코드가 배포에 안 실리고 증상은\n\"고쳤는데 반영이 안 된다\" 뿐이다.\n\n이름이 @mfa/utils 라 더 그렇다 — 범용 이름은 범용으로 쓰이게 되고, 프로덕션\n유틸이 하나 들어오는 순간 구멍이 조용한 사고가 된다. 그때 메우는 걸 기억해야\n성립하는 안전은 안전이 아니다.\n\npackages/utils 도 전체 배포를 부르는지 \"공유 코드는 전부 배포한다\" 가 본다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"ac27de1c3de7b0a88d644a4d38f0a1d85fd8a9bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/ac27de1c3de7b0a88d644a4d38f0a1d85fd8a9bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGQwZTZhM2Y2ZGFjZTNjNWI4ZmJiMjRkMmUzM2Q3YzY2NGExYWQ1YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/7c63e125aedea526660220b7e35cf760640e3955","sha":"7c63e125aedea526660220b7e35cf760640e3955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7c63e125aedea526660220b7e35cf760640e3955"}],"sha":"d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d0e6a3f6dace3c5b8fbb24d2e33d7c664a1ad5b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7c63e125aedea526660220b7e35cf760640e3955/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:09:58Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:09:58Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 헬퍼 패키지 이동과 배포 예외를 ADR-025 로 남긴다\n\n41차 기록 보강, 테스트 계획 45번, known-issues H-2·F-3 에 이동 후 달라진 점.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"2b3bbcc5e81a93212c5582655d78bb7458815e7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/2b3bbcc5e81a93212c5582655d78bb7458815e7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/7c63e125aedea526660220b7e35cf760640e3955","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com