m/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/cdb4c8fb969896ba068fb50fbad96272f3d85bce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:09:58Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:09:58Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(deploy): 이미지에 안 들어가는 패키지가 전체 재배포를 부르지 않게 한다\n\nSHARED_DEPLOY_PATHS 의 ''packages/'' 는 통짜 규칙이라, 테스트 전용 패키지가\n생기면 헬퍼 한 줄에 remote 둘과 host 가 전부 재배포된다.\nDEPLOY_IGNORED_PATHS 로 구멍을 뚫되, 그 목록의 패키지가 앱의 런타임\n의존성이 아닌지는 테스트가 본다 — 반대 방향 사고는 \"고쳤는데 반영이 안 된다\"\n로만 보인다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CnFGJ4eLpZtD9GJKk7dURq","tree":{"sha":"6a2e5591def01159228141a28f2063dfb5155f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/6a2e5591def01159228141a28f2063dfb5155f45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/cdb4c8fb969896ba068fb50fbad96272f3d85bce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/