같이 넣었다 —\n서브패스 진입점을 새로 import 하는 테스트는 dist 를 치우고 한 번 돌려본다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"a20a0e3c04afff85991318763f72090f39ebc588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/a20a0e3c04afff85991318763f72090f39ebc588"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/38ad33b253ff7f5688ab0d7f6965177027ef4984","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/38ad33b253ff7f5688ab0d7f6965177027ef4984","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDM4YWQzM2IyNTNmZjdmNTY4OGFiMGQ3ZjY5NjUxNzcwMjdlZjQ5ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724","sha":"f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724"}],"sha":"38ad33b253ff7f5688ab0d7f6965177027ef4984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/38ad33b253ff7f5688ab0d7f6965177027ef4984"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:37:21Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:37:21Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(test): @mfa/contracts/remote 를 vitest alias 에 올린다\n\nCI 의 test job 만 죽었다. 로컬은 677개 전부 초록이었다.\n\n  Failed to resolve import \"@mfa/contracts/remote\" from\n  \"apps/host/src/components/lab/MfWarmup.tsx\"\n\nalias 목록에 그 서브패스가 없어서 `exports` 를 타고 dist 로 떨어졌다.\n배럴 항목은 `/^@mfa\\/contracts$/` 라 서브패스를 안 삼킨다 — 접두사 매치의\n부작용을 피하려고 `$` 로 닫아둔 것이라 의도한 동작이다.\n\n로컬에서 안 걸린 이유는 dist 가 남아 있어서다. CI 는 fresh clone 이고\ntest job 은 빌드를 안 돌리므로 거기서만 없다. vi.mock 으로도 안 막힌다 —\n죽는 주체는 러너가 아니라 vite 의 import-analysis 이고, 그건 테스트가 아니라\n소스 파일의 import 를 해석하다 죽는다.\n\nalias 를 추가하고 모킹을 걷어내 진짜 MODULE_IDS 를 쓴다. 캐시 상한도\n절대값 대신 REMOTE_NAMES 로 써서 실행 순서와 remote 수에 안 묶이게 했다.\n\n검증: dist 를 전부 치우고(fresh clone 흉내) `pnpm test` — 49파일 677개 통과.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"38b94ab1213bfc0b9742015619f6305948a5551f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/38b94ab1213bfc0b9742015619f6305948a5551f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGYwMzI1MjQ0MTBmNGM0NWExY2JiMWRmMDY3MmNiNmMwYTRiNWE3MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/3c4f8ab8a59ba6bde5768a171b755a736ce4535f","sha":"3c4f8ab8a59ba6bde5768a171b755a736ce4535f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/3c4f8ab8a59ba6bde5768a171b755a736ce4535f"}],"sha":"f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/f032524410f4c45a1cbb1df0672cb6c0a4b5a724"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/6a7739d6e72194cd429746011eaf3d0b1a74cd10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:34:52Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:34:52Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"build: 로컬 compose 기동을 pnpm 스크립트로 만든다\n\nhost **빌드**가 프리렌더 도중 remote 의 SSR 번들을 HTTP 로 받아 실행하므로, 이미지를\n만들기 전에 remote 가 실제로 서빙 중이어야 한다. `depends_on` 은 런타임 순서지 빌드\n순서가 아니라 이걸 못 해준다. 그래서 세 서비스에 healthcheck 를 두고 `up --wait` 로\n그 대기를 compose 에 맡긴다. 지금까지 이 대기는 `scripts/docker-host-local.sh` 의\nprobe 에만 있었다.\n\n`MFA_HOST_IP` 는 `docker:up` 이 셸 변수로 그 자리에서 넘긴다 — 파일로 안 남긴다.\n기본값 `unset-mfa-host-ip` 를 둔 건 그 변수 없이도 `down`·`logs`·`ps` 가 돌게 하려는\n것이다(compose 는 대상 서비스와 무관하게 파일 전체를 보간한다). 이 기본값으로 빌드가\n돌아가면 DNS 가 그 이름에서 즉시 죽어 원인이 이름으로 드러난다.\n\nhealthcheck 는 node 의 fetch 를 쓴다 — 런너가 node:slim 이라 curl 이 없다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PfQnHiHZFNBdsnsAqgWsDf","tree":{"sha":"335ec19c7d38bbccf8ae3954d699e9c1500bdf6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/335ec19c7d38bbccf8ae3954d699e9c1500bdf6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/6a7739d6e72194cd429746011eaf3d0b1a74cd10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/6a7739d6e72194cd429746011eaf3d0b1a74cd10","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDZhNzczOWQ2ZTcyMTk0Y2Q0Mjk3NDYwMTFlYWYzZDBiMWE3NGNkMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/5ba2ffd7e6aa7f8a73da5ed15c76ea6c7dee96a5","sha":"5ba2ffd7e6aa7f8a73da5ed15c76ea6c7dee96a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5ba2ffd7e6aa7f8a73da5ed15c76ea6c7dee96a5"}],"sha":"6a7739d6e72194cd429746011eaf3d0b1a74cd10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/6a7739d6e72194cd429746011eaf3d0b1a74cd10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/3c4f8ab8a59ba6bde5768a171b755a736ce4535f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:44Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:44Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 40차 — 교체하며 조용히 빠진 성질들을 기록한다\n\n이번에 고친 여섯 건 중 셋이 같은 모양이었다. 무언가를 더 나은 것으로\n교체했는데 옛것이 덤으로 갖고 있던 성질 하나가 같이 안 따라왔다 —\n러너 Node 고정, --kill-others 의 시그널 전달, 글롭 완전일치 검사.\n셋 다 터지는 조건이 우리 커밋 밖에 있다.\n\n- I-12 신설: .ts 를 러너의 주변 Node 로 돌리면 이미지가 바뀔 때 조용히\n  깨진다. 증상 색인에 ERR_UNKNOWN_FILE_EXTENSION 한 줄 추가\n- B-2 에 후속 노트: 결론은 그대로고 그 한 줄의 내용만 바뀌었다\n- test-plan 41~43. 38차의 deploy-targets.test.ts 와 PR #10 의\n  docker-context.test.ts 가 진척도 표에 빠져 있어 같이 채웠다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"4ec93be5ce895a74c4da6fe81726c949062dccb7","url":"https://api.gith