ttps://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/16f42731ef75e9e27881882e61fe0d5db616c6b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:34Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:34Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: concurrently 를 가리키던 기록을 지금 코드에 맞춘다\n\nhost 의 build 스크립트가 38차에 serve-all-remotes.ts 로 바뀌었는데 시작\n가이드는 아직 옛 concurrently 명령을 코드블록으로 보여주고 있었다.\n존재하지 않는 명령을 가르치고, 하필 그 변경이 없앤 catalog/cart 하드코딩을\n그대로 남긴다. ci.yml 과 turbo.json 의 주석도 같은 상태였다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"496b85d90e439433494b60dd79112b9f32cfd035","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/496b85d90e439433494b60dd79112b9f32cfd035"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/16f42731ef75e9e27881882e61fe0d5db616c6b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/16f42731ef75e9e27881882e61fe0d5db616c6b2","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDE2ZjQyNzMxZWY3NWU5ZTI3ODgxODgyZTYxZmUwZDVkYjYxNmM2YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509","sha":"5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509"}],"sha":"16f42731ef75e9e27881882e61fe0d5db616c6b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/16f42731ef75e9e27881882e61fe0d5db616c6b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:34Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:34Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(host): warm 의 lazy 캐시를 remote 당 한 칸으로 줄인다\n\n웹훅이 주는 nonce 는 요청마다 유일하다(`api/mf-revalidate` 가\n`버전-Date.now()` 로 만든다). 그 키를 그대로 쌓고 있어서 warm 한 번마다\n엔트리가 하나씩 늘었다. 축출 경로가 없고 host 는 장수 프로세스라 영영 줄지\n않는다 — lazy 가 붙든 payload 까지 같이 남는다. RemoteComponent 의\nlazyCache 에 있던 같은 결함을 두 번째 캐시로 복제한 꼴이다.\n\n캐시가 필요한 이유는 \"한 렌더 안에서 같은 프라미스를 재사용\" 뿐이라 과거\nnonce 를 들고 있을 이유가 없다. 새 nonce 가 오면 그 remote 의 칸을 덮어쓴다.\n밀려난 컴포넌트를 렌더 중인 트리는 자기 참조를 계속 들고 있으므로 영향이 없다.\n\n축출은 코드를 읽어서는 회귀를 알아채기 어렵고 증상이 한참 뒤 메모리로만\n나타나서, 캐시 크기를 직접 보는 테스트를 붙였다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"ba597aec2fb808b4e33a63e42c7d18b9c5fccd09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/ba597aec2fb808b4e33a63e42c7d18b9c5fccd09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDVkYmFjYzEyOGEyMzlhODA3NmEwYTRkYmIyZTc0NzY1ZDNmZGM1MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab","sha":"4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab"}],"sha":"5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5dbacc128a239a8076a0a4dbb2e74765d3fdc509"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:19Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:19Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(scripts): serve-all-remotes 가 받은 시그널을 자식에게 넘긴다\n\n`concurrently --kill-others` 를 이 스크립트로 바꾸면서 시그널 전달이 같이\n빠졌다. 감독 프로세스만 SIGTERM 을 받으면(CI 취소, turbo 의 태스크 종료)\nshutdown 을 안 거치고 죽어서 `next build` 가 고아로 남고 `.next` 에 계속\n쓴다. 다음 빌드가 반쯤 쓰인 산출물을 문다.\n\nSIGINT · SIGTERM 을 자식에게 넘기고, 응답하지 않으면 5초 뒤 SIGKILL 로\n정리한다. 시그널 핸들러를 달면 Node 의 기본 종료가 사라지고 정적 서버가\n열려 있는 한 이벤트 루프도 안 비어서, 그 안전장치가 없으면 감독이 남는다.\n\n실측(검증일: 2026-09-06). 감독에게만 SIGTERM 을 보냈을 때\n  고침 전: 자식 sleep 고아로 남음\n  고침 후: 자식도 같이 종료됨\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"9976c95122c73d0d8cbb94d05b6a81e8dba5f2c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/9976c95122c73d0d8cbb94d05b6a81e8dba5f2c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDRiNDE0MmIzNjk1ZTk4ZmE0MjdjNmZjNjA1NzU2ZDU5OGY5NzNkYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13","sha":"dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13"}],"sha":"4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/4b4142b3695e98fa427c6fc605756d598f973dab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:19Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:19Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"test(scripts): 워크스페이스 글롭 파서가 모르는 모양을 건너뛰지 않게 한다\n\n파서가 `''<dir>/*''` 만 골라 담고 나머지는 조용히 건너뛰고 있었다.\n`- ''tools/**''` 같은 항목이 늘면 그 디렉터리만 빠지는데, 남은 항목이 있으니\n`dirs.length > 0` 검사는 통과한다. 그 밑의 패키지가 Dockerfile 의 deps 목록과\n한 번도 대조되지 않는 상태 — 이 테스트가 막으려던 I-10 드리프트가 테스트\n안에서 재발하는 것이다. 대체되기 전 옛 테스트는 글롭 집합을 완전일치로 봐서\n그 상황에 크게 실패했다.\n\n못 읽는 글롭에는 던진다. 스캔 범위도 `packages:` 블록으로 좁혔다 —\n파일 전체에 돌리면 onlyBuiltDependencies 의 항목까지 워크스페이스 글롭으로\n오인해 엉뚱한 자리를 가리키는 실패를 낸다.\n\n파서를 `parseWorkspaceDirs` 로 떼어 세 경우에 테스트를 붙였다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"86c378e20a433cca906f89a3cf29253cf350d647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/86c378e20a433cca906f89a3cf29253cf350d647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGRjMzZlNDJmY2E1OGM5NDQyMjhkZDA4ZmUxMjE3ZTAwMWZlYWNjMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/da8f1ea403a52a03dc2807170de640c9e47a862b","sha":"da8f1ea403a52a03dc2807170de640c9e47a862b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/da8f1ea403a52a03dc2807170de640c9e47a862b"}],"sha":"dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/dc36e42fca58c944228dd08fe1217e001feacc13"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/da8f1ea403a52a03dc2807170de640c9e47a862b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:02Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:21:02Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"ci(detect): 배포 대상 판별이 도는 Node 를 고정한다\n\n`node scripts/deploy-targets.ts` 는 타입 스트리핑에 기대는데(Node 22.18+,\n무플래그 23.6+) 그 job 에는 런타임을 고정하는 스텝이 없었다. 러너 이미지에\n딸려 오는 Node 를 그대로 쓰고 있었다는 뜻이다.\n\nci.yml 의 세 job 은 전부 `node@^24.19.0` 을 고정하고 engines 도 같은 범위인데\n여기만 빠져 있었다. 이미지가 옛 Node 로 갱신되면 ERR_UNKNOWN_FILE_EXTENSION\n하나로 detect 가 죽고, detect 가 죽으면 deploy 의 나머지 job 은 전부 안 뜬다.\n터지는 조건이 우리 커밋 밖에 있는 자리다.\n\n`pnpm/setup@v2` 를 `install: false` 로 넣는다. 의존성을 안 받는 성질은\n그대로 두고 런타임만 고정한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai2FHZs43CpNNj9nAgnRXV","tree":{"sha":"a96961d2318402d5482e8cc6eec8e1993f928aee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/a96961d2318402d5482e8cc6eec8e1993f928aee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/da8f1ea403a52a03dc2807170de640c9e47a862b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https