id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/5ba2ffd7e6aa7f8a73da5ed15c76ea6c7dee96a5","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDViYTJmZmQ3ZTZhYTdmOGE3M2RhNWVkMTVjNzZlYTZjN2RlZTk2YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/87ac5d929fc81fb28be92c925c2882bb2e65c2d0","sha":"87ac5d929fc81fb28be92c925c2882bb2e65c2d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/87ac5d929fc81fb28be92c925c2882bb2e65c2d0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727","sha":"46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727"}],"sha":"5ba2ffd7e6aa7f8a73da5ed15c76ea6c7dee96a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/5ba2ffd7e6aa7f8a73da5ed15c76ea6c7dee96a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:42:57Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:42:57Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 이미지 빌드 job 을 뺀 근거를 ADR-023 으로 남긴다\n\n38차의 판단을 다음 회차에 뒤집었으므로 지우지 않고 남긴다. ADR-021 의 해당\n결과 두 줄에 취소선을 긋고 ADR-023 으로 넘겼고, 38차 진행 기록에는 포인터만\n달았다 — 그때 서술은 그때 판단 그대로 둔다.\n\n되돌린 이유가 비용이 아니라 값이 0 이어서라는 걸 적었다. 실측 비용은 GHA\n캐시 덕에 총 1분 남짓이었고, 38차 주석의 \"길다\" 는 재보지 않고 쓴 말이었다.\n\n게이트로 만드는 안(브랜치 보호 + required checks)의 기각 사유도 남겼다.\nmain 에 들어온 머지 10건 중 PR 을 거친 건 하나뿐이라, 그 경로에서는 required\ncheck 가 아무것도 안 막으면서 push 만 거부한다.\n\nknown-issues I-10 의 \"두 겹의 검사\" 표는 한 겹으로 줄이고, 그래서 이 함정의\n다른 형태가 나오면 여전히 배포가 최초 검증이라는 걸 명시했다.\n\n39차 기록에는 이 결정이 나온 경위를 넣었다 — ci.yml 머리말의 job 수를\n고치다 \"이 셋이 뭘 막나\" 를 묻게 됐다. 교훈은 \"검사를 만들었다\"와 \"무언가를\n막는다\"가 다른 말이라는 것이다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"bbb5d4d2a2adc04d64732961529e99085f388883","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/bbb5d4d2a2adc04d64732961529e99085f388883"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDQ2MTc3ZGJhYzBhNmU2YzQwYmU3NDUwZWRhYzE4OTdhYjE4ZDI3Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286","sha":"c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286"}],"sha":"46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/46177dbac0a6e6c40be7450edac1897ab18d2727"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:42:43Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:42:43Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"ci: 아무것도 막지 못하던 이미지 빌드 job 셋을 걷어낸다\n\n38차에 docker-targets · docker-remotes · docker-host 를 만들었는데 게이트가\n아니었다. deploy 워크플로에 needs: ci 도 workflow_run 도 없고 main 에 브랜치\n보호도 없어서 두 워크플로가 같은 push 에 나란히 뜬다 — CI 가 빨개도 배포는\n그대로 나갔다. 게다가 push: false 라 만든 이미지를 버리고 Dokploy 가 같은\nDockerfile 로 다시 빌드했다.\n\n이미지가 깨지면 dokploy-deploy 가 deployment.all 의 status 로 잡는다.\n목록 드리프트(I-10) 자체는 docker-context.test.ts 가 오프라인으로 계속 잡고,\n이제 그게 유일한 방어선이라 주석에 그렇게 적었다.\n\n게이트로 만드는 안은 기각했다 — 근거는 ADR-023.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"a1efbc95f9e83f4a1452fd36272771902e788f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/a1efbc95f9e83f4a1452fd36272771902e788f56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGMzNTBmZDdhOWQyMjc4ODA4ZWIzNmZmMWI1YWNhNWIyZjhiMmIyODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832","sha":"a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832"}],"sha":"c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/c350fd7a9d2278808eb36ff1b5aca5b2f8b2b286"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:29:32Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:29:32Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 38차 리뷰와 그 반영을 39차로 기록한다\n\n두 축(Standards · Spec)으로 나눠 본 이유와, 축을 섞었으면 묻혔을 발견을\n남긴다. 이 저장소는 이슈를 안 쓰므로 Spec 축의 기준이 이 diff 가 스스로 쓴\n문서였고, 그래서 \"구현이 스펙과 다른가\"보다 \"기록이 코드보다 많이 주장하는가\"가\n더 많이 나왔다.\n\n고치지 않고 근거만 남긴 것 넷(HOST_WORKSPACE_DIR · eventName · reloadKey ·\nADR-022 커밋 분리)도 적었다.\n\nMfWarmup 은 테스트가 없고 /internal/mf-warm 이 프리렌더를 안 타서 실제로\n돌려 확인했다. 첫 호출만 cart:2 로 나오는 dev 최초 컴파일 아티팩트가 있어서\n델타를 세 번 쟀다 — 한 번만 재면 회귀로 오진한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"ebefa903aad1a8974274bf2993057d83275587ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/ebefa903aad1a8974274bf2993057d83275587ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGE3Y2RlMjFhNDhkMmViMjIyZGJlNjU2ZjIwZDNlNDBmODQ5ODE4MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa","sha":"7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa"}],"sha":"a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/a7cde21a48d2eb222dbe656f20d3e40f84981832"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:29:22Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:29:22Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 함정 서사를 known-issues 로 모으고 기록을 코드에 맞춘다\n\nI-10(심링크 → zustand·tailwindcss)과 I-11(삼항 → 남의 remote 주소)의 설명\n전체가 코드 주석 · 워크플로 · 테스트 헤더에 여섯 벌씩 반복돼 있었다.\nci.yml 안에서만 두 번이었다. known-issues 를 SSOT 로 두고 나머지는 한 줄\n링크로 줄인다 — \"같은 내용을 두 곳에 쓰지 않는다\"(.claude/rules/docs.md)를\n우리가 어기고 있었다.\n\n기록이 코드보다 많이 주장하던 곳 넷도 바로잡았다.\n\n  38차 표        turbo.json 을 \"텍스트 대조 테스트\"가 지킨다고 적었는데\n                 그 테스트는 같은 절에서 걷어냈다고 적혀 있다\n  ci.yml 머리말  \"왜 세 job 인가 · 셋은 서로 의존하지 않아\" — job 은 6개고\n                 docker-remotes 는 needs 가 있다\n  ADR-021 결과   남은 수동 자리를 셋으로 셌다. remotes.md 는 일곱 곳 +\n                 저장소 Variables 둘로 센다. 목록은 remotes.md 를 SSOT 로 넘긴다\n  ADR-021 세 갈래 contract-check.ts 를 이번 결과처럼 실었다 — 27차 것이다\n\nmf-runtime.md 에는 scripts/ 예외를 명시했다. \"상대 import 에 확장자를 붙이지\n않는다(전역 규칙)\"인데 scripts/*.ts 셋이 붙이고 있어서 규칙과 코드가 갈려\n있었다. 번들러를 안 거치고 node 가 직접 읽는 자리라 붙이는 게 맞다.\n\npick() 의 stdout 함정은 I-11 안에 절로 남기고 증상 색인에도 한 줄 넣었다.\n교훈이 jq -e 가 아니라 $(…) 로 값을 받는 셸 함수의 출력 채널이라서다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"00dab36eb57caaa5da17a7ca1417a0e1ea67e257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/00dab36eb57caaa5da17a7ca1417a0e1ea67e257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDdiYmVkYWYxMTRmMzFhMDc4OTE2YjdjNjRhOTM5ZTgzMjJlYmJkZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb","sha":"fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb"}],"sha":"7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/7bbedaf114f31a078916b7c64a939e8322ebbdfa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:28:19Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:28:19Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(scripts): SSOT 복제와 원시 타입을 걷어낸다\n\ndocker-context.test.ts 의 WORKSPACE_DIRS 가 pnpm-workspace.yaml 의 복제였다.\n글롭이 늘면 이 검사가 조용히 덜 세게 되는데, 그게 정확히 이 테스트가 막으려는\n드리프트다. 이제 YAML 에서 읽고, 가드 테스트는 파서가 실제로 뽑아내는지를 본다.\n\nplan() 의 target: string 을 유니온으로 좁히고 검증을 assertDeployTarget 으로\n경계에 뺐다. eventName 은 그대로 둔다 — GitHub 이벤트는 열린 집합이고 이\n판별이 보는 건 workflow_dispatch 하나뿐이라, 좁히면 새 이벤트마다 깨진다.\n\nRemoteServerSpec.name 도 RemoteName 으로 좁혔다. string 이면 SSOT 밖 이름이\n흘러들 수 있다.\n\nplan() 이 filter 와 map 에서 deployTarget 을 두 번 조립하던 것도 고쳤다.\nfilter 는 REMOTES[name].workspaceDir 이면 된다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"bb591a3a6445fb99500deabcc8d1827aac0b1a39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/bb591a3a6445fb99500deabcc8d1827aac0b1a39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGZjNTU5MWE0MDg5OWI0NTAzNzBlNTY5MDIyODE3NmYyYTE1ZTQ3YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39","sha":"2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39"}],"sha":"fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/fc5591a40899b450370e5690228176f2a15e47bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:28:10Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:28:10Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(remote-config): 이미지 결과를 바꾸는 루트 설정도 공유 배포 경로로 본다\n\nSHARED_DEPLOY_PATHS 에 tsconfig.json · turbo.json · pnpm-workspace.yaml ·\n루트 package.json 이 없었다. 세 Dockerfile 이 COPY . . 로 그것들을 이미지에\n넣고 pnpm turbo run 으로 빌드하므로 바뀌면 산출물이 달라지는데, 어느 앱\n디렉터리도 안 바뀌어서 배포가 그냥 안 물린다. .dockerignore 를 빠뜨려 당한\nI-7 과 같은 모양이고, 이 브랜치가 바꾼 tsconfig.json 이 정확히 그 경우였다.\n\nHOST_WORKSPACE_DIR 은 그대로 둔다. 배포 전용 모듈로 가르려면 그 모듈도\ndeploy-targets.ts 가 import 없이 상대 경로로 읽을 수 있어야 하고, 그러면 두\n파일이 같은 제약을 진다 — 한쪽에 import 가 들어가는 순간 detect job 이 깨진다.\n주석에 그 근거를 적었다.\n\nI-11 서사는 known-issues 링크로 줄였다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"d1cc4af3340e782ebfcac5996dea8da56e382320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/d1cc4af3340e782ebfcac5996dea8da56e382320"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDJhMGFhODg3ZDY0NzQwYmJhYTlkNDc4ZTk2NDk3YjQ4YjkwMDhkMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295","sha":"b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295"}],"sha":"2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2a0aa887d64740bbaa9d478e96497b48b9008d39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:28:01Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:28:01Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(host): warm 의 throw 를 경계 안으로 옮기고 캐시 키를 통일한다\n\nwarmTarget 이 remotes.map 콜백에서 던졌는데 그 자리는 RemoteBoundary 밖이다.\n노출 모듈이 없는 remote 하나가 warm 페이지를 통째로 죽인다 — \"remote 하나가\n죽어도 페이지는 산다\"는 규약과 반대다. 던지는 자리를 lazy 안으로 옮겨\n그 remote 의 경계가 받게 했다.\n\nwarm 캐시 키도 remoteCacheKey 로 통일했다. 캐시가 둘인데 규칙까지 둘이라\nwarm 쪽에만 버전이 빠져 있었다 — 재배포 후에도 옛 엔트리가 맞아버려 warm 이\n적재를 증명하지 못하는 형태다.\n\nRemoteComponent 의 reloadKey 주석은 사실로 고쳤다. \"warm 경로 전용\"이라고\n적혀 있었지만 38차에 MfWarmup 이 떠나 지금은 프로덕션 소비자가 없다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"04c4e4ba38c0f622bee89116b3f280cb86f5a413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/04c4e4ba38c0f622bee89116b3f280cb86f5a413"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGI0NDA3OGQzMGIxZWY2NDgwZDQ4MmQxYjM4MmFlMDhmZGI3OTMyOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/2c9c802489d653204cf0f6fc3e34f1ab386a498c","sha":"2c9c802489d653204cf0f6fc3e34f1ab386a498c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2c9c802489d653204cf0f6fc3e34f1ab386a498c"}],"sha":"b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b44078d30b1ef6480d482d1b382ae08fdb793295"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/2c9c802489d653204cf0f6fc3e34f1ab386a498c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:27:52Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:27:52Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(ci): 배포 설정 에러를 stderr 로 보내 로그에 남게 한다\n\npick() 이 ::error:: 를 stdout 에 썼는데 호출부가 $(pick …) 이라 그 문자열이\n통째로 변수로 흡수됐다. jq -er 은 없는 키에 stderr 를 안 쓰므로 결과는\n메시지 없는 종료코드 1 이었다 — I-11 이 약속한 \"어느 변수가 없는지 말한다\"가\n실제로는 안 일어났다. 조용히 틀리던 자리를 조용히 죽는 자리로 바꾼 셈이다.\n\n같은 함정의 설명이 이 파일 머리말에도 통째로 있어서 I-11 링크로 줄였다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SPod6BT4DKUFUu4Cto4jq5","tree":{"sha":"1faf433a1b530ba9a56b1323296736eb17a17064","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/1faf433a1b530ba9a56b1323296736eb17a17064"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/2c9c802489d653204cf0f6fc3e34f1ab386a498c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/2c9c802489d653204cf0f6fc3e34f1ab386a498c","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDJjOWM4MDI0ODlkNjUzMjA0Y2YwZjZmYzNlMzRmMWFiMzg2YTQ5OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/338bc8