: 확장성 정비를 38차로 기록한다\n\n- known-issues I-10: 이미지 deps 스테이지가 워크스페이스 패키지를 빠뜨려도\n  pnpm install 이 성공한다 (재현 결과 · 왜 늦게 드러나는지)\n- known-issues I-11: remote 이름이 GHA 표현식에 박히면 세 번째 remote 가\n  조용히 틀린다 (배포 job 누락 · 남의 주소로 검증 통과)\n- 증상 색인 두 줄\n- ADR-021: remote 수에 비례하는 지식은 CI · Docker 까지 SSOT 에서 파생한다.\n  파생 못 하는 형식이면 어긋남을 죽는 검사로 바꾼다\n- ADR-022: @mfa/store · @mfa/ui 를 MF shared 에 올리지 않는 이유\n- .claude/rules/remotes.md 에 \"remote 추가\" · \"컴포넌트 추가\" 체크리스트.\n  각 항목이 빠졌을 때 무엇이 죽는지 같이 적었다\n- 진행 상황 38차 — 한 번 늘렸다가 되돌린 검사들도 기준과 함께 남겼다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"a970dfb09c24388307daec0466dcbeb41676452b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/a970dfb09c24388307daec0466dcbeb41676452b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/47dd4ce025323b7caa65ef1d627ae3fac00cf012","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/47dd4ce025323b7caa65ef1d627ae3fac00cf012","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDQ3ZGQ0Y2UwMjUzMjNiN2NhYTY1ZWYxZDYyN2FlM2ZhYzAwY2YwMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e","sha":"b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e"}],"sha":"47dd4ce025323b7caa65ef1d627ae3fac00cf012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/47dd4ce025323b7caa65ef1d627ae3fac00cf012"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:17:09Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:50:39Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"refactor(host): warm 대상을 MODULE_IDS 에서 파생한다\n\n`MfWarmup` 이 `remotes.includes(''catalog'')` 처럼 remote 별 분기를 갖고 있었다.\nremote 를 추가하고 여기를 빠뜨리면 그 remote 만 warm 에서 조용히 빠지고,\n증상은 첫 사용자 요청이 느린 것뿐이다.\n\n목록이 필요했던 이유는 warm 이 그 모듈을 **렌더**했기 때문이다. 렌더하면\n필수 prop 이 있는 모듈(`catalog/ProductDetail` 의 `productId`)은 못 쓰므로\n사람이 골라야 했다 — 그래서 remote 수에 비례해 늘어나는 목록이 하나 더 생긴다.\n\n그런데 warm 의 값은 렌더가 아니라 번들 적재다. fetch · 무결성 검사 ·\n`new Function` 평가 · expose 존재 확인이 전부 `loadRemoteModule` 안에서 끝나고\n캐시를 채우는 `markBundleReady` 도 거기서 불린다. 적재만 하고 null 을 그리면\n어느 모듈이든 상관없어져서, `MODULE_IDS` 에서 그 remote 의 첫 번째를 쓴다.\n\n이제 이 파일에 remote 이름도 모듈 이름도 없다.\n\n실측: `/internal/mf-warm` 만 호출한 뒤 `/api/lab/stats` 가\n`{ fetches: 2, evals: 2, loads: { catalog: 1, cart: 1 } }`. 인증 없는 호출은 404 유지.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"e0208fbe847d9ac5438d699395a1dba2e18ee681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/e0208fbe847d9ac5438d699395a1dba2e18ee681"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGIyZTFiY2EzMWE2MGU3YTczMjRmYmM1MzNiZmY5ZTgzZmFhYWFiMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473","sha":"fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473"}],"sha":"b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/b2e1bca31a60e7a7324fbc533bff9e83faaaab2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:48:31Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:50:39Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"ci: 배포 이미지가 실제로 빌드되는지 CI 에서 본다\n\n`pnpm build` 는 워크스페이스 전체가 설치된 상태에서 돈다. 이미지 빌드는\n다르다 — `deps` 스테이지가 워크스페이스 package.json 을 손으로 나열해\n부분 설치를 한다. 그 목록 드리프트는 `scripts/docker-context.test.ts` 가\n오프라인으로 잡지만(I-10), 그건 목록만 본다.\n\n이 job 이 실제 이미지를 만든다. 대상 목록은 `scripts/deploy-targets.ts` 로\nSSOT 에서 뽑으므로 remote 가 늘어도 여기 손댈 자리가 없다. host 이미지는\n`--target deps` 까지만 본다 — 그 이미지의 프리렌더가 배포된 remote 오리진을\n실제로 부르므로 CI 안에서 끝까지 갈 수 없다.\n\nDockerfile 의 COPY 목록 자체와 그 오프라인 검사는 #10 에 있다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"41c1a60f25ff2e81028e9c34566c0a8eec61c75e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/41c1a60f25ff2e81028e9c34566c0a8eec61c75e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGZhM2EzZTFhMzQyYzI2OTJhN2NlYjczZDRmNzg0ODM3YTdiM2M0NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea","sha":"d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea"}],"sha":"fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/fa3a3e1a342c2692a7ceb73d4f784837a7b3c473"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:16:49Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:50:39Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"build: remote 정적 서버 기동을 SSOT 순회로 바꾼다\n\n\"remote dist 를 띄운 채 명령 하나를 돌린다\" 는 자리가 두 곳이었고\n(host 의 build, ci 의 MF DTS 확인) 둘 다 `concurrently` 로 remote 를 하나씩\n나열하고 있었다. remote 를 추가하면 양쪽을 같이 고쳐야 했고, 빠뜨리면 그\nremote 만 프리렌더에서 ECONNREFUSED 로 죽는다.\n\n`scripts/serve-all-remotes.ts` 가 `REMOTE_LIST` 를 순회해 in-process 로 전부\n띄우고, 자식 명령이 끝나면 같이 내린다. 자식 프로세스가 N+1 개에서 1개로\n줄고 포트 준비를 실제로 기다린다 — concurrently 로는 못 하던 것이다.\n\ndist 가 없으면 서버를 띄우기 전에 죽는다. 없는 채로 띄우면 전부 404 가 되어\n실패가 한참 뒤 \"SSR 번들 응답 404\" 로 나타난다.\n\nhost 에서 이제 안 쓰는 concurrently 의존성 제거.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"284078f371f4f454cc7e11a60c8f8b9ef2844811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/284078f371f4f454cc7e11a60c8f8b9ef2844811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGQxZTRlNGUwYmY2YjM2N2E0NjhhNzcyNDhiN2U5MGJmMzI2ZWEzZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f","sha":"98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f"}],"sha":"d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d1e4e4e0bf6b367a468a77248b7e90bf326ea3ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:16:27Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:50:39Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"feat(ci): 배포 대상 판별을 SSOT 에서 파생한다\n\n`detect-targets` 의 bash 안에 remote 이름이 여섯 번 리터럴로 박혀 있었다.\nremote 를 추가하고 그중 하나만 빠뜨리면 CI 는 초록인데 그 remote 의 배포\njob 이 아예 안 생긴다 — 로그에도 `remotes=[] host=false` 라고 정상처럼 찍힌다.\n\n판별을 `scripts/deploy-targets.ts` 로 옮겨 `@mfa/remote-config` 를 읽게 했다.\n그 스크립트는 SSOT 를 상대 경로로 직접 들여서 `pnpm install` 없이 돈다 —\ndetect job 이 배포 대상을 정하려고 의존성 전체를 받을 이유가 없다.\n`packages/remote-config/src/index.ts` 에 import 가 하나도 없어서 Node 24 의\n타입 스트리핑만으로 읽힌다(그래서 그 파일에 import 를 추가하면 이 job 이 깨진다).\n\n`deploy.yml` 은 저장소 Variables 를 `toJSON(vars)` 로 통째로 받고 matrix 항목이\n들고 온 이름으로 찾는다. 없으면 `jq -e` 가 그 자리에서 죽는다 — 다른 remote 의\n값으로 조용히 넘어가지 않는다.\n\n\"바뀐 파일이 0개\" 와 \"비교할 기준이 없다\" 를 `has_base` 로 구분한다.\n빈 문자열로는 둘을 구분할 수 없는데 전자는 배포하지 않고 후자는 전부 배포한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"2fab25cd070ea8965e2672c7cfa1bfa0c9e7ff0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/2fab25cd070ea8965e2672c7cfa1bfa0c9e7ff0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDk4OTUyZWRkMGFkMjI1ODBjYTI4ZDZlODA3ZWVmYjg0YTc3ZWNlNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/9d47c9501af18221ff348820c6cb73f8fdf6ccb1","sha":"9d47c9501af18221ff348820c6cb73f8fdf6ccb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/9d47c9501af18221ff348820c6cb73f8fdf6ccb1"}],"sha":"98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/98952edd0ad22580ca28d6e807eefb84a77ece5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/9d47c9501af18221ff348820c6cb73f8fdf6ccb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:16:27Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:50:39Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"feat(remote-config): CI 가 remote 별로 읽는 값의 이름도 SSOT 가 정한다\n\n배포 워크플로가 remote 마다 공개 URL 과 Dokploy 애플리케이션 id 를 필요로\n하는데, 그 매핑이 GHA 표현식 안에 삼항 사슬로 있었다.\n\n  REMOTE_URL=\"$([ \"$REMOTE\" = catalog ] && echo \"$CATALOG_URL\" || echo \"$CART_URL\")\"\n\nremote 가 셋이 되는 순간 catalog 가 아닌 전부가 cart 의 URL 을 읽는다.\n그 URL 로 배포 전후 버전을 비교해 성공으로 끝나므로 로그에 흔적이 없다.\n\n매핑을 이름 규칙으로 바꾸고 규칙을 여기 한 곳에 둔다.\n\n  ciUrlVar(''catalog'')        → MF_CATALOG_URL\n  ciDokployAppVar(''catalog'') → DOKPLOY_APP_CATALOG\n  deployTarget(''catalog'')    → 워크플로 matrix 한 항목 (이름 + 두 변수명 + 경로)\n\n기존 저장소 Variable 이름과 정확히 같아서 GitHub 설정은 안 바뀐다.\n\n`HOST_WORKSPACE_DIR` 과 `SHARED_DEPLOY_PATHS` 도 같이 옮겼다 — \"어느 경로가\n바뀌면 무엇을 배포하나\" 는 배치 지식이다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"f39e9427dd700f1902ee3cf34d5c9695a9052424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/f39e9427dd700f1902ee3cf34d5c9695a9052424"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/9d47c9501af18221ff348820c6cb73f8fdf6ccb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/9d47c9501af18221ff348820c6cb73f8fdf6ccb1","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDlkNDdjOTUwMWFmMTgyMjFmZjM0ODgyMGM2Y2I3M2Y4ZmRmNmNjYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://githu