_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/8f37a0267e5aeaa3fb698207c039116f20732e8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:56:11Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:56:11Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"fix(docker): deps 스테이지가 워크스페이스 패키지 셋을 빠뜨리고 있었다\n\n세 Dockerfile 의 `deps` 스테이지가 워크스페이스 package.json 을 손으로\n나열하는데, 그 목록이 실제 워크스페이스보다 셋 적었다 —\n`remote-config` · `store` · `tailwind-config`.\n\n그런데도 `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` 은 성공한다. pnpm 이 없는\n워크스페이스 디렉터리를 향해 심링크를 먼저 만들고, 그다음 `COPY . .` 가\n진짜 소스를 덮으면 그 링크가 살아나기 때문이다. 살아나지 않는 건 그\n패키지들의 `node_modules` 다 — 설치 시점에 디렉터리가 없었으므로 아예\n안 만들어진다. pnpm 은 isolated 링커라 패키지가 자기 의존성을 자기\n`node_modules` 로 본다.\n\n  packages/store           → zustand 해석 실패\n  packages/tailwind-config → tailwindcss 해석 실패\n\n즉 이미지 빌드가 깨져 있었다. `pnpm build` · `pnpm test` · CI 어디에도\n이걸 보는 자리가 없다 — 배포가 최초 검증이었다. `typescript-config` 도\n같이 빠져 있었지만 런타임 의존성이 없어 아무 일도 안 났다. 그래서 이\n함정은 패키지를 추가한 시점이 아니라 그 패키지에 의존성이 생기는 시점에\n드러난다.\n\n`scripts/docker-context.test.ts` 가 COPY 목록을 워크스페이스와 대조한다.\n오프라인이고 어느 파일에 무슨 줄을 넣어야 하는지 출력한다. store 줄을\n지워 실제로 잡히는지 확인했다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"a216f79377544846ee8e707dc77dbb2cce6ee7a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/a216f79377544846ee8e707dc77dbb2cce6ee7a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/8f37a0267e5aeaa3fb698207c039116f20732e8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/8f37a0267e5aeaa3fb698207c039116f20732e8f","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDhmMzdhMDI2N2U1YWVhYTNmYjY5ODIwN2MwMzkxMTZmMjA3MzJlOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/4ca9ce833f3fa1416423bdea7a7f29267c8e79e0","sha":"4ca9ce833f3fa1416423bdea7a7f29267c8e79e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/4ca9ce833f3fa1416423bdea7a7f29267c8e79e0"}],"sha":"8f37a0267e5aeaa3fb698207c039116f20732e8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/8f37a0267e5aeaa3fb698207c039116f20732e8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"htt