rl":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/4abff8f8cd8f07abca9ba134e70361067eece6e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:12:37Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:12:37Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"ci: docs 를 GitHub Pages 로 올린다\n\nanatomy.html 은 단독 HTML 이라 저장소 화면에서는 소스로만 보였다. README 링크를\n눌러도 그림을 볼 수 없어 \"받아서 브라우저로 연다\"는 안내가 붙어 있었다.\n\n파일 하나가 아니라 docs/ 통째로 올린다 — 해부도가 근거 문서를 상대 경로로\n가리키기 때문이다. Pages 는 마크다운을 렌더링하지 않으므로, 호스트가 github.io\n일 때만 .md 링크를 GitHub blob 주소로 돌리는 스크립트를 해부도에 넣었다.\n로컬(file://)로 열었을 때는 옆 파일을 그대로 가리켜야 하므로 건드리지 않는다.\n\nconfigure-pages 의 enablement 입력은 안 쓴다 — GITHUB_TOKEN 으로는 안 되고\n별도 PAT 을 요구한다. Pages 는 저장소 설정에서 한 번 켰다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"d9dea8a6f23bd888ea26375e41f8348be6b0faf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/d9dea8a6f23bd888ea26375e41f8348be6b0faf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/4abff8f8cd8f07abca9ba134e70361067eece6e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/4abff8f8cd8f07abca9ba134e70361067eece6e9","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDRhYmZmOGY4Y2Q4ZjA3YWJjYTliYTEzNGU3MDM2MTA2N2VlY2U2ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574","sha":"d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574"}],"sha":"4abff8f8cd8f07abca9ba134e70361067eece6e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/4abff8f8cd8f07abca9ba134e70361067eece6e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:12:23Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:12:23Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs: 해부도를 27~34차 구조에 맞춘다\n\n26차 이후로 그림이 멈춰 있었다. 배포 트리거를 Watch Paths 로, 재배포 알림을\nmf-revalidate 워크플로로 그리고 있었는데 둘 다 지금은 deploy.yml 이 쥔다.\n\n- 1-2 신설: job 넷과 조건, 버전 스큐, 완료 판정을 배포 상태로 바꾼 함정(I-8)\n- 1-4: 시퀀스 재배열 — 5초 폴링, 버전 확인 30초는 게이트가 아니라 관측\n- 2-4 신설: 계약을 remote 가 소유하고 DTS 로 흘러오는 네 단계\n- 2-6: 상태 통로가 둘(쿠키·주소), Slot/Section 분리 함정\n- 오리진 허용 목록 env 이름 정정 — REMOTE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS\n\n절이 둘 늘어 번호가 밀렸고(1-2~1-5, 2-4~2-6) 본문 상호참조도 같이 고쳤다.\n함정 블록만 좁던 max-width 를 지워 표·도해와 폭을 맞췄다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"64e7926baf71b3a18976951100122de82edc703e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/64e7926baf71b3a18976951100122de82edc703e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGQ4NjczNGNiNGI2YWNmODBhZTM1ZDIxZmJlMWRiOTM2YTc3NTU1NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/582e13ab0e5cf8377c60e6e925892e32c52158af","sha":"582e13ab0e5cf8377c60e6e925892e32c52158af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/582e13ab0e5cf8377c60e6e925892e32c52158af"}],"sha":"d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/d86734cb4b6acf80ae35d21fbe1db936a7755574"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/582e13ab0e5cf8377c60e6e925892e32c52158af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:12:03Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:12:03Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"docs(research): remote 번들러 비교를 34차로 남긴다\n\n\"catalog 는 Vite, cart 는 Rsbuild 인데 어느 쪽이 나은가\" 의 답이 설정 파일 주석과\nknown-issues 여기저기에 흩어져 있었다. MF 의 shared 배리어가 Rspack 런타임 안에\n있고 Vite 에서는 어댑터가 밖에서 흉내낸다는 구조 차이를 한 곳에 모은다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MhrPRD6MK2wS9wYosoHrCn","tree":{"sha":"f875e8b7e7c1e5f8636eb8d9891db15b4d6d6f79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/trees/f875e8b7e7c1e5f8636eb8d9891db15b4d6d6f79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/git/commits/582e13ab0e5cf8377c60e6e925892e32c52158af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/582e13ab0e5cf8377c60e6e925892e32c52158af","node_id":"C_kwDOT468mtoAKDU