"C_kwDOT468mtoAKGFlODVmZTBjODQxMWYxZWVmM2IxZWE5YjUwNzU1NGExY2E0ZjdjMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commit/ef23de167bb6b5c8adedab0750665970db549475","sha":"ef23de167bb6b5c8adedab0750665970db549475","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/ef23de167bb6b5c8adedab0750665970db549475"}],"sha":"ae85fe0c8411f1eef3b1ea9b507554a1ca4f7c0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/ae85fe0c8411f1eef3b1ea9b507554a1ca4f7c0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5179037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chane81","id":5179037,"login":"chane81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkwMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chane81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chane81/mfa-nextjs/commits/ef23de167bb6b5c8adedab0750665970db549475/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:06:08Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:06:08Z","email":"chane81@naver.com","name":"chane81"},"message":"ci: 버전 공표 확인 시한을 120초에서 30초로 줄인다\n\n이 대기는 버전이 안 바뀌는 배포에서 전액 청구된다 — 이미지가 재사용되면 아무리\n기다려도 안 바뀌므로(I-8) 매번 시한을 다 쓴다. 29차에 그렇게 2분을 버렸다.\n\n공표 지연은 실측 0.4~0.6초라 30초도 50배 여유다. 게이트가 아니라 관측이라\n시한을 넉넉히 잡을 이유가 없다 — 넉넉함이 버리는 쪽에만 작용한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By