/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/cfc9692c5088ba9998a6ae8a2d7d3861749285f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:49:04Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:49:04Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"message":"feat(admin): borrar cuenta, crear usuario, y ajustes de UI del panel\n\n- DELETE /admin/users/:id -- borra la cuenta POR COMPLETO: todos sus datos\n  en Firestore y la cuenta de Firebase Auth. Reutiliza la misma lógica que\n  el \"derecho al olvido\" de routes/privacy.js, extraída a un módulo\n  compartido (services/accountDeletion.js) para que ambos flujos borren\n  exactamente las mismas colecciones sin divergir. No permite que el admin\n  se borre a sí mismo. Modal de confirmación propio (reemplaza el\n  window.confirm nativo), con los botones apilados a ancho completo en\n  móvil para que \"Borrar cuenta\" no se parta en dos líneas.\n- POST /admin/users -- crea una cuenta nueva completa (Firebase Auth +\n  acceso activo) sin pasar por Hotmart, con la contraseña que el admin\n  asigna. Formulario propio en el panel (correo, nombre opcional, plan,\n  contraseña con checklist de requisitos).\n- UI: los 3 botones de acción (Activar/Inactivar, Cambiar contraseña,\n  Borrar cuenta) quedan del mismo tamaño en escritorio, y los badges\n  activo/inactivo del mismo ancho.\n\nCubierto con 4 tests nuevos (149/149 en total) y verificado en vivo con\nPlaywright en móvil y escritorio: crear cuenta, borrar con confirmación y\ncancelación, y que el admin no puede borrarse a sí mismo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0177VXzr6jYBDEDht9LCF4E5","tree":{"sha":"b7b564b64164d654c0ea1c8b4de72fccefb9bb0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/trees/b7b564b64164d654c0ea1c8b4de72fccefb9bb0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/commits/cfc9692c5088ba9998a6ae8a2d7d3861749285f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/cfc9692c5088ba9998a6ae8a2d7d3861749285f2","node_id":"C_kwDOT5AOd9oAKGNmYzk2OTJjNTA4OGJhOTk5OGE2YWU4YTJkN2QzODYxNzQ5Mjg1ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/f36e05a5a491772f57bf10be2abb275340a95b13","sha":"f36e05a5a491772f57bf10be2abb275340a95b13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/f36e05a5a491772f57bf10be2abb275340a95b13"}],"sha":"cfc9692c5088ba9998a6ae8a2d7d3861749285f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/cfc9692c5088ba9998a6ae8a2d7d3861749285f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/f36e05a5a491772f57bf10be2abb275340a95b13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:35:22Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:35:22Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"message":"feat(admin): panel de usuarios — listar, activar/inactivar, asignar contraseña\n\nPanel de administración de usuarios accesible desde /admin (pestaña\n\"Usuarios\", visible en el menú lateral/inferior solo para ADMIN_USER_ID):\n\n- GET /admin/users lista todos los usuarios (Firestore subscriptions) con\n  su estado de acceso; búsqueda por correo (parcial o completo) en el\n  frontend.\n- POST /admin/users/:id/status activa/inactiva el acceso (mismo mecanismo\n  que un evento real de Hotmart).\n- POST /admin/users/:id/set-password: el admin asigna directamente una\n  contraseña temporal (Firebase Admin auth.updateUser), en vez de un\n  enlace por correo. Como el admin queda conociéndola, se marca\n  mustChangePassword en la suscripción del usuario.\n- GET /subscription/status ahora expone mustChangePassword e isAdmin\n  (sin lecturas extra: viaja en el mismo doc de subscriptions que ya se\n  cachea en cada request autenticado).\n- Nueva pantalla /cambiar-contrasena (ChangePasswordPage): AccessGate\n  redirige ahí antes que a cualquier otra pantalla si mustChangePassword\n  es true. Al guardar, llama a POST /auth/password-changed para limpiar\n  el flag.\n- Tabla de usuarios rediseñada: filas compactas y ancho completo en\n  escritorio (MainLayout deja de forzar max-w-lg en rutas /admin).\n- Red de seguridad en provisioning.generateActivationLink: en producción,\n  si ACTIVATION_URL resuelve a localhost, falla en vez de mandarle a un\n  cliente real un enlace roto.\n\nCubierto con 10 tests nuevos (145/145 en total) y verificado en vivo con\nPlaywright: listar, buscar, inactivar/reactivar, asignar contraseña,\nredirección forzada a /cambiar-contrasena y cambio exitoso con el SDK de\nFirebase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0177VXzr6jYBDEDht9LCF4E5","tree":{"sha":"04e7172af3fe035545e9fbed536ee3895c82c313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/trees/04e7172af3fe035545e9fbed536ee3895c82c313"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/commits/f36e05a5a491772f57bf10be2abb275340a95b13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/543