"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/b07169dec8fef222f51bbb54a4550abe3abfa13d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:03:49Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:03:49Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"message":"chore(hotmart): quita el log de diagnóstico temporal ya usado\n\nEl log agregado para ubicar dónde mandaba Hotmart el Hottok cumplió su\npropósito: se confirmó con la cuenta real que los 6 tipos de evento de\nprueba (aprobada, cancelada, chargeback, completa, reembolsada x2) ya\nresponden 200. Se retira el logging temporal, quedan los fixes reales\n(GET /webhooks/hotmart y el fallback del Hottok en body+headers).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0177VXzr6jYBDEDht9LCF4E5","tree":{"sha":"fe49c00ec9ccbd188880d93331bea4e7d3e8d206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/trees/fe