url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/d0ad2efdb7ecada8bf18c037d8be121198eaf4c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:34:24Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:34:24Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"message":"fix(tutor-ia): el input queda vacío tras enviar por voz\n\nEfecto secundario del fix anterior: al apagar voiceMode de forma síncrona\nen handleVoiceTurn, el useEffect que sincroniza input <- speech.transcript\n(pensado para dictado manual con voiceMode ya en false) se disparaba justo\ndespués de cada envío por voz y volvía a poner en el input el texto que ya\nse había mandado. Se limpia speech.transcript en el mismo punto para que\nese efecto no tenga nada que copiar.\n\nVerificado con el mock de reconocimiento de voz de los tests E2E: input\nqueda \"\" después del envío, y el mensaje sí llega al chat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0177VXzr6jYBDEDht9LCF4E5","tree":{"sha":"839ba8c536e8a03569f0f94e17414af8a8a79394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/trees/839ba8c536e8a03569f0f94e17414af8a8a79394"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/commits/d0ad2efdb7ecada8bf18c037d8be121198eaf4c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/d0ad2efdb7ecada8bf18c037d8be121198eaf4c4","node_id":"C_kwDOT5AOd9oAKGQwYWQyZWZkYjdlY2FkYThiZjE4YzAzN2Q4YmUxMjExOThlYWY0YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5","sha":"24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5"}],"sha":"d0ad2efdb7ecada8bf18c037d8be121198eaf4c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/d0ad2efdb7ecada8bf18c037d8be121198eaf4c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:28:23Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:28:23Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"message":"fix(tutor-ia): modelo real, respuestas vacías, prompt de \"Estoy Atascado\", botón de voz\n\nTres bugs reales encontrados y verificados con la API/navegador real, no\nsolo revisión de código:\n\n- Modelo inexistente en producción: render.yaml tenía GROQ_MODEL=\n  llama-3.3-70b-versatile, que Groq ya descontinuó (confirmado contra su\n  catálogo actual) — el tutor llevaba tiempo cayendo al mock genérico de\n  desarrollo en vez de responder con IA real. Cambiado a openai/gpt-oss-20b\n  (el mismo default que ya usaba el código, y el más barato).\n\n- Respuestas vacías: al bajar maxTokens a 100 (para controlar costo), el\n  modelo (gpt-oss, \"reasoning\") gastaba todo el presupuesto en su campo\n  interno `reasoning` y devolvía content vacío. Agregado\n  reasoning_effort:''low'' (de ~60 a ~10 tokens de razonamiento) + presupuesto\n  subido a 180 — sigue siendo 55% menos que el original (400) pero ya no se\n  vacía ni se corta a media frase.\n\n- \"Estoy Atascado\" nunca respondía en español: buildSystemPrompt(''stuck'', …)\n  hacía MODES[''stuck''] || MODES.Conversation — ''stuck'' nunca estuvo en\n  MODES (STUCK_PROMPT vive aparte), así que SIEMPRE caía al prompt genérico\n  de Conversation y la instrucción de responder 100% en español nunca se\n  aplicaba. El test existente solo comprobaba la constante suelta, nunca lo\n  que esta función arma de verdad — se agrega el test correcto.\n\n- Botón del micrófono: antes quedaba \"armado\" (azul) esperando el siguiente\n  turno automáticamente tras enviar un mensaje hablado (conversación\n  continua). Ahora vuelve a su estado inicial (gris) apenas se envía —\n  verificado con el mock de reconocimiento de voz de los tests E2E: misma\n  clase CSS antes y después.\n\n- Memory Match: el menú previo a la partida (no la partida en sí, que ya\n  medía simétrica) tenía overflow horizontal real — `<div className=\"grid\n  gap-3\">` sin `grid-cols-1` usaba ancho `auto` en vez de `minmax(0,1fr)`,\n  empujando los botones 66px fuera de pantalla. Verificado: overflow de\n  66px a 0px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0177VXzr6jYBDEDht9LCF4E5","tree":{"sha":"16f4a7ae21188f3a2fa768a32c2d3866c9750094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/trees/16f4a7ae21188f3a2fa768a32c2d3866c9750094"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/commits/24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5","node_id":"C_kwDOT5AOd9oAKDI0YTMyNTQ5Y2JlMzZkZmQ3NzEwMjI1MWRkOGFhYTg5YzZiMWFmZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349","sha":"75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349"}],"sha":"24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/24a32549cbe36dfd77102251dd8aaa89c6b1afe5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:28:01Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:28:01Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"message":"feat(monetización): Premium pago único de por vida, fusionado con el acceso\n\nReemplaza el modelo de suscripción recurrente ($4.99/mes o $39.99/año) por\nun pago único de $9.99 con acceso de por vida (plan premium-lifetime, vía\nHotmart). Un status ''active'' ya no expiraba por fecha en este sistema — solo\nun evento explícito de reembolso/chargeback lo revoca — así que \"de por\nvida\" no requirió inventar mecanismo nuevo.\n\nFusión de entitlements (V9): el nivel de funcionalidades (IA completa) pasa\na depender del MISMO estado que ya controla el acceso a la app\n(active/trialing/past_due) en vez de una lista de planes aparte — cualquier\ncompra aprobada (Reto21, Premium, o legacy) desbloquea todo. Se elimina el\nconcepto de upsell interno: PremiumPage.tsx y la ruta /premium (redirige a\n/home), y se limpian los ~10 archivos que tenían botones/banners \"Desbloquear\nPremium\" o checks `!entitlements.canX` — todos apuntaban a la página\neliminada y ya eran ramas muertas para cualquier usuario con acceso real.\n\nLegacy monthly/annual se conserva intacto para quien ya lo tenía; el flujo\nexterno del Reto de 21 Días (cuenta + activación por email) no se tocó.\n\nVerificado con webhooks simulados extremo a extremo: compra Reto21 ahora\ntambién da IA completa (30 msgs/día); reembolso revoca el acceso de\ninmediato sin fecha de expiración de por medio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0177VXzr6jYBDEDht9LCF4E5","tree":{"sha":"309348fa0186032018c6f29fd8502c0f0556985b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/trees/309348fa0186032018c6f29fd8502c0f0556985b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/commits/75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo","id":54384673,"login":"guillegmo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg0Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349","node_id":"C_kwDOT5AOd9oAKDc1ZDMxNzFhOGQzMTVmZDVlYTJlY2YyNTMwYTk3YjFjZTY4MDgzNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillegmo/appingles/commit/0e84a652602d96ed56ab5ad45502eae7adedbe5e","sha":"0e84a652602d96ed56ab5ad45502eae7adedbe5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/0e84a652602d96ed56ab5ad45502eae7adedbe5e"}],"sha":"75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/75d3171a8d315fd5ea2ecf2530a97b1ce6808349"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"