starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/commits/15ae06d3f94a20098be8abe0b3cade6904af5d59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:57:06Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:57:06Z","email":"guillegmo@hotmail.com","name":"Guillermo Montoya Ocampo"},"message":"perf(images): precargar fotos de los retos, no solo Memory Match\n\nDayViewPage precarga todas las imágenes del día (vocabulario +\nejercicios image-choice/listen-image) apenas llega la respuesta del\nservidor, antes de llegar al paso \"Aprender\" o al ejercicio — mismo\nmecanismo que ya tenía Memory Match. La función se movió a\nutils/assetUrl.ts (preloadImages) para reusarla en ambos lugares en\nvez de duplicarla.\n\npnpm-lock.yaml sincronizado con la dependencia sharp agregada en el\ncommit anterior (el repo usa pnpm; el lockfile había quedado desfasado).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0177VXzr6jYBDEDht9LCF4E5","tree":{"sha":"824355384656e5ff8bed29101f8e5668586bd00e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/trees/824355384656e5ff8bed29101f8e5668586bd00e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillegmo/appingles/git/commits/15ae06d3f94a20098be8abe0b3cade6904af5d59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54384673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillegmo/following{/other_user}","