lissa-pd","id":272545676,"login":"melissa-pd","node_id":"U_kgDOED63jA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissa-pd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissa-pd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissa-pd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissa-pd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissa-pd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melissa-pd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melissa-pd/design-playground/commits/a33828007769d5ab42144b707347d69d28e1544d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:50:35Z","email":"melissa@perspectives.digital","name":"melissa-pd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:50:35Z","email":"melissa@perspectives.digital","name":"melissa-pd"},"message":"Add 17 agent skills, vendored and committed\n\nInstall skills into .agents/skills/ with symlinks from .claude/skills/\nso Claude Code discovers them. Both directories are tracked, so a clone\ngets every skill with no setup or global install.\n\nNine Vercel skills are managed by the skills CLI and recorded in\nskills-lock.json. The other eight (ui-ux-pro-max, two bencium UX\ndesigners, five accesslint accessibility skills plus shared/) are\nvendored by hand, all MIT, with sources and commits listed in the README.\n\nThree are linked under a shorter name than their install directory\n(composition-patterns, react-best-practices, react-native-skills) so the\nrepo copy shadows the one commonly found in ~/.claude/skills/ instead of\nappearing as a duplicate entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8aa27cacfe87e0a2bcab74b8877fc7ebf17a6922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melissa-pd/design-playground/git/trees/8aa27cacfe87e0a2bcab74b8877fc7ebf17a6922"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melissa-pd/design-playground/git/