ers/ChamathDilshanC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/commits/033fa0ac504bbbf1220bf365ae3455505c3c4aa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:45:13Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:45:13Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"message":"feat: full user CRUD/RBAC UI and stock in/out UI in admin console\n\nUsers tab: \"Add user\" (name/email/password/role), per-row role\ndropdown, delete — mirroring what admin-service''s new endpoints\nenforce: granting/revoking Admin is only offered when the logged-in\nadmin''s email matches SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL, and a user can''t touch their\nown row or the super admin''s. This is UX only, not the security\nboundary — the server rejects it either way — but keeping it in sync\navoids the user attempting an action the backend will just 403.\n\nProducts tab: a stock-adjustment modal per product (stock in/out,\nquantity, optional note), calling the new PATCH .../stock endpoint\ninstead of overwriting the raw stock number through the edit form.\nShows the last 5 adjustments from the product''s stockHistory.","tree":{"sha":"758c4fc7771e5deb0c902093205bb32331bfbcac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/trees/758c4fc7771e5deb0c902093205bb32331bfbcac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/commits/033fa0ac504bbbf1220bf365ae3455505c3c4aa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150304779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/