hamathDilshanC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/commits/b43eb1825c0662021225ae7f1c49174b8b8e3f1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T06:55:59Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T06:55:59Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"message":"fix: make Google sign-in button responsive and centered\n\nThe button''s width was hardcoded to 336px, passed straight through to\nGoogle''s rendered iframe — it doesn''t resize on its own, so on narrow\nviewports it could overflow its container instead of shrinking, and on\nthe auth card it didn''t match the full-width inputs below it.\n\nNow measures the wrapping container with a ResizeObserver and re-renders\nthe button at that width (clamped to Google''s documented 200-400px\nrange). Also sets logo_alignment=\"center\" so the G icon and text are\ncentered as a group instead of the icon being pinned to the left edge.","tree":{"sha":"36bdc2dcbc10900888ecbbd345bcdc437a65a7ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/trees/36bdc2dcbc10900888ecbbd345bcdc437a65a7ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/commits/b43eb1825c0662021225ae7f1c49174b8b8e3f1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150304779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/following{/other_use