repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/commits/6d09fcdf41e889cf21cf85d36a0e5496bc0a8a1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:26:35Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:26:35Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"message":"feat: product templates get the full banner layout picker + rows control\n\nProductTemplateForm now offers all 7 layouts (carousel, grid,\nspotlight, sidebar, showcase, bento, marquee) with per-layout option\npanels mirroring the banner template form, plus 7 new shop-page\nrendering components reusing the same size tables and animation\ntiming as their banner counterparts. Grid layout gains a Rows control\nalongside Columns (page size = columns x rows).\n\nAlso fixes a layout bug: the grid''s sliding pages sat in a flex row,\nand flex''s default cross-axis stretch matched every page''s height to\nthe tallest one (even off-screen pages with more rows), which then\nstretched each ProductCard''s flex-1 price section and left a large\nempty gap under shorter pages. Adding items-start to the flex track\nfixes it.","tree":{"sha":"0b2b3bc61e6404f33b088f9224de899861aa16bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/trees/0b2b3bc61e6404f33b088f9224de899861aa16bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/commits/6d09fcdf41e889cf21cf85d36a0e5496bc0a8a1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150304779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/events{/priva