ttps://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/commits/163e7a52505de449be0c6eeae6d8ebf5d058e617/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T19:45:26Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T19:45:26Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"message":"feat: add site footer; make showcase banners slide instead of jump-cutting\n\n- New Footer (brand/contact, Quick links, Social, Legal, copyright) rendered\n  in the root layout so it shows on every page; hidden on the printable\n  invoice via print:hidden.\n- BannerShowcase now animates continuously: cards grow/shrink and fade as\n  they move between the large-center and small-edge slots, flowing left to\n  right, instead of swapping banner sets abruptly on each step.\n- Fixed an edge case where a scarce number of tagged banners could let an\n  invisible buffer slot claim the only banner, leaving the visible cards empty.","tree":{"sha":"72cffa47030ef240ddbbb87a93518def4dcd2bd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/trees/72cffa47030ef240ddbbb87a93518def4dcd2bd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/commits/163e7a52505de449be0c6eeae6d8ebf5d058e617","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150304779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshan