i.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/commits/46c7485175c46b198904b330f65f6a41e54851a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T19:34:06Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T19:34:06Z","email":"dilshancolonne123@gmail.com","name":"ChamathDilshanC"},"message":"feat: add showcase banner layout; fix allitems banners, unusable number inputs\n\n- New \"Showcase\" template layout in the admin banner-template picker and on\n  the public shop page: two large center cards flanked by smaller peeking\n  ones, sliding via arrows/auto-advance with an admin interval control.\n- /shop/allitems no longer fetches or renders banners/sidebar rails — it''s a\n  plain category directory; banners stay on /shop only.\n- Number inputs (carousel/spotlight/sidebar interval, max list items) used to\n  clamp on every keystroke, making it impossible to type a value below the\n  minimum. They now only clamp on blur, via a shared ClampedNumberInput.\n- Removed the native spinner from every number input site-wide and stopped\n  mouse-wheel scroll from silently changing a focused number field''s value.","tree":{"sha":"90545603ae9781e007d2a583410177b3f444c1de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/trees/90545603ae9781e007d2a583410177b3f444c1de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/commits/46c7485175c46b198904b330f65f6a41e54851a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":