refactor: unify design system, rework header nav, and remove dead vendor code\n\nMerge the shop/product pages'' separate cyan \"Red Hat Display\" theme into\nthe single ink/warm/accent token system used everywhere else, and add a\nJS scale-up for the adaptive rem grid above 1920px.\n\nHeader/nav: add a real cart badge (reads the existing localStorage cart),\na profile link, and replace the marketing anchor nav (Home/Platform/\nServices/About, none of which existed on the page) with real e-commerce\ndestinations. Add a working scrollTo helper to ScrollProvider.\n\nAdd shared ProductCard and StatusPill components and wire them into the\nhomepage and order history, consolidate the icon set onto lucide-react\n(keeping only the brand LogoMark as a custom SVG), and open the login\nmodal on checkout instead of silently redirecting unauthenticated users.\n\nRemove dead code: the unused PageLoader, the empty vendor/search/store\nroute stubs and orphaned \"Vendor uis\" mockups left over from a deleted\nmulti-vendor attempt, and Sections.tsx''s unreachable agency-template\nsections (About/CreateBand/Portfolio/Services/Stats) along with the\nmock /api/stats route that only they consumed.","tree":{"sha":"b3a505d864165db6b43b56be71922baeeabd7db8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/trees/b3a505d864165db6b43b56be71922baeeabd7db8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChamathDilshanC/NexusCart-Microservices-Frontend/git/commits/ab3d95e4dc46f00701586c0ed33b146893ff57ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150304779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChamathDilshanC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cham