lock (port 8085, WorkOrder + Downtime\n  REST + Kafka producer -> agri.operations.events).\n- Section 3: ''5 servicos'' -> ''6 servicos'' (now includes\n  field-operation); back-end test count 45 -> 56 (11 new\n  tests in field-operation-service); container count\n  11 -> 12 (one more service container).\n- Section 4: ''As 13 changes'' -> ''As 17 changes''; added\n  019 (field-operation-service) row; added 017 (polish +\n  docs prep) and 018 (honest badges) rows in the frontend\n  table to make the table match reality.\n- Section 4: URL map adds the new\n  /api/v1/operations/** row pointing to\n  field-operation-service:8085.\n- Section 5: docs/ map adds the new\n  field-operation-service.md, operator-profile-and-gestor-\n  sidebar.md, and design-system-and-interfaces.md; the\n  ''changes/'' paragraph is updated to reflect the 4\n  placeholder tasks and 12 archive folders.\n- Section 6: repository layout adds the\n  field-operation-service/ folder.\n\nAlso archives changes/019-field-operation-service/ as\n2026-08-16-019-field-operation-service/ per the SDD\npost-merge convention (matches Changes 008-013 and 017-018).\n\nNo code, no config, no infra changes. Pure documentation\nplus archive bookkeeping. Vitest and Maven were already\ngreen on the underlying change.","tree":{"sha":"23460390b2dfd296febb3f7b58477af18620d458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/23460390b2dfd296febb3f7b58477af18620d458"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/commits/d3d39dee4bc5e638c00bbcd7c7b76c196059390a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","