/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commit/c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159","sha":"c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159"}],"sha":"3614091c4518bf0db1bdb9692f139e5c9aaabbf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/3614091c4518bf0db1bdb9692f139e5c9aaabbf5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T22:27:29Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T22:27:29Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"message":"feat(fe): ship Change 007 - frontend-shell\n\nNext.js 14 (App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind) shell for the Agro-IoT\nplatform. Ships the foundation that Changes 008 (dashboard), 009\n(mapping + fleet) and 010 (settings) will plug into.\n\nWhat you can do today:\n* /login and /register: split-screen dark UI talking to\n  auth-service through the api-gateway. The brand panel has\n  no tractor photo (per agreed change); it''s a modern gradient\n  + abstract SVG of field rows + subtle grid + glassmorphism\n  version chip.\n* Authenticated shell: collapsible sidebar, 50px header with a\n  Kafka \"On\" pill, logout button, user role pill. Active route\n  is highlighted.\n* Placeholder pages for /dashboard, /mapping, /fleet, /settings\n  render \"Change 0xx\" cards so the navigation is testable end to\n  end today.\n\nPlumbing that subsequent changes reuse:\n* Zustand auth store (token + user + hydrate from localStorage).\n* axios instance with a JWT interceptor that reads from the store.\n* TanStack Query with sensible defaults (no 4xx retries).\n* vitest + jsdom for unit tests of the store and the interceptor.\n\nCI:\n* New `build-frontend` job runs `npm ci && npm test && npm run\n  build` in parallel with the existing Maven `verify`.\n* docker-image.yml matrix gains `frontend-shell` (multi-stage\n  node:20-alpine, non-root `node` user, standalone output, port\n  3000).\n\nLocal validation (against the live docker stack):\n* npm test  -> 8/8 pass (5 store + 3 interceptor)\n* npm run build -> 10 static routes, /login + /register in 117 KB\n  First Load JS (under the 200 KB spec cap)\n* docker compose up -d frontend-shell -> container ready in 414ms\n* curl localhost:3000/login -> 200, renders the modern brand\n  panel + login form","tree":{"sha":"7efc9f8aea2868ea6e22d7f1e4a9f3582a4b5115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/7efc9f8aea2868ea6e22d7f1e4a9f3582a4b5115"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/commits/c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commit/c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159","node_id":"C_kwDOT5g0vtoAKGM1ZWRhMzM4MTkyYjJmMmE4ZDY0OWMyYjdmM2U5M2ExNjI1ZTgxNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commit/1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304","sha":"1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304"}],"sha":"c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/c5eda338192b2f2a8d649c2b7f3e93a1625e8159"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:59:12Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:59:12Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"message":"feat(sim): ship Change 006 - iot-simulator-service\n\nNode.js 20 + TypeScript producer of synthetic IoT telemetry.\nCloses the loop of Changes 003 (telemetry-ingestion-service) and\n004 (alert-processing-service): a fresh `docker compose up` now\nproduces alerts without any human in the loop.\n\n* src/generator/telemetryGenerator.ts: pure generator (no IO,\n  no Kafka). 3 machines, walking GPS, 5% anomaly injection\n  (engineTemp > 95 degC or rpm > 2500).\n* src/config/kafka.ts: KafkaJS client factory (WARN logLevel,\n  retry on disconnect, pluggable for tests).\n* src/index.ts: orchestrator. connect-with-retry, 1 Hz x 3\n  machines, SIGTERM handler, idempotent producer off.\n* src/generator/telemetryGenerator.test.ts: 4 cases on\n  node:test (anomaly temp, anomaly rpm, wire shape, determinism).\n  4/4 pass.\n* Dockerfile: multi-stage node:20-alpine, non-root USER node,\n  no exposed ports.\n* docker-compose.yml: enable iot-simulator-service block\n  (KAFKA_BROKER, depends_on kafka healthy, restart policy,\n  KAFKAJS_NO_PARTITIONER_WARNING=1).\n* package.json: kafkajs ^2.2.4 + dev deps (tsx, typescript,\n  @types/node). npm test + npm run build work.\n* changes/006-iot-simulator-service: SDD artifacts\n  (proposal / spec / design / tasks).\n\nEnd-to-end validation against the running stack:\n- agri.telemetry.raw offset rises at ~3 msg/s\n- telemetry.telemetry_events: 430+ rows persisted\n- alert.alerts: 21 CRITICAL + 23 WARNING (anomalies firing\n  every ~7 s, as expected from 5% x 3 machines)","tree":{"sha":"c6fe6d7dd01b439b9a433c0f5fe6fe05a6d65943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/c6fe6d7dd01b439b9a433c0f5fe6fe05a6d65943"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/commits/1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commit/1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304","node_id":"C_kwDOT5g0vtoAKDFjNmRjZWU2YTA3YzEzZDVmY2NhNmQ1MzA0Y2RmNzhjOTMwOTgzMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commit/e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9","sha":"e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9"}],"sha":"1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/1c6dcee6a07c13d5fcca6d5304cdf78c93098304"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:46:53Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:46:53Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"message":"fix(ci): normalise ghcr owner to lowercase, drop gha cache, pin build-push-action@v5\n\nEven after the matrix was fixed, buildx on the GHA runner still\nrejected the tag with \"repository name must be lowercase\" — the\nowner \"Rick-Henrique7\" has mixed case, and some buildx versions\nare strict about that.\n\nThe fix:\n- A small step computes `owner` (lowercased) and `image` and\n  exposes them as outputs. The next step uses those outputs in\n  the tag list, so the tag rendered into buildx is guaranteed\n  lowercase in the owner segment.\n- Switched docker/build-push-action from @v6 to @v5 (stable,\n  fewer tag-validation edge cases).\n- Removed the gha cache (cache-from / cache-to) for now — the\n  cache layer was another surface that could surface the same\n  \"must be lowercase\" complaint on cold runs.","tree":{"sha":"8d757fb2da9762515423c4aad411e85979aa3766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/8d757fb2da9762515423c4aad411e85979aa3766"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/commits/e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commit/e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9","node_id":"C_kwDOT5g0vtoAKGU4NjgwNWMwOWVlYzA3ZmFhN2QzMjRlMWM0ZGI2ZTg4MzBhODYwZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commit/338e924a5cbc903c8b2038d8e905484d2ab354e9","sha":"338e924a5cbc903c8b2038d8e905484d2ab354e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/338e924a5cbc903c8b2038d8e905484d2ab354e9"}],"sha":"e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/e86805c09eec07faa7d324e1c4db6e8830a860f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/338e924a5cbc903c8b2038d8e905484d2ab354e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:43:15Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:43:15Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"message":"fix(ci): rewrite docker-image matrix using include form\n\nGitHub Actions was mis-rendering the previous list-of-objects\nmatrix.service.name as the literal string \"Object\" (visible in\nthe job name \"Build and push image - Object\"), which then broke\nthe docker tag and made buildx fail with:\n\n  ERROR: invalid tag \".../agrio-auth-service:latest\":\n        repository name must be lowercase\n\nThe fix:\n- matrix.service is now a plain list of names\n- matrix.dockerfile is attached via `include`\n- All five services (api-gateway, auth-service,\n  telemetry-ingestion-service, alert-processing-service,\n  fleet-mapping-service) are now built and pushed to GHCR","tree":{"sha":"16538cfad91b960065bcb0bb5896de49601c82ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/16538cfad91b960065bcb0bb5896de49601c82ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/commits/338e924a5cbc903c8b2038d8e905484d2ab354e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"Rick-Henrique7","node_id":"U_kgDOCY3dtw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"ht