.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/efbfae755c01674e602c9788ac5671aa23192578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:35:42Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:35:42Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"message":"feat(fleet): ship Change 005 — fleet-mapping-service\n\nREST CRUD for equipment + field plots + deterministic heatmap data\non the fleet schema. Behind the api-gateway.\n\n* REST: GET/POST /api/v1/fleet (EquipmentDTO, validation, sort by id)\n* REST: GET  /api/v1/mapping/heatmaps?fieldId= (deterministic 8-point\n  ring at (-22, -47), intensity 0.6..1.0)\n* Persistence: JPA on PostgreSQL fleet schema (H2 in test profile)\n* Clean Architecture: domain has zero framework imports\n* ApiExceptionHandler: FLEET_VALIDATION_ERROR / MISSING_PARAMETER /\n  TYPE_MISMATCH / MALFORMED_REQUEST / INTERNAL_ERROR\n* SecurityConfig: permitAll (JWT enforcement stays at api-gateway)\n* Tests: 12/12 pass (3+2+4+3)\n* Docker: multi-stage, non-root, JRE 17 alpine, port 8084","tree":{"sha":"75b0139b7419e2cb1d0c535f2533f0259c2e35bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/75b0139b7419e2cb1d0c535f2533f0259c2e35bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/commits/efbfae755c01674e602c9788ac5671aa23192578","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rick-Henrique7","id":160292279,"login":"R