}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/ad7546058e4ab97d519f5aaa46db3ac2fd14f4ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:25:16Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T21:25:16Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"message":"feat: ship Changes 003 (telemetry-ingestion) and 004 (alert-processing)\n\nChange 003 - telemetry-ingestion-service\n- Kafka consumer of agri.telemetry.raw\n- Redis latest-state cache (telemetry:latest:<equipmentId>)\n- JPA history in telemetry.telemetry_events\n- Kafka producer for agri.telemetry.processed\n- 5/5 tests pass (3 use case + 2 @EmbeddedKafka)\n- end-to-end pipeline validated live in docker\n\nChange 004 - alert-processing-service\n- Kafka consumer of agri.telemetry.processed\n- AlertEvaluatorService: engineTemp>95 -> CRITICAL, rpm>2500 -> WARNING\n- JPA history in alert.alerts\n- STOMP WebSocket publisher to /topic/alerts\n- 10/10 tests pass (4 evaluator + 4 use case + 2 @EmbeddedKafka)\n- end-to-end validated: CRITICAL and WARNING rows in Postgres\n- init.sql: new alert schema + agrio_alert role\n- docker-compose: enable alert-processing-service block","tree":{"sha":"a4984d8290ca6e8b55db2b693803fbe19ba82da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/a4984d8290ca6e8b55db2b693803fbe19ba82da3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/commits/ad7546058e4ab97d519f5aaa46db3ac2fd14f4ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160292279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/events{/pri