://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rick-Henrique7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/commits/9e0210c06acf4a58f4474cfe481c8ac6081955c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:01:35Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:01:35Z","email":"henrique.mdsantos2003@gmail.com","name":"Rick-Henrique7"},"message":"feat: bootstrap Agro-IoT platform with SDD scaffolding\n\n- Multi-module Maven parent (Java 17, Spring Boot 3.3.4, Spring Cloud 2023.0.3)\n- api-gateway: Spring Cloud Gateway (WebFlux) with reactive JWT filter\n- auth-service: Spring Security + JPA + BCrypt + HS256 JWT issuer\n- docker-compose.yml: PostgreSQL + Redis + Kafka + Zookeeper + api-gateway + auth-service\n- init.sql: isolated schemas (auth, fleet, telemetry) with restricted roles\n- k8s/: namespace, configmap, secrets, deployments (api-gateway + telemetry)\n- .github/: CI workflow, Docker image workflow, PR/issue templates, CODEOWNERS, dependabot\n- changes/001-api-gateway and changes/002-auth-service: SDD artifacts (proposal/spec/design/tasks)\n- Maven Wrapper (mvnw + mvnw.cmd)\n- CONTRIBUTING.md, LICENSE (Apache 2.0), README updated\n\nAll 6 modules'' package trees and scaffolded pom.xml files in place.\nOther services (telemetry, alert, fleet, simulator) are tracked in\nsubsequent changes (003-006).","tree":{"sha":"31b86e91f8c749e88c7a69bfb58bbfe804b72b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/git/trees/31b86e91f8c749e88c7a69bfb58bbfe804b72b46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rick-Henrique7/sdd-iot-java/