Z","email":"kamerr_oficial@hotmail.com","name":"KamerrEzz"},"message":"feat: initial release of ZAI v0.3.0\n\nPersonal development toolkit on top of OpenCode that enforces process\ndiscipline at the tool level: a phase state machine, permission-scoped\nagents for a red/green/audit/document loop, and stack decision skills\nloaded on demand.\n\nModules:\n- core: .zai/state.json phase state machine, context-injection gate,\n  /zai-estado, /zai-init\n- phases: zai-planner/test-author/implementer/auditor/scribe agents,\n  /zai-fase-* command loop, test-lock gate, post-write typecheck/lint\n  gate, opt-in commit gate\n- stack: on-demand stack decision skills, context7-before-young-deps gate\n\nSee docs/RESEARCH.md for the verified OpenCode API contract this is\nbuilt on, docs/DECISIONS.md for every deviation and its justification,\nand docs/POSTMORTEM.md for an honest account of what is solid and what\nis not.","tree":{"sha":"4a67e401255e0d6b18a36737d7b5814668bf3d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KamerrEzz/zai/git/trees/4a67e401255e0d6b18a36737d7b5814668bf3d3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KamerrEzz/zai/git/commits/101d82bfa6234bf2b9eb6296472d6c6477040ced","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45726492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KamerrEzz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KamerrEzz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KamerrEzz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KamerrEzz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KamerrEzz","id":45726492,"login":"KamerrEzz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NzI2NDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KamerrEzz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KamerrEzz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KamerrEzz/repos","site_admin":