zUxYmUwNjc4NWJjOWQ0NzU0ODAzMGVjNWFiMzAwNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commit/441a4d1c3c08541e9e2d839478e4336aac47881b","sha":"441a4d1c3c08541e9e2d839478e4336aac47881b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commits/441a4d1c3c08541e9e2d839478e4336aac47881b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commit/f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d","sha":"f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commits/f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d"}],"sha":"8b6a8404351be06785bc9d47548030ec5ab30047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commits/8b6a8404351be06785bc9d47548030ec5ab30047"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15125586?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myhumblecoder","id":15125586,"login":"myhumblecoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTI1NTg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commits/f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T20:09:12Z","email":"thomasfgooch@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Gooch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T20:09:12Z","email":"thomasfgooch@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Gooch"},"message":"Say which model is answering, at startup\n\nThe hub prints one line when it starts:\n\n  assistant: qwen2.5:7b on http://host.docker.internal:11434 (local, no API cost)\n  assistant: claude-opus-5 via the Anthropic API (metered — every turn is billed)\n  assistant: off (no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY — set one, or PORTAL_MODEL_PROVIDER=ollama…)\n  assistant: off (PORTAL_AGENT=off)\n  assistant: misconfigured — PORTAL_MODEL_PROVIDER=\"ollma\" is not a provider…\n\nThis exists because the answer was invisible from outside the process and\nI got it wrong twice the same way: the provider is chosen per\n`docker compose` invocation, an omitted variable falls back to the\nmetered API, and nothing said so. The evidence that a hub was billing\narrived as an invoice.\n\nThe review then caught the same failure inside the fix. The line reported\nwhat the model *resolved to* rather than whether the assistant was\n*enabled*, so a stack with no API key — which is what compose passes by\ndefault — announced `claude-opus-5 … (metered)` while `/api/agent`\nanswered 404. A line that says the wrong thing is worse than no line,\nwhich is the sentence this was written under. It now asks the same\npredicates the route is gated on, and a test asserts the two can never\ndisagree.\n\nIt also caught that this added ten edge-runtime build errors. Next emits\nan Edge Instrumentation entry unconditionally, so importing the agent\nmodule from `instrumentation.ts` dragged `node:crypto`, `node:fs` and the\nAnthropic SDK into it — and the `NEXT_RUNTIME` guard cannot help, because\nmodules evaluate before `register()` runs. The env-only half moved to\n`lib/model.ts`, which imports three constants and a type. Measured\nagainst `origin/main`: zero before, ten with the first commit, zero now.\n\nSmaller, from the same pass: credentials in `PORTAL_OLLAMA_URL` were\nprinted verbatim and are stripped; opted-out tenants are counted but\nnever named, because a startup line gets pasted into issues and tenant\nids are customer identifiers; and a non-Error throw reported `undefined`.\n\nThe runbook now says to read this line rather than infer the model from\nwhat you set, which is the mistake it exists to prevent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0198VEh84szLssJuB1PpJF6p","tree":{"sha":"4042315fe4031112ae51272e32e82bd02edf9716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/git/trees/4042315fe4031112ae51272e32e82bd02edf9716"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/git/commits/f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15125586?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myhumblecoder","id":15125586,"login":"myhumblecoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTI1NTg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commit/f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d","node_id":"C_kwDOT57zN9oAKGYzODBkM2M3OTM2ZmVkNzhjZmJmYTk5YjgzODY2NTNlOWJkYjc5NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commit/441a4d1c3c08541e9e2d839478e4336aac47881b","sha":"441a4d1c3c08541e9e2d839478e4336aac47881b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commits/441a4d1c3c08541e9e2d839478e4336aac47881b"}],"sha":"f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commits/f380d3c7936fed78cfbfa99b8386653e9bdb796d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15125586?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myhumblecoder","id":15125586,"login":"myhumblecoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTI1NTg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myhumblecoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myhumblecoder-dev/dynamic-portal/commits/441a4d1c3c08541e9e2d839478e4336aac47881b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:43:10Z","email":"15125586+myhumblecoder@users.noreply.github.com","name":"MyHumbleCoder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:43:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #37 from 