Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f737f1ca81f1df39a7c7949fc65e2f62cc9667c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/f737f1ca81f1df39a7c7949fc65e2f62cc9667c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/8df1325b44f0fe52b1abb51e8fd904c84a39c643","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/8df1325b44f0fe52b1abb51e8fd904c84a39c643","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDhkZjEzMjViNDRmMGZlNTJiMWFiYjUxZThmZDkwNGM4NGEzOWM2NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47","sha":"c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47"}],"sha":"8df1325b44f0fe52b1abb51e8fd904c84a39c643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8df1325b44f0fe52b1abb51e8fd904c84a39c643"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:07:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:07:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: add Helm chart for app, middleware, bff and shell\n\nPackages the four application-layer services from docker-compose.yaml\n(app, middleware, backoffice-bff, backoffice-shell) as a Helm chart.\nMySQL/Redis/Kafka/Vault are left external via global.* values. Verified\nwith helm lint and helm template (default values, ingress enabled,\nexistingSecret, custom gatewayUri, and a disabled component).","tree":{"sha":"7b42af6b831d7f3b2a95e19a7840e5f01dde7353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/7b42af6b831d7f3b2a95e19a7840e5f01dde7353"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGMwOTczZjc4OTNlYjEwMjZlODI4MDRkN2Y3ODgzZDQ3NzExZjFiNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e","sha":"0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e"}],"sha":"c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/c0973f7893eb1026e82804d7f7883d47711f1b47"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:44:46Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:44:46Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: stop dropping the user session while actively using the app\n\nThe session cookie''s lifetime was being clamped to the OIDC access\ntoken''s own short expiry on every login, and the refresh token stored\nin the session was never used. Once the access token lapsed, every\nGateway call 401''d and the frontend force-logged the user out.\n\nThe session cookie now keeps its configured 8h lifetime, and\nSessionAccessTokenGuard silently refreshes the access token via the\nrefresh token before it expires, so an active session survives past\nthe access token''s TTL without forcing a re-login.","tree":{"sha":"f3c68a523ec289e8aa4b5dddaa8400e9ffdf8e48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/f3c68a523ec289e8aa4b5dddaa8400e9ffdf8e48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDBlM2ZkODA5ODJiNDc5MmM0ZGRhZjAxYjFmMTQ0MDYxYmI5ZTYyOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66","sha":"21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66"}],"sha":"0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/0e3fd80982b4792c4ddaf01b1f144061bb9e628e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:44:33Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:44:33Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: align Integraciones page header/tabs and Flows metrics with the design\n\nMoves the page header (title, description, create button) above the\nIntegration Profiles/Flows tabs to match the mock, and extends the\nFlows KPI cards and table with real per-flow and tenant-wide execution\nmetrics (p50, last-run step count, error step count, execs/error/p95\nper row) instead of placeholder text.","tree":{"sha":"e2f38bfa896baa25eac4baaa0ba05e9057fee3f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/e2f38bfa896baa25eac4baaa0ba05e9057fee3f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDIxMzIyMDgwZGMwZjY3OTk1M2RiYzFlM2YxNWVkMmQyMmI5NjBhNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7","sha":"b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7"}],"sha":"21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/21322080dc0f679953dbc1e3f15ed2d22b960a66"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:44:16Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:44:16Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: align Monitor de mensajes with the design (filters + pagination)\n\nAdds PROFILE/DESDE/HASTA filters (backend + BFF + frontend) and\nclient-side pagination with page-size selector, matching the Claude\nDesign mock for the Monitor de mensajes page.","tree":{"sha":"b5d659bc993de8de0004384ac0f0360b9fd75b6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/b5d659bc993de8de0004384ac0f0360b9fd75b6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGI3NjY4M2EzYmU4NmEyN2M0YzhmNmFhZWI4YjA4OTMzZTA2MmRjZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6","sha":"1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6"}],"sha":"b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b76683a3be86a27c4c8f6aaeb8b08933e062dce7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T02:37:55Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T02:37:55Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: JSON/TREE payload view with drag-and-drop into Source Path\n\nAligns the Mapping & Transformation tab''s sample-payload panel with\nthe Claude Design mock: a JSON/TREE toggle over the textarea, a\ncollapsible tree view that generates real JSONPath per node (matching\nFieldMappingPayloadTransformer''s use of com.jayway.jsonpath), and\ndrag-and-drop from any tree node onto a FIELD_MAPPING row''s Source\nPath input.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"fecfb7eea14f4550cc4183fffdf57467919ebfda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/fecfb7eea14f4550cc4183fffdf57467919ebfda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDFmNDA3YThkODA3YzZlNjM5YzA0NDg0Y2JlOTYwOTlhZmJmMGFiZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053","sha":"f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053"}],"sha":"1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1f407a8d807c6e639c04484cbe96099afbf0abd6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:31:50Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:31:50Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: proxy execution-step endpoints and render real step data in the UI\n\nBFF proxies GET flows/:flowId/executions and .../executions/:executionId.\nExecution detail view now colors graph nodes by real per-step status and\nrenders the Timeline from real FlowExecutionStep rows, falling back to\nthe aggregate-only summary row when an execution reported no steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"6802533c9c5bb6878e05eca2e491c1a4e9616af3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/6802533c9c5bb6878e05eca2e491c1a4e9616af3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGY5NjYwMzk4MTA5NzZiZTg4MDExMWZiYjM3MzE1NjA5NzZkNTYwNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040","sha":"eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040"}],"sha":"f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f966039810976be880111fbb3731560976d56053"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:12:41Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:12:41Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: persist and expose real FlowExecutionStep data\n\nAdds a FlowExecutionStep domain model + V16 migration, extends the\nexisting execution-report contract with an optional steps list, and\nexposes GET /api/v1/flows/:flowId/executions and\nGET .../executions/:executionId with real step data. No internal\nflow-running engine exists yet, so steps are reported the same way\nexecutions already are: by whatever external system ran the flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"a90ae856058e490c6732bdcf6bc8b9cf498ef45c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/a90ae856058e490c6732bdcf6bc8b9cf498ef45c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGViMDQxYzE2NDZmYmJjYTAzNzY0MDFlYmY3ZGExYzc2MDZiNGUwNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea","sha":"0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea"}],"sha":"eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/eb041c1646fbbca0376401ebf7da1c7606b4e040"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:01:45Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:01:45Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: wire the flow transformation editor to the real backend preview\n\nProxies POST /api/v1/transformations/preview through the BFF the same\nway every other route does. The flow canvas''s transformation editor\nmodal (JSLT/Velocity/Mustache) now debounces script/sample/engine\nchanges 400ms and calls FlowService.previewTransformation() for a real\nserver-side result, replacing the previous \"preview not available\"\nmessage for JSLT/Velocity and the client-only minimal Mustache\ninterpolation — all three engines now show the actual backend output\nor a real error, with an \"Evaluando…\" state while pending.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"d092f7fe857a549a292de329d375a728313ee06d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/d092f7fe857a549a292de329d375a728313ee06d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDA0MDljNzAxZGQ3NzMwNTkwNTZmNWE4YzRlMDZhOGE2MzFhYTcwZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4","sha":"96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4"}],"sha":"0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/0409c701dd773059056f5a8c4e06a8a631aa70ea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:00:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:00:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: real Velocity and Mustache transformation engines (backend)\n\nAdds VELOCITY and MUSTACHE to TransformationEngineType and two new\nPayloadTransformer implementations, following the exact same contract\nJSLT already uses (extract \"script\" from the config JSON or accept a\nraw template string, throw TransformationException on failure,\ntransform(source, config) -> String):\n\n- MustachePayloadTransformer: com.github.spullara.mustache.java\n  (JMustache), templates compiled+cached per unique template string,\n  data context built via ObjectMapper.convertValue into a Map so\n  nested {{a.b.c}} paths and {{#section}} loops work against the\n  parsed JSON payload.\n- VelocityPayloadTransformer: org.apache.velocity:velocity-engine-core\n  2.4.1, using VelocityEngine.evaluate() (no manual AST caching — the\n  2.4.x API dropped the old LogChute log SPI in favor of straight\n  SLF4J, which this app already has wired via Spring Boot, so the\n  constructor needs no custom logging setup either). Exposes the\n  payload both as $root (matches the mock''s Velocity examples) and as\n  bare top-level variables.\n\nBoth got unit tests mirroring JsltPayloadTransformerTest''s structure\n(engine type, interpolation/sections/foreach, raw-script fallback,\nblank source/config handling, validation success and failure).\n\nAlso added a new, deliberately profile-independent preview surface —\nTransformationPreviewService + POST /api/v1/transformations/preview\n(TransformationController) — because the flow canvas''s per-node\ntransform editor has no Integration Profile to anchor\nMappingDryRunService''s dry-run against (different bounded context: a\nwhole profile''s field mapping vs. one flow node''s standalone script).\nThis is also literally the endpoint path the original design mock''s\nown footer text names for this editor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"efbf773b0058156c706ab045e2ead7485b608f84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/efbf773b0058156c706ab045e2ead7485b608f84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDk2ZTlhYzQ1ZmFhMWVmZWVhNmM5ZGYyNzUzZTYyNjQ1ZTU1Yzk5YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638","sha":"8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638"}],"sha":"96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/96e9ac45faa1efeea6c9df2753e62645e55c99a4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:37:07Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:37:07Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: multi-port edge labels in the read-only execution graph\n\nApplies the same fromPort/label rendering the designer already has\n(shared via flow-node-catalog''s portOffsetY) to the execution detail''s\nread-only Grafo mode, and stops readGraph() from silently dropping\nfromPort/label/fields when parsing a flow''s saved graph JSON — those\nfields were being read by the designer but discarded here, which is\nwhy ROUTER_IF/SWITCH_CASE branch labels never showed up in this view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"6c01b7c92a552ef3a2bbe73d867782a8ee05dd56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/6c01b7c92a552ef3a2bbe73d867782a8ee05dd56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDhkNzlkZDBkYTM4NTAzZTZjOWJlMmVhY2U4ZDBkOTYyYjk0NzA2Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22","sha":"e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22"}],"sha":"8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8d79dd0da38503e6c9be2eace8d0d962b9470638"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:49:46Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:49:46Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: wire the Extracción SQL \"Probar consulta\" button to the real backend\n\nProxies POST .../integration-profiles/:id/extraction/dry-run through\nthe BFF the same way every other integration-profiles route already\ndoes (GatewayProxyController -> GatewayProxyService.forward()).\n\nThe button is no longer permanently disabled: it now calls\nIntegrationProfileService.extractionDryRun(), shows \"Ejecutando…\"\nwhile pending, and renders the returned rows as a simple column/row\ntable (columns derived from the first row''s keys) or the backend''s\nerror message on failure. Updated the one spec that asserted the old\ndisabled state to instead assert the real POST + rendered rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"ce8837c7d98853d9151367058f48975ae2b43b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/ce8837c7d98853d9151367058f48975ae2b43b8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGU1ZGQzNjkzY2M1OGI2MGQ0YWJkZmEwMWY4Y2MwOGY2ODFkMTBkMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d","sha":"af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d"}],"sha":"e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/e5dd3693cc58b60d4abdfa01f8cc08f681d10d22"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:49:27Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:49:27Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: add a real dry-run endpoint for JDBC extraction queries\n\nFollows the mapping dry-run''s exact pattern (profileService.get() for\ntenant-scoped config, a dedicated *DryRunResult record, a service with\nno request body needed since the config already lives on the profile,\nwired through the controller with TenantContext.requireTenantId()).\n\n- ExtractionDryRunService resolves the profile''s credentialRef via the\n  existing SecretResolver, opens a short-lived HikariDataSource via the\n  existing JdbcDataSourceFactory, and runs the already-configured query\n  through GenericJdbcAdapter.extract() with Instant.EPOCH as the\n  watermark (a dry-run has nothing to resume from, so this matches\n  every row the `>= :param` predicate would ever select) — no new SQL\n  execution path, reuses the same adapter production sync uses.\n  Truncates the result to 20 rows in-memory rather than injecting a\n  LIMIT clause, since the query is arbitrary user SQL.\n- Deliberately does NOT go through ResilienceExecutor''s per-tenant\n  circuit breaker — that''s shared state with production sync runs, and\n  a manual test click shouldn''t be able to trip or reset it.\n- New POST /api/v1/integration-profiles/{profileId}/extraction/dry-run\n  on IntegrationProfileController, mirroring mapping/dry-run.\n- Fixed IntegrationProfileControllerTest: it''s a @WebMvcTest slice with\n  one @MockitoBean per controller dependency, so the new constructor\n  parameter needed its own mock or the whole slice''s context fails to\n  wire (this broke live class loading, not the new endpoint''s own\n  tests — there were none of those to break).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"090a4f577de1b8a319f9f7e5ae82e335424a0e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/090a4f577de1b8a319f9f7e5ae82e335424a0e23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGFmNmM1YmM2Mzc5Nzc0ZGZkN2Y0ZGI4Yzk2YWRlMGYzZGE4MmY3MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f","sha":"f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f"}],"sha":"af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/af6c5bc6379774dfd7f4db8c96ade0f3da82f71d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:29:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:29:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: multi-port output edges for ROUTER_IF/SWITCH_CASE in the flow canvas\n\nMatches the mock''s NODE_SPEC exactly: ROUTER_IF has fixed true/false\noutput ports, SWITCH_CASE has one port per case name plus a trailing\ndefault. FlowGraphEdge.fromPort (previously an unused `number`) is now\na `string` naming the source port — omitted entirely for every other\nnode type, which keeps existing single-port edges (and any already\nsaved without the field) valid with no migration.\n\n- flow-node-catalog.ts: outputPortsFor(node) derives the port list\n  (ROUTER_IF fixed, SWITCH_CASE from the node''s new comma-separated\n  `cases` field, everything else a single unnamed '''' port), and\n  portOffsetY(node, port) places each port evenly down the node''s\n  right edge — same formula the mock uses (NODE_H*(i+1)/(outs+1)).\n  SWITCH_CASE''s `cases` field renders in the properties panel through\n  the existing generic field-list machinery, no new UI needed for it.\n- Dragging from a specific port now records that port on the temp\n  edge, on the created edge (fromPort + label), and the drop-target\n  duplicate check compares fromPort too so two branches to the same\n  target aren''t treated as one edge.\n- edgePaths() computes each edge''s start point from its own node+port\n  instead of assuming the node''s vertical center, and renders the port\n  name as a small label near the edge''s start (absolute-positioned\n  span, not part of the SVG, so it stays legible at any zoom).\n\nRead-only execution-detail graph rendering intentionally left at the\nold single-offset behavior — out of this pass''s stated scope (canvas\ncreation/interaction), and it degrades harmlessly (edges from a\nmulti-port node just render from the node''s vertical center there).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"9f77c478b9042481bbd092442e40cb31ac424ed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/9f77c478b9042481bbd092442e40cb31ac424ed3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGYwOWJlODFlYjAwYTcwMGYzODdhMmYyYWI0MzIxYWM2NjI5YmQ5OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86","sha":"403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86"}],"sha":"f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f09be81eb00a700f387a2f2ab4321ac6629bd98f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:22:44Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:22:44Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: add the Extracción SQL tab (JDBC-only) to the profile detail view\n\nChecked first: \"Sincronización\" is a real-sync trigger + log, a\ndifferent concept from the mock''s \"Extracción SQL\" tab (SQL query +\nwatermark/batch config) — nothing to rename, this was a genuine\nmissing tab. Also confirmed the mock''s \"Pruebas\" concept already\nexists, fully backend-backed, inside the \"Mapping & Transformation\"\ntab (the dry-run tester wired to POST .../mapping/dry-run) — no need\nto add a separate tab for that.\n\n- New ''extract'' tab, shown only when configuration.protocol === ''JDBC''\n  (tabs is now a computed filtering on editModel().protocol, checked\n  against the unfiltered tab list in ngOnInit''s query-param hydration\n  so a direct ?tab=extract link isn''t dropped by a race with the\n  profile still loading).\n- Edits extractionConfigJson''s query/watermarkParam/watermarkColumn/\n  keyColumn/fetchSize/batchMode/batchSize through the same\n  parsePolicy()+updatePolicyField() pattern already used for sync/\n  retry/rate-limit policies — reused, not reinvented.\n- Confirmed there is no JDBC extraction dry-run endpoint anywhere\n  (GenericJdbcAdapter has no test-query method, IntegrationProfileController''s\n  only dry-run is mapping/dry-run). \"Probar consulta\" is present but\n  disabled with a tooltip naming the endpoint that would be needed,\n  and the result panel says plainly why it''s empty instead of faking\n  a live query run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"4989756cd307d1c4d829cec50c3b60a5c08c8a64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/4989756cd307d1c4d829cec50c3b60a5c08c8a64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDQwM2MwMjViNTc1NWMyZDFmOThjMWE0YjBiYjhkYTUzZGU1ODFkODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951","sha":"9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951"}],"sha":"403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/403c025b5755c2d1f98c1a4b0bb8da53de581d86"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:12:24Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:12:24Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: add step sidebar and field hints to the Integration Profile wizard\n\nChecked first: the wizard was already a proper multi-step guided flow\n(Dominio y fuente / Dirección y source of truth / Conectividad /\nRevisión) with an expert-mode JSON toggle, protocol/connector/adapter/\nendpoint/credentialRef in the connectivity step, and validation +\ntests around next()/submit(). No restructuring needed or done — this\nwas purely the visual gap against the mock''s 244px step sidebar with\nnumbered dots and per-step hints (previously just a plain subtitle\nline), a sliding switch for \"Modo experto\" (was a plain button), and\nshort Spanish help text under each guided field (matching the mock''s\nper-field `hint` copy).\n\nAdded a backward-only goToStep() for the sidebar (jumping ahead still\nrequires next()''s validation, so the connectivity guard — protocol set\nwithout connector/adapter — can''t be bypassed by clicking ahead).\nExisting [name=\"...\"] / [data-testid=\"wizard-next\"] selectors and all\nthree wizard specs are untouched and still pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"c4fcd893bf1db67d696ac38aae15d30a1fa9b711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/c4fcd893bf1db67d696ac38aae15d30a1fa9b711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDk1MTJkNTA4NzYxOGIyYzFhZjM5NWFhMzRhYTA1Njc4NWU3M2Y5NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc","sha":"419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc"}],"sha":"9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9512d5087618b2c1af395aa34aa056785e73f951"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:06:30Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:06:30Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"test: add specs for the flow execution list and detail components\n\nCovers the pieces added two passes ago that had no test coverage yet:\nlisting + client-side KPI computation + failure filter + navigation to\ndetail on FlowExecutionsComponent, and graph rendering + timeline mode\n+ disabled replay button + back-navigation + the unavailable fallback\non FlowExecutionDetailComponent. Both mock ActivatedRoute directly\n(same pattern as flow-designer.component.spec.ts) and route through\nCONSOLE_ROUTES (same pattern as flow-list.component.spec.ts) so\nnavigation assertions exercise the real registered paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"ec5ab195fee37ae5e023eee3d00454f9b5fd8433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/ec5ab195fee37ae5e023eee3d00454f9b5fd8433"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDQxOWI5YmJiYmU5NDhkZGZkZjM1ZGFiMmNkNzY4ZmU2NmM3ZTVkY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a","sha":"1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a"}],"sha":"419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/419b9bbbbe948ddfdf35dab2cd768fe66c7e5dcc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:03:37Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:03:37Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: add JSLT/Velocity/Mustache transformation editor modal to the flow canvas\n\nChecked first whether this already existed: IntegrationProfileDetail\nalready has a mature mapping editor (FIELD_MAPPING/JSLT/PASSTHROUGH)\nbacked by a real POST .../integration-profiles/:id/mapping/dry-run\nendpoint — that''s a different bounded context (a whole profile''s field\nmapping) and was left untouched. The gap from the .dc.html mock is the\nflow canvas''s per-node transform editor (JSLT/Velocity/Mustache), which\nonly had a plain textarea for the node''s \"script\" field until now.\n\n- \"Abrir editor de transformaciones\" button appears in the properties\n  panel for TRANSFORM_JSLT/VELOCITY/MUSTACHE/SCRIPT nodes, opening a\n  modal (reusing the global .modal-overlay/.modal classes) with an\n  engine tab switcher, a template textarea, a sample-payload JSON\n  textarea, and a live preview pane. Saving writes script+sample back\n  onto the node''s fields.\n- Preview is honest about what''s real: TransformationEngineType on the\n  backend only has FIELD_MAPPING/JSLT/PASSTHROUGH — no Velocity, no\n  Mustache — and the one dry-run endpoint that exists needs an\n  Integration Profile id, not a standalone flow node. So Mustache gets\n  a genuine client-side preview (minimal `{{a.b.c}}` interpolation, no\n  new dependency), while JSLT/Velocity show a clear \"preview no\n  disponible sin backend\" message instead of a fabricated result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"93022c81ba99b2883f806fe1e10c970414976014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/93022c81ba99b2883f806fe1e10c970414976014"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDFiMGQzYTZhN2U1MmQyYWU5Njc5ODBkMTkwZDYxZDJlZjViMWE3MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7","sha":"9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7"}],"sha":"1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1b0d3a6a7e52d2ae967980d190d61d2ef5b1a70a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:58:09Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:58:09Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: add flow execution list and per-execution Grafo/Timeline detail\n\nExtracted the node categorization/coloring shared by the designer and\nthis new view into flow-node-catalog.ts (previously private to\nFlowDesignerComponent) so the execution detail''s read-only graph reuses\nthe exact same category colors instead of duplicating the mapping.\n\n- FlowExecutionsComponent: per-flow execution list at\n  /integration/flows/:flowId/executions, reached via a new \"Ver\n  ejecuciones\" button on the designer header. KPI cards (count, error\n  rate, p95 duration) are computed client-side from the fetched list;\n  a Todas/Con fallos filter matches the two states the domain model\n  actually has (FlowExecutionStatus is SUCCESS|FAILURE — there is no\n  RUNNING concept, so the mock''s third filter tab was dropped rather\n  than faked).\n- FlowExecutionDetailComponent: per-execution page with a Grafo/\n  Timeline toggle. Grafo renders the flow''s saved graph read-only\n  (no drag, no ports, no palette) using the shared category colors.\n  Timeline is a single summary row, not a per-node list, because the\n  domain model has no step-by-step history — see the code comment on\n  readGraph() explaining that gap (FlowExecutionStep doesn''t exist:\n  no entity, no migration, no orchestrator instrumentation). The\n  \"Reprocesar\" button is present but disabled with a tooltip naming\n  the endpoint it would need, per the same reasoning.\n- FlowService.listExecutions/getExecution call GET endpoints the\n  backend doesn''t expose yet (only POST .../executions to report one\n  exists) — documented in a code comment; both views fall back to the\n  existing \"no disponible\" empty-state pattern used elsewhere in this\n  app for undeployed backend pieces, so nothing is faked or broken.\n\nNo new backend endpoints were added in this pass — FlowController only\nhas create/report, no list/get for executions — see the service''s\ndoc comment for the exact shape the next backend pass should expose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"b9df1eca5f726593f0ee6e9996a6bcd67775940b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/b9df1eca5f726593f0ee6e9996a6bcd67775940b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDljNzU1ZGIzZDA0ZGVmODBmZmRhNjg2ODE1ZGUwZjY0YTVkYjJhZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720","sha":"5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720"}],"sha":"9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9c755db3d04def80ffda686815de0f64a5db2ae7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:47:28Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:47:28Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: interactive edge creation/deletion and expression fields in the flow canvas\n\n- Each node with outputs (all but TARGET types) gets a small circular\n  output port on its right edge. Dragging from it draws a dashed\n  temporary bezier that follows the cursor; releasing over another\n  node creates a `{from, to}` edge in the graph (no-op on self-drop or\n  an already-existing edge). Local canvas coordinates are computed off\n  the canvas-surface''s bounding rect via a ViewChild, so this works\n  correctly regardless of scroll position.\n- Edge paths are now clickable (`pointer-events: stroke` overrides the\n  SVG layer''s own `pointer-events: none`) to select them; the\n  properties panel shows the selected edge''s endpoints with a delete\n  button. Node and edge selection are mutually exclusive, and clicking\n  empty canvas clears both.\n- TRANSFORM/CONTROL/SPLIT node types whose model already carries an\n  expression-like field (JSLT/Velocity/Mustache scripts, Router/Switch/\n  Filter conditions, Aggregator completeness expression) render that\n  field as a monospace textarea with the design''s sample expression as\n  placeholder, instead of a single-line input.\n- The grid fallback layout (for drafts without per-node x/y) now scales\n  its column count to roughly sqrt(nodeCount) instead of a fixed 4, so\n  large drafts spread into a squarer layout; cell spacing is unchanged\n  so nodes never overlap at any count.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"04f51b546a1178400d1d5f978cce04d93619826c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/04f51b546a1178400d1d5f978cce04d93619826c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDVjM2UxZjFkN2EzNWVjN2Q1M2Q1MWFjZTBlMWM5ZTcyYzQ1MDU3MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c","sha":"88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c"}],"sha":"5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/5c3e1f1d7a35ec7d53d51ace0e1c9e72c4505720"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:40:33Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:40:33Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: replace flow designer''s raw-JSON editor with a visual node canvas\n\nThe Claude Design mock for Integration Console specifies a drag-and-drop\nnode canvas (nodes positioned absolutely, categorized by SOURCE/TRANSFORM/\nCONTROL/SPLIT/TARGET, SVG bezier edges, a type palette, and a per-node\nproperties panel) — the previous designer only exposed a textarea with\nthe flow''s graph as raw JSON.\n\n- Add FlowGraph/FlowGraphNode/FlowGraphEdge to the flow model, with\n  optional x/y so drafts saved before this change (or without layout\n  metadata) still parse via an automatic grid fallback.\n- Render nodes as absolutely-positioned, category-colored boxes on a\n  pannable canvas, with edges drawn as an SVG bezier overlay.\n- Drag-to-reposition via mousedown + window-level mousemove/mouseup\n  (position kept in the component''s signal state only, not persisted\n  as a separate concept — it round-trips through draftGraph like any\n  other node field).\n- Click a node to open a properties panel (name + a handful of basic\n  text fields per node type from a small catalog) and to remove it.\n- A left-side palette groups addable node types by category, matching\n  the mock''s SOURCE/TRANSFORM/CONTROL/SPLIT/TARGET grouping.\n- Kept the existing name/trigger/save/publish/versions flow and the\n  hasDraft-based publish-enablement semantics the existing spec relies\n  on (draftGraph null vs. present, independent of node count).\n\nInteractive edge creation, the SpEL/JSLT expression editor, and the\ntransformation-preview modal from the mock are intentionally out of\nscope for this pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"d2b02fd116e2bee8fe48fb5a794afdbcb7b3e85b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/d2b02fd116e2bee8fe48fb5a794afdbcb7b3e85b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDg4ZjBlNmI0NjFjYjQwMTVkZWYwZTQ0ZWM4YTZhMTEyNWY0ZTVjOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc","sha":"2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc"}],"sha":"88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/88f0e6b461cb4015def0e44ec8a6a1125f4e5c9c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:43:02Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:43:02Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: define graphify and worktree rules","tree":{"sha":"6f82a111ff7a75900c4d6dca06f7462372ad75e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/6f82a111ff7a75900c4d6dca06f7462372ad75e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDJmMDJkMjU2ODJlZDlmM2IyNTlhZWJiMjc0ZjZkYTMzNjcyODVkY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a","sha":"317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a"}],"sha":"2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2f02d25682ed9f3b259aebb274f6da3367285dcc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:38:38Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:38:38Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"chore: publish accumulated integration and backoffice changes","tree":{"sha":"1c90eb7724dceed5c869c503ffb0e2a2e87bd31f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/1c90eb7724dceed5c869c503ffb0e2a2e87bd31f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDMxN2Q5NThiMmUyZmFiMTQwY2Q2MGQ2OWQ3NjRkNzRhZWUzNmYwM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04","sha":"bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04"}],"sha":"317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/317d958b2e2fab140cd60d69d764d74aee36f03a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:22:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:22:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Merge integration sync scheduler fixes into main\n\nRebased the stale worktree-integration-sync-scheduler branch (208\ncommits behind) onto main. Most of its commits were already present\nin main in equivalent form; the 4 that remained add extractionConfig\npersistence coverage, cross-tenant protocol listing, GenericJdbcAdapter\nbean registration, and a watermark-rewind / malformed-syncPolicy fix\nin IntegrationSyncOrchestrator (ported onto main''s current file\nlayout and orchestrator version).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXTV5ukito4fdZk8XAk3t8","tree":{"sha":"413a134a4749446aec08ccd72050b1515f80a76d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/413a134a4749446aec08ccd72050b1515f80a76d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGJiODg0ZDczYmI0ZDk0Y2Y3MGNlZGNlMTI2ZDc4ZjkzM2RkZWJjMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef","sha":"84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0","sha":"8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0"}],"sha":"bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/bb884d73bb4d94cf70cedce126d78f933ddebc04"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:45:46Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:14:19Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: prevent watermark rewind and fail fast on malformed syncPolicy\n\nReview found two defects in IntegrationSyncOrchestrator:\n- A boundary row (timestamp == current watermark) never advances\n  maxRowTimestamp past the seeded watermark, so every subsequent run\n  recomputed watermark - overlapBufferSeconds, rewinding the watermark\n  backward indefinitely and re-publishing an ever-growing window of\n  old rows. Fixed by clamping the advanced watermark to never go\n  earlier than the current watermark.\n- Malformed syncPolicy JSON was silently swallowed and treated as\n  overlapBufferSeconds=0, disabling the safety buffer with no log or\n  failure. Now propagates as a run failure (consistent with how\n  malformed extractionConfig is already handled), recorded via\n  SyncStateRecorder like any other misconfiguration.\n\nAdds three tests: boundary-row watermark no-rewind, empty-rows\nwatermark-unchanged (coverage gap), and malformed-syncPolicy fails\nthe run.","tree":{"sha":"413a134a4749446aec08ccd72050b1515f80a76d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/413a134a4749446aec08ccd72050b1515f80a76d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDg1MDdmOTJiOThiM2Q5NTNkOWM3Yzc4ZmRiYmQwNWFjMTRmMjFmYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862","sha":"af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862"}],"sha":"8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8507f92b98b3d953d9c7c78fdbbd05ac14f21fb0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:04:16Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:11:22Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: register GenericJdbcAdapter and SqlSecurityValidator as Spring beans\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1508ff748b3225658cb59c7f80e5c4ac59ad852b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/1508ff748b3225658cb59c7f80e5c4ac59ad852b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGFmOGQ5NGRhMzBkYTNlYzZkYTU3YTFiNDdlZDllOTc1YjdiMTc4NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5","sha":"4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5"}],"sha":"af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/af8d94da30da3ec6da57a1b47ed9e975b7b17862"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:47:06Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:10:56Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: list active integration profiles by protocol across all tenants\n\nAdds IntegrationProfileRepository.findAllActiveByProtocol so the\nbackground scheduler can find active JDBC profiles across every\ntenant, since existing lookups are all tenant-scoped. Also updates\nthe two collaborators that the interface change touches: the fake\nrepository in IntegrationProfileServiceTest and the architectural\nguard test asserting Spring Data lookups are tenant-scoped (this one\nmethod is a deliberate, documented exception).","tree":{"sha":"bb767e2165a9ee4da2d7b60c6591fd8918e2bd82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/bb767e2165a9ee4da2d7b60c6591fd8918e2bd82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDQ1NTliYTVhMjU2ZDZmNTM4MmY3NzRkN2FmMzc1NjhmNjExMDcxYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa","sha":"3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa"}],"sha":"4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4559ba5a256d6f5382f774d7af37568f611071b5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:15:47Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:08:59Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: persist extractionConfig on integration profiles\n\nAdds extractionConfig as the 11th field on IntegrationProfileConfiguration,\nfollowing the exact pattern used for mapping/syncPolicy: domain record,\nJPA entity column (extraction_config_json via V6 migration), repository\nupdate query, and request/response DTOs. Also fixes a stale migration-count\nassertion (hasSize(4) -> hasSize(6)) in IntegrationProfilePersistenceAdapterTest\nthat predated migration V5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58746f3d84c0700bd54df29efa3794f935672fc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/58746f3d84c0700bd54df29efa3794f935672fc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDM1NDZjY2RiZDI4Yjg2MzUxMDNjYTBhNTZiMWU1OGY2MTA5NGVhZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef","sha":"84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef"}],"sha":"3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/3546ccdbd28b8635103ca0a56b1e58f61094eafa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:21:57Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:21:57Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: make FIELD_MAPPING row inputs actually editable\n\nSOURCE PATH and TRANSFORM used (change) instead of (input), so any\napp-wide change detection tick mid-keystroke reverted typed text back\nto the stale bound value (change detection re-runs on the OnPush\ncomponent but the row''s own event hadn''t fired yet to update the\nunderlying model). Every other text input in this file already used\n(input) for this reason.\n\nAlso makes TARGET and TYPE/DEFAULT editable per row (previously\nread-only spans matching the Claude Design mock, but that left newly\nadded rows permanently stuck on the \"nuevoCampo\"/STRING placeholder\nvalues with no way to rename them).","tree":{"sha":"43ff3bc9593285392d4643fd567e5024d305d93b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/43ff3bc9593285392d4643fd567e5024d305d93b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDg0YjZlYTMzZmIzOGIxMDMyYzAyNzI3Zjg3YjJiOTZkOTFhYjZjZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/0362c88baac6cbb509514b90e367e543c2530dc3","sha":"0362c88baac6cbb509514b90e367e543c2530dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/0362c88baac6cbb509514b90e367e543c2530dc3"}],"sha":"84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/84b6ea33fb38b1032c02727f87b2b96d91ab6cef"},{"auth