anache/systemintegrator/commits/3ce53d9462ab35e7f7b3f77c52168fc1e4c9aa48"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/869ddb6d187c3b5982fa1288ed5ff870a3e456fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:41:40Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:41:40Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: allow localhost:4000 origin for microui CORS\n\nThe BFF''s OIDC redirect_uri always sends the browser back to\nlocalhost:4000 (BFF_PUBLIC_URL), but the microui nginx config only\nallowed the localhost:4200 origin, so the shell served from :4000\ncould never fetch integration-mfe''s remoteEntry.json after login.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DpYtck36PWn2JEHkGZ1c5p","tree":{"sha":"3b94dad72f985eddc12184457225e851d4776709","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/3b94dad72f985eddc12184457225e851d4776709"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/869ddb6d187c3b5982fa1288ed5ff870a3e456fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/869ddb6d187c3b5982fa1288ed5ff870a3e456fb","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDg2OWRkYjZkMTg3YzNiNTk4MmZhMTI4OGVkNWZmODcwYTNlNDU2ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7","sha":"b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7"}],"sha":"869ddb6d187c3b5982fa1288ed5ff870a3e456fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/869ddb6d187c3b5982fa1288ed5ff870a3e456fb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:54:25Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:54:25Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: register flow routes and disable publish on empty draft\n\n- Register ''flows'' and ''flows/:flowId'' in CONSOLE_ROUTES so the flow\n  list/designer components (previously unreachable) are wired up.\n- Remove the dead ''Ver ejecuciones''/''Ver traza'' buttons and their\n  openExecutions() handlers — no executions feature exists and building\n  one is out of scope for this slice.\n- Disable the Publicar button when the draft graph is empty/whitespace.\n- Add a route-integration test against the real CONSOLE_ROUTES (mounted\n  under /integration like the shell app does) so a missing route\n  regresses a real assertion instead of a no-op test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DpYtck36PWn2JEHkGZ1c5p","tree":{"sha":"6f50ecb37e432a78ea5e7ed820257b0077b5a811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/6f50ecb37e432a78ea5e7ed820257b0077b5a811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGI0ODYwZWY5ZmE2MWUxZGNmNjMzNDVhZGVmNDRiYTgzZWU4YjE2Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/ebeccf139cb03a027884123d81c0f9ad652993d8","sha":"ebeccf139cb03a027884123d81c0f9ad652993d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/ebeccf139cb03a027884123d81c0f9ad652993d8"}],"sha":"b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b4860ef9fa61e1dcf63345adef44ba83ee8b16b7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/ebeccf139cb03a027884123d81c0f9ad652993d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:54:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:54:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: return 422 on empty-draft publish and summary-only flow list\n\n- FlowService.publish() throws FlowNotPublishableException (422) instead\n  of a plain IllegalArgumentException (400) when the draft graph is\n  empty, per the design spec.\n- FlowController.list() now returns FlowSummaryResponse (no draftGraph)\n  instead of the full FlowResponse, matching the detail/list contract.\n- Log parse failures in FlowResponse/FlowVersionResponse instead of\n  silently swallowing them, since malformed stored JSON indicates data\n  corruption rather than an expected empty value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DpYtck36PWn2JEHkGZ1c5p","tree":{"sha":"af6bfb8d3bb03e6bb9d17aebc8eeecfcd6e95417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/af6bfb8d3bb03e6bb9d17aebc8eeecfcd6e95417"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/ebeccf139cb03a027884123d81c0f9ad652993d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/ebeccf139cb03a027884123d81c0f9ad652993d8","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGViZWNjZjEzOWNiMDNhMDI3ODg0MTIzZDgxYzBmOWFkNjUyOTkzZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/9b43f0491363e6c70c5264982ac06758f432ba3b","sha":"9b43f0491363e6c70c5264982ac06758f432ba3b","url":"https://api.github.com/r