anache/systemintegrator/commit/f5466eebecbaf76aafaa5a8232b67adc46a30ef8","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGY1NDY2ZWViZWNiYWY3NmFhZmFhNWE4MjMyYjY3YWRjNDZhMzBlZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe","sha":"2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe"}],"sha":"f5466eebecbaf76aafaa5a8232b67adc46a30ef8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f5466eebecbaf76aafaa5a8232b67adc46a30ef8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T21:05:20Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T21:05:20Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: specify batch bulk processing","tree":{"sha":"2d1b6c5403a51fcb61e4d8124137b2850ecc7ad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/2d1b6c5403a51fcb61e4d8124137b2850ecc7ad1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDJlOTkzOTk3YTNiZGVkNmU2MTRjMWE5MmE0NzI2MmQ4ZDNiZjVkZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3","sha":"61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3"}],"sha":"2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2e993997a3bded6e614c1a92a47262d8d3bf5dfe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:40:07Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:40:07Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: align Mapping & Transformation with a real, working dry-run\n\nRebuilds the Integration Profile detail page''s Mapping tab (previously\ntwo raw JSON textareas) to match the Claude Design mockup''s editor:\n\n- app: new POST /api/v1/integration-profiles/{id}/mapping/dry-run\n  builds a throwaway (never persisted) profile with the in-progress\n  transformationJson and runs it through the real TransformationService\n  — the same engine used for live traffic — returning its genuine\n  output or error, not a simulated one.\n- bff: proxy route for the new endpoint.\n- integration-mfe: engine selector (FIELD_MAPPING/JSLT/PASSTHROUGH),\n  an editable field-mapping rules table backed by the real\n  FieldMappingConfiguration/FieldMappingRule JSON schema, a JSLT\n  script editor, a sample-payload panel, and a dry-run result panel\n  showing the real transformation output or error.\n\nVerified end-to-end with a real profile: a $.Vehiculo.Chasis rule\ndry-run against a real sample payload returns the actual JSONPath\nextraction result from the engine, not fabricated output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af7ff3b43414acf6c2933c4746ead4e5b7c53a86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/af7ff3b43414acf6c2933c4746ead4e5b7c53a86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDYxZTZlNzBkMTYyMmMyZWM0N2M3MDBlOThlY2NkZWIwZGQxODY3YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229","sha":"a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229"}],"sha":"61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/61e6e70d1622c2ec47c700e98eccdeb0dd1867a3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:06:50Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:06:50Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: align Credenciales with the Integration Console design\n\nFull-stack credential catalog to match the Claude Design mockup:\n\n- app: new GET /api/v1/credentials aggregates integration_profile rows\n  by credentialRef (usedBy), and resolves type/state through the same\n  SecretResolver the outbound dispatcher already uses — never exposes\n  the secret value, only the derived AuthType and whether it resolved\n  (VIGENTE) or not (SIN_VERIFICAR). Last rotation is read from Vault\n  KV2 metadata (updated_time) only when Vault is enabled, again never\n  touching the secret data itself.\n- bff: proxy route for the new endpoint.\n- integration-mfe: credential table (ref/type/usedBy/rotation/state)\n  replacing the placeholder empty state, plus the design''s security\n  disclosure note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c0002382ee35891cb054f7588983f49c8c01a2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/5c0002382ee35891cb054f7588983f49c8c01a2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGE4MTQ3MTJmNjMxMzZiOWUzZWE2MmEwZDVhMjkyNGNiODcyMzQyMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82","sha":"4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82"}],"sha":"a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/a814712f63136b9e3ea62a0d5a2924cb87234229"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:47:02Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:47:02Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: align Conectores y adapters with the Integration Console design\n\nDerive a real connector catalog from existing integration-profile data\n(protocol/connector/adapter) instead of the placeholder empty state:\ngroups profiles by connector, lists distinct adapters, and shows\nactive/total profile counts per connector. No backend changes needed\nsince GET /bff/api/v1/integration-profiles already exposes everything.\n\nThe design''s fabricated infra states (INSTALADO/DEGRADADO) aren''t\nbacked by anything we track, so state is shown honestly as EN USO /\nSIN USO ACTIVO based on whether any active profile uses the connector.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee37f1047408d933bdc1a8ea5665f8866ba0c919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/ee37f1047408d933bdc1a8ea5665f8866ba0c919"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDRkZmIyNWRkZjQ2OTcxNjYzZDNhY2NlYTc5ZDE0ZmZkZjBkNzZlODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6","sha":"4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6"}],"sha":"4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4dfb25ddf46971663d3accea79d14ffdf0d76e82"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:38:39Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:38:39Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: align Monitor de mensajes with the Integration Console design\n\nFull-stack message monitoring feature to match the Claude Design mockup\n(docs/design-system/Integration Console (standalone).html):\n\n- app: new /api/v1/messages endpoints unifying integration_inbox and\n  integration_outbox into a single message model, with normalized\n  statuses (PENDING/ERROR/DLQ/PROCESSED) derived from real attempts/\n  status columns, plus per-message retry and move-to-DLQ actions.\n- bff: proxy routes for the new endpoints.\n- integration-mfe: message list with status filters and a detail\n  drawer (facts, last error, payload, retry/DLQ actions), replacing\n  the placeholder empty state. Bulk DLQ replay kept alongside it.\n\nThe design''s per-attempt history log isn''t backed by real persisted\ndata (only a single last-error is stored), so the detail drawer shows\nthat honestly instead of fabricating a multi-entry timeline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d16f7b940c3c55f2359ea75a287beb797d0eeee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/d16f7b940c3c55f2359ea75a287beb797d0eeee4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDQ2NzFiMjNhZmFlYTFhMjA3YzkxZTdiM2RkM2Y0NTM2ZWJmMWIyZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255","sha":"2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255"}],"sha":"4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4671b23afaea1a207c91e7b3dd3f4536ebf1b2d6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T04:45:28Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T04:45:28Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: don''t trip the circuit breaker on permanent 4xx rejections\n\nHttpOutboundException with a 4xx status (e.g. the Comsatel API''s\n\"duplicate unit ID\" rejection) is a permanent business error that will\nnever succeed on retry. Counting it the same as a 5xx/network failure\nlet a burst of duplicates (e.g. a DLQ replay) trip the circuit breaker\nand block brand-new, valid traffic to the same connector.\n\nOnly record HTTP 5xx and network-level failures (status == null) as\ncircuit-breaker failures; 4xx responses no longer count.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"198a02fecffa3069acb5a2837017dce6c2e61427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/198a02fecffa3069acb5a2837017dce6c2e61427"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDJjNzExYjE1NGQ2NWQ0MDE0MzlhOWZjYmZhOTlmZGY0YWExN2EyNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d","sha":"070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d"}],"sha":"2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2c711b154d65d401439a9fcbfa99fdf4aa17a255"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T04:24:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T04:24:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: repair dev/prod backoffice login and Gateway 403 handling\n\n- Add shell dev-server proxy so /bff, /auth, /api reach the BFF (port 4000)\n  instead of 404ing against the raw Angular dev-server.\n- Fix Native Federation \"ngDevMode is not defined\" ReferenceError by\n  initializing globalThis.ngDevMode before initFederation() in both the\n  shell and integration-mfe entry points (angular-architects/\n  module-federation-plugin#458).\n- Stop conflating 401 and 403 in the Integration Profiles list: a 403 from\n  the Gateway (missing tenant_id claim) no longer force-redirects to\n  Keycloak login as if the session had expired; it now shows a distinct\n  \"forbidden\" state.\n- Document BFF OIDC config (KEYCLOAK_APPS_ISSUER_URI, BFF_OIDC_CLIENT_ID)\n  in .env.example.\n- Add architecture diagrams to docs/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"361a97860e96bda81c4aadc5bb810c5e9944a84f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/361a97860e96bda81c4aadc5bb810c5e9944a84f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDA3MGIyZDMxZmMyNTc1NzNlNDZmMGUyNDAzMDU2MmY4YjJhMTc5M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd","sha":"b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd"}],"sha":"070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/070b2d31fc257573e46f0e24030562f8b2a1793d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:47:28Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:47:28Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/integration-console-claude-design''\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tbackoffice/apps/bff/src/app/static-shell.ts","tree":{"sha":"e127ffc5e75c046a41af3f6c930c1e2a73fc884e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/e127ffc5e75c046a41af3f6c930c1e2a73fc884e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGIwZGE4YzhkMzZhYzZmM2NlNWY2MDg2M2RhYTc2NThkMzk0NDI4YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc","sha":"00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26","sha":"d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26"}],"sha":"b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b0da8c8d36ac6f3ce5f60863daa7658d394428bd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:46:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:46:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: combine dist-relative path fix with Windows sendFile encoding fix\n\nTwo independent, uncommitted fixes to static-shell.ts''s shell-static\nresolution converged on this file: the path was corrected from\njoin(__dirname, ''..'', ''shell-static'') to join(__dirname, ''shell-static'')\nto match the dist build layout, and separately res.sendFile() was found\nto 404 on Windows because it runs its path through encodeURI(), mangling\nbackslash-separated absolute paths. Combining both here: the corrected\npath plus passing { root } with a relative filename to sendFile avoids\nthe encodeURI corruption entirely.","tree":{"sha":"f90a409d3db530a65699104e93654f2b7772c3fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/f90a409d3db530a65699104e93654f2b7772c3fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDAwYzcxNWNkMDQ3ZjJiYTE3YTM4ZDAyMDIwNjk2NTAxZWFkMzJlZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4b8720748e0b6ad515e6dede25fa82b1a1fd96bd","sha":"4b8720748e0b6ad515e6dede25fa82b1a1fd96bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4b8720748e0b6ad515e6dede25fa82b1a1fd96bd"}],"sha":"00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/00c715cd047f2ba17a38d02020696501ead32edc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:36:20Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:36:20Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: correct shell grid layout so the sidebar no longer overlaps the header\n\napp.html nested <app-header> and <app-sidebar>/<main> under two separate\ncontainers (header + .shell-body), but .shell''s grid-template-columns only\napplied to its direct children (header, .shell-body) — not to sidebar/main.\nCombined with the sidebar''s `position: absolute` (needed for the hover-to-\nexpand flyout effect) having no positioned ancestor, the rail rendered\npinned to the browser viewport''s top-left, overlapping the header and main\ncontent instead of sitting beside them.\n\nFixed by matching the original Claude Design mockup''s structure: .shell''s\ntwo in-flow grid children are an empty spacer div (reserves the rail''s\nresting width) and <main> (which now wraps <app-header> + a scrollable\ncontent div); <app-sidebar> is the third, absolutely-positioned child that\noverlays the spacer and can flyout over `main` on hover without reflowing\nit. SidebarComponent now sets --console-rail-width (58px/232px) reactively\nfrom `pinned` only, never `hovering`, via an effect().","tree":{"sha":"f18fa577655ee0491363ec972432b43ca4b54837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/f18fa577655ee0491363ec972432b43ca4b54837"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGQyNTEwNjk3YWYyMDAyMzJjZTIyZmNhZjhiODExODlkYjc5MzZmMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b16de8a3004883e86833a56d30d3042c377196fe","sha":"b16de8a3004883e86833a56d30d3042c377196fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b16de8a3004883e86833a56d30d3042c377196fe"}],"sha":"d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/d2510697af200232ce22fcaf8b81189db7936f26"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/i