  the implicit-any was failing shell''s build under this environment''s\n  TypeScript version, blocking every shell test from compiling.\n- static-shell.ts: res.sendFile() runs its path through encodeURI(),\n  which mangles Windows backslash-separated absolute paths (turns every\n  \\ into %5C), making send() 404 on a file that demonstrably exists.\n  Passing { root } with a relative filename avoids the encoding path\n  entirely. Confirmed via before/after debug logging that fs.existsSync\n  saw the file while send()''s internal stat did not.\n\nNeither fix changes behavior on a correctly-configured environment;\nboth were blocking a clean baseline before starting the Claude Design\nconsole alignment work.","tree":{"sha":"321ee7046c658c1b2811b3498e6543ac12b65476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/321ee7046c658c1b2811b3498e6543ac12b65476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/f07fca1c5b662bbf775bdbb8a800439133e86752","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/f07fca1c5b662bbf775bdbb8a800439133e86752","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGYwN2ZjYTFjNWI2NjJiYmY3NzViZGJiOGE4MDA0MzkxMzNlODY3NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4b8720748e0b6ad515e6dede25fa82b1a1fd96bd","sha":"4b8720748e0b6ad515e6dede25fa82b1a1fd96bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4b8720748e0b6ad515e6dede25fa82b1a1fd96bd"}],"sha":"f07fca1c5b662bbf775bdbb8a800439133e86752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/f07fca1c5b662bbf775bdbb8a800439133e86752"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4b8720748e0b6ad515e6dede25fa82b1a1fd96bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:59:24Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"