,"email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T00:20:06Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/task7-keycloak-qa-e2e''","tree":{"sha":"af10b5bb48bc205298b1df97e1ba8857d73fe8cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/af10b5bb48bc205298b1df97e1ba8857d73fe8cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/2f5d0b6d3c4ae1a7d6b1d28ad0916f8af9feb59e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/2f5d0b6d3c4ae1a7d6b1d28ad0916f8af9feb59e","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDJmNWQwYjZkM2M0YWUxYTdkNmIxZDI4YWQwOTE2ZjhhZjlmZWI1OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53","sha":"9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/c47d8746977b84ee604205330e6fa9fc8618ec7f","sha":"c47d8746977b84ee604205330e6fa9fc8618ec7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/c47d8746977b84ee604205330e6fa9fc8618ec7f"}],"sha":"2f5d0b6d3c4ae1a7d6b1d28ad0916f8af9feb59e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/2f5d0b6d3c4ae1a7d6b1d28ad0916f8af9feb59e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T00:00:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T00:00:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): note Task 7''s typed session augmentation for Task 8 to extend\n\nTask 7 added a real express-session type augmentation instead of the brief''s (req.session as any) casts, which don''t compile under this workspace''s tsconfig types restriction. Task 8 should extend that interface, not reintroduce any casts.","tree":{"sha":"c1ebae0447ddcc12544bbd148430167a09d4ba41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/c1ebae0447ddcc12544bbd148430167a09d4ba41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDk5MDZkMDgwZWQwOGNkY2QyMGZmNWY5YmNlZjc2NzBmMWUwOTdiNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c","sha":"ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c"}],"sha":"9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/9906d080ed08cdcd20ff5f9bcef7670f1e097b53"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T23:57:24Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T23:57:43Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(bff): add OIDC login redirect with PKCE\n\nGET /auth/login discovers the Keycloak realm `Apps` issuer, builds an\nAuthorization Code + PKCE authorization URL (S256 challenge, fresh state\nper request), stashes the verifier and state in the Redis-backed session\nfor the Task 8 callback, and redirects the browser to Keycloak.\n\nopenid-client v6 is ESM-only and its dependency chain (oauth4webapi,\njose) is too. Jest''s CommonJS runtime does not use Node''s require(ESM)\ninterop, so those packages are allowlisted in transformIgnorePatterns\nand tsconfig.spec.json enables allowJs so ts-jest can transpile them.\n\nAdds a src/types/express-session.d.ts augmentation that pulls\n@types/express-session into the program (tsconfig restricts `types`) and\ndeclares the session `oidc` shape, so the controller writes it without a\ncast.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013oBCj9mf9WYXhjnSoibNms","tree":{"sha":"6df623b9f22b33bb99d9fdbc7768ce1ea206995a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/6df623b9f22b33bb99d9fdbc7768ce1ea206995a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGFkNTQ0NGZjYjViM2UwMjE0NWM1YjlhZDJhMzcyZWEzZTI1ODQxMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474","sha":"5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474"}],"sha":"ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/ad5444fcb5b3e02145c5b9ad2a372ea3e258411c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:16:56Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:16:56Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): fix Task 6''s install line (missing supertest) and note ConfigModule requirement\n\nTask 6''s test imports supertest, but the original install command omitted it. main.ts also calls app.get(ConfigService), which requires ConfigModule.forRoot({isGlobal:true}) registered in app.module.ts -- the original plan text didn''t call this out explicitly. Both found and fixed by the implementer; folding back into the plan for accuracy.","tree":{"sha":"16e92c39943b9d354c39dc01dcad27aaa774a53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/16e92c39943b9d354c39dc01dcad27aaa774a53f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDVjY2NlZDliNDQxYjk3NmZiMzI2YzNiNDM2NjhmMmEyYzEzNWU0NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a","sha":"b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a"}],"sha":"5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/5ccced9b441b976fb326c3b43668f2a2c135e474"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:15:47Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:15:47Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(bff): add Redis-backed session middleware\n\nAdds configureSession(app, config), wired into main.ts, applying\nexpress-session with a connect-redis store so req.session is backed\nby the shared Redis instance instead of in-memory state. Cookie is\nhttpOnly with secure gated on NODE_ENV=production (not hardcoded\ntrue, which would break local HTTP dev) per ADR-0002.\n\nAlso imports ConfigModule into AppModule (isGlobal) since main.ts\nresolves ConfigService via app.get(ConfigService) before configuring\nsession — required for the app to boot at all, not just for tests.\n\nThe Redis client is released on the explicit app.close() call rather\nthan the underlying HTTP server''s ''close'' event, because supertest\nopens/closes that raw server around every individual request when\nthe app never calls its own app.listen(); hooking cleanup there would\nkill the shared Redis client mid test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013oBCj9mf9WYXhjnSoibNms","tree":{"sha":"cd1665e17b26c6983da86dc3275f83cf758d5c04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/cd1665e17b26c6983da86dc3275f83cf758d5c04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGI1NWJiYjFhYmY1ZmUwNWE4MzcxMGE3ZTQyMGU0ZjE5ZmZkMTg2NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27","sha":"804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27"}],"sha":"b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/b55bbb1abf5fe05a83710a7e420e4f19ffd1866a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:51:25Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:51:25Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): document Task 5''s verified Native Federation deviations\n\nRecords six real, hands-on-diagnosed fixes discovered while implementing Task 5: .mjs not .js federation config extension, nx g instead of ng g (Node version constraint), unscoped shell-contracts import alias, exact remoteName matching, the shared-external federation-runtime-duplication bug (fixed via skip: [''shell-contracts'']), and a pre-existing @nx/playwright/preset ESM-loader incompatibility. Historical record only -- Task 5 is already implemented, this documents what actually happened for future readers.","tree":{"sha":"65ef668fc20f41f4bb22ec3951bacc7d850a12f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/65ef668fc20f41f4bb22ec3951bacc7d850a12f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDgwNGU2N2NhNjgzMGY1MTk1OWMyZmEwNmU3ZDExZjNjMzRkNGRlMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7","sha":"4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7"}],"sha":"804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/804e67ca6830f51959c2fa06e7d11f3c34d4de27"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:48:23Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:48:23Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(backoffice): wire shell and integration-mfe via Native Federation\n\nInitialize `shell` as a Native Federation dynamic host (port 4201) and\n`integration-mfe` as a remote (port 4202), exposing `./Routes` from the\nremote and lazily loading it under `/integration` in the Shell via\n`buildMicroUiRoute` from `shell-contracts`.\n\nNotable deviations from the plan text, all verified against real output:\n\n- The generator emits `federation.config.mjs`, not `.js` (package 22.0.6).\n- Run via `nx g` rather than `ng g`: the Angular CLI refuses to start on\n  this machine''s Node v22.15.0 (it requires >= v22.22.3).\n- Import alias is `shell-contracts`; the `@backoffice/` scope in the plan\n  does not exist in this workspace (Task 4 created the plain alias).\n- `remoteName` is `integration-mfe`, matching the name the remote declares\n  in its own federation config and remoteEntry.json. Native Federation\n  registers a remote under the name from the fetched entry, so the plan''s\n  `integrationMfe` failed with \"Remote ''integrationMfe'' is not initialized.\"\n- `shell-contracts` is added to the Shell''s federation `skip` list. Left\n  shared, `shareAll()` emits it as its own bundle carrying a second copy of\n  the federation runtime whose `initFederation` is never called, so\n  `loadRemoteModule` never settles and `/integration` hangs silently.\n- `federation.manifest.json` is emptied: the generator guessed remotes on\n  port 4200, and this host resolves its remote at runtime from the URL.\n- `playwright.config.mts` no longer imports `@nx/playwright/preset` or\n  `@nx/devkit` (those defaults are inlined). Under Playwright''s ESM loader\n  they reach `nx/dist/src/native/index.js`, which does\n  `delete require.cache[...]` where `require.cache` is undefined, so config\n  loading crashed before any test ran. It now also starts both dev servers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013oBCj9mf9WYXhjnSoibNms","tree":{"sha":"2ec12050271e6465cf9b46c8311f616ff17cbe6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/2ec12050271e6465cf9b46c8311f616ff17cbe6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDQ2NTRhOWMxNzExMzU2Zjk3Njg1MTNkZmM3ZmE3NjZiMjQ4NDllYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f","sha":"181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f"}],"sha":"4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/4654a9c1711356f9768513dfc7fa766b24849eb7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:11:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:11:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(shell-contracts): exact-pin native-federation to 22.0.6\n\nnpm install without --save-exact wrote a caret range (^22.0.6) into\npackage.json/package-lock.json, reopening the drift risk the version pin\nwas meant to close: a future npm install/update could re-resolve into the\n22.1.x line, which conflicts with this workspace''s @angular/build@~22.0.4\npeer requirement. Re-installed with --save-exact so the dependency reads\n\"22.0.6\" exactly, with no range operator.","tree":{"sha":"8b95a6cc236547639b76b33ada670e4dbd713d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/8b95a6cc236547639b76b33ada670e4dbd713d60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDE4MWE2ODAzNzllN2JlMDVmYWY5NTQ5NGYzMjE2ZjE0MDRlNGUzMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b","sha":"3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b"}],"sha":"181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/181a680379e7be05faf95494f3216f1404e4e30f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:05:25Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:05:25Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(shell-contracts): add MicroUI route manifest contract\n\nAdds the backoffice/libs/shell-contracts library with buildMicroUiRoute(),\nproducing an Angular Route that lazily loads a Native Federation remote via\nloadRemoteModule(). Task 5''s Shell routing will consume this to mount\nintegration-mfe.\n\nInstalls @angular-architects/native-federation@22.0.6 (pinned to match this\nworkspace''s @angular/build@~22.0.4 peer requirement; @latest resolves to\n22.1.1, which needs @angular/build@~22.1.0 and conflicts).\n\nAlso fixes libs/shell-contracts/tsconfig.json, which the @nx/js:lib generator\nemits without \"types\": [\"node\"], breaking Jest''s parsing of jest.config.cts\nbefore any test runs -- same fix already applied to apps/bff/tsconfig.json\nin Task 3.","tree":{"sha":"3b010fdfc4b01310cad9a0672a0a1e8deae0a437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/3b010fdfc4b01310cad9a0672a0a1e8deae0a437"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDNlZGQwZjZiMTYzOTU5ZjRlZjI2OWVjMTc3MDRiNjZjMjRhYTk4MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642","sha":"80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642"}],"sha":"3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/3edd0f6b163959f4ef269ec17704b66c24aa980b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:02:18Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T19:02:18Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): pin native-federation to 22.0.6 to match the workspace''s Angular version\n\n@latest (22.1.1) requires @angular/build ~22.1.0, but Task 3 already pinned this workspace to ~22.0.4 (reviewed and closed). Bumping Angular workspace-wide to unblock @latest would be a much larger, riskier change than pinning native-federation to 22.0.6, whose peer range (~22.0.0) matches what''s already installed -- verified via npm view.","tree":{"sha":"2cd400715205579aca6fd995950134e59d94b1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/2cd400715205579aca6fd995950134e59d94b1c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDgwYTg1ODAyNTIzYzUwNzhmNTdhZjllZDc1MGQ0NjcyNjE1MGU2NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077","sha":"8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077"}],"sha":"80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/80a85802523c5078f57af9ed750d46726150e642"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:59:49Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:59:49Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): fix Task 4/5 dependency ordering for native-federation package\n\nTask 4''s buildMicroUiRoute imports @angular-architects/native-federation at compile time, but installation was originally scheduled in Task 5 -- Task 4''s implementer correctly flagged this as NEEDS_CONTEXT rather than guessing. Moved the install to Task 4 (Step 1), removed the now-redundant install from Task 5, and folded in the known tsconfig types:node fix for the new jest-based library. Also added a port-collision check to Task 5 Step 6, carried forward from Task 3''s finding that both shell and integration-mfe default to port 4200.","tree":{"sha":"2bfc8eaf430beb2494572e24341700b0a985e5b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/2bfc8eaf430beb2494572e24341700b0a985e5b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDhlOGNiYzQ2NTA4N2ZiOTg2MDY1NDIxMjMyZGI2MThkZTNlY2IwNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192","sha":"6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192"}],"sha":"8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/8e8cbc465087fb986065421232db618de3ecb077"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:38:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:38:04Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): replace Task 3 scaffolding with the verified nx init sequence\n\ncreate-nx-workspace''s legacy presets are GitHub template clones in Nx 23.1.1, which both ship an Angular-incompatible TS-solution tsconfig (composite + project references) and check in AI-agent dotfiles that --aiAgents=none cannot remove. nx init is a real generator, not a clone, and was verified end-to-end to avoid both problems. Also fixes the BFF generator to request --unitTestRunner=jest explicitly (its default is none, which would have left nx test bff with no target) and documents the two necessary follow-up fixes found during verification: seeding package.json before nx init, checking .gitignore covers node_modules before any git add, and adding \"types\": [\"node\"] to apps/bff/tsconfig.json for jest/ts-node to resolve correctly.","tree":{"sha":"bb58bb15009a2e2b4ef4b94c59ca58721a696c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/bb58bb15009a2e2b4ef4b94c59ca58721a696c2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDZmZjVmOGEyN2MxMDBhOWFjYWU4MTcyZmM2NzVkNWI3YWQzYTUxOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a","sha":"aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a"}],"sha":"6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/6ff5f8a27c100a9acae8172fc675d5b7ad3a5192"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:34:36Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:34:36Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"chore(backoffice): scaffold Nx workspace with shell, integration-mfe, bff\n\nBootstrapped via `nx init` rather than `create-nx-workspace --preset=apps`.\nIn Nx 23.1.1 a legacy preset is a static clone of nrwl/empty-template, which\nships the new TS-solution setup (\"composite\": true + \"references\": []).\n@nx/angular:application hard-refuses that setup (angular/angular#37276), so\nthe template path could not produce an Angular app at all. `nx init` is a real\ngenerator, so it both avoids the project-references layout and honors\n--aiAgents=none, removing the need for the Step 1b dotfile cleanup.\n\nApps generated: shell (Angular, routing/standalone/CSS, Playwright e2e),\nintegration-mfe (Angular, routing/standalone/CSS, no e2e), bff (NestJS).\nAll three build and test clean.\n\nTwo small deviations from the generator output, both scaffolding config:\n- apps/bff/tsconfig.json: added \"types\": [\"node\"]. jest.config.cts uses\n  module.exports and ts-node resolves the app tsconfig, which had no types\n  field, failing with TS2591. The old template''s tsconfig.base.json carried\n  \"types\": [\"*\"]; the nx init path does not.\n- backoffice/.gitignore: added. nx init emits one only when it also creates\n  package.json, and the root .gitignore does not cover node_modules, so\n  without it 55088 dependency files would have been committed.\n\n@nx/nest:application defaults --unitTestRunner=none, which would have left bff\nwith no test target and broken the plan''s `nx test <project>` interface, so\njest is passed explicitly (jest|none are its only choices; the Angular apps\nuse vitest, so unit runners are intentionally mixed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013oBCj9mf9WYXhjnSoibNms","tree":{"sha":"df0ec4479c980157b1376f407251e7617038eabb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/df0ec4479c980157b1376f407251e7617038eabb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGFhMDI0OTI0NmNmNjAzYzBkNWZlY2JjMGUzYTJlM2JiZjE1ZTVhM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b","sha":"6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b"}],"sha":"aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/aa0249246cf603c0d5fecbc0e3a2e3bbf15e5a3a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:00:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T18:00:14Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): remove AI-agent template artifacts after Nx scaffold, pin CLI version\n\nNx 23.1.1 presets are GitHub template clones (nrwl/empty-template); the AI-agent dotfiles (.claude/.codex/.cursor/.gemini/.opencode, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, opencode.json) are checked into that template and cannot be suppressed via --aiAgents=none, which only stops the tool from generating additional agent config. Added Step 1b to delete them explicitly (real risk otherwise: CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md would be read as live instructions by a future agent session, opencode.json auto-registers an MCP server). Pinned create-nx-workspace to the verified 23.1.1 rather than @latest to avoid further drift mid-execution.","tree":{"sha":"9ed28627db9d89e4e58faa8bdb85af444b3f3922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/9ed28627db9d89e4e58faa8bdb85af444b3f3922"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDZkNzRmMDkwMzY5YmEwMGE4Njg5M2Y1ZDM3OGQzOTYwZDJlYmQ1NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97","sha":"c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97"}],"sha":"6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/6d74f090369ba00a86893f5d378d3960d2ebd56b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:54:32Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:54:32Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): fix root cause of Task 3 git corruption: missing --skipGit\n\ncreate-nx-workspace performs its own internal git finalization (observed using git commit --amend) when run without --skipGit. backoffice/ lives inside this already-existing repo, so that internal step was silently amending whatever commit was HEAD at the time -- not something either prior implementer typed manually. Added --skipGit to Step 1 and a HEAD-hash sanity check around Step 8''s commit to catch any recurrence immediately.","tree":{"sha":"fbb434793a231101a4bd6c356f593c44b825b073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/fbb434793a231101a4bd6c356f593c44b825b073"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGM4ZDE2NDM4MTVlNjQzN2Y5NTIyZjVhMzBiMWZiYzBjOTcxNGVhOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff","sha":"a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff"}],"sha":"c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/c8d1643815e6437f9522f5a30b1fbc0c9714ea97"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:24:37Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:24:37Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(plan): correct Task 3 for Nx 23.1.1 CLI drift (interactive/aiAgents defaults)\n\nThe plan assumed an older Nx CLI. This environment''s create-nx-workspace defaults --interactive=true and, with CLAUDECODE=1 set, enters an AI Agent Mode with different scaffolding defaults, producing a generic demo workspace instead of the intended apps/shell, apps/integration-mfe, apps/bff layout. Task 3 now passes --interactive=false and --aiAgents=none explicitly, uses the bare apps preset, and generates each app explicitly into its target directory, with an explicit prohibition on git history-rewriting commands.","tree":{"sha":"e0bd96fc65eba841912da36b30b7c50b22892aa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/e0bd96fc65eba841912da36b30b7c50b22892aa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKGEwMTE2YTM0OTIxNmZhMGFlZWY0MWY2NjZiMzI1Njk2NjEzMjE0ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223","sha":"346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223"}],"sha":"a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/a0116a349216fa0aeef41f666b325696613214ff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:44:23Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:44:23Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(gateway): override apps-issuer-uri with a fake host in GatewaySecurityTest\n\nKEYCLOAK_APPS_ISSUER_URI was falling through to its real qa.comsatel.com.pe\ndefault in tests, since only KEYCLOAK_ISSUER_URI was overridden. The suite\nstill didn''t hit the network only because the bean-definition-override fix\nfully replaces the production issuerAuthenticationManagerResolver bean\nbefore it''s instantiated - but that made the \"no network access\" guarantee\ndepend entirely on that override mechanism, with no fast, obvious failure\nif it ever regressed. Add a second fake-host override\n(apps-issuer.example.test) matching the existing pattern, and a comment\nexplaining why allow-bean-definition-overriding is needed.\n\nAddresses code review finding on task-2.","tree":{"sha":"73e29404c0b468b56216feec2e49f442533dc2a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/73e29404c0b468b56216feec2e49f442533dc2a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDM0NjcyNmRiM2VlODEwYTBmN2YxYTI2NTFjMmY2MzUwODg1MTgyMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30","sha":"1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30"}],"sha":"346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/346726db3ee810a0f7f1a2651c2f635088518223"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:37:23Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:37:23Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(gateway): trust realms/Apps alongside realms/microservicios for JWT validation\n\nWire TrustedIssuersAuthenticationManagerResolver into GatewaySecurityConfig\nso the Gateway authenticates via a JwtIssuerReactiveAuthenticationManagerResolver\nacross two trusted issuers (realms/microservicios, realms/Apps) instead of a\nsingle-issuer .jwt() resource server. Add keycloak.apps-issuer-uri and drop the\nnow-vestigial spring.security.oauth2.resourceserver.jwt.issuer-uri property,\nwhich would otherwise make Spring Boot eagerly build an unused, network-calling\nReactiveJwtDecoder at startup.\n\nGatewaySecurityTest''s TestSecurityConfiguration override needed\nspring.main.allow-bean-definition-overriding=true: GatewaySecurityConfig is a\nplain component-scanned @Configuration (not a deferred autoconfiguration), so\nits @ConditionalOnMissingBean resolver bean is registered before the test''s\n@Import-ed override is parsed, causing a BeanDefinitionOverrideException\nwithout this flag.","tree":{"sha":"8a79f66b10ee6998e7a36602aadfec2faf034c41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/8a79f66b10ee6998e7a36602aadfec2faf034c41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDEzODJlNzc4YzVhMmQ0YzZhZmUzYmQ1Mjk0NWM4MzcwZGM5MWNkMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/77ea83efacb03ba3cda2b251a0ebe60e1b7bed22","sha":"77ea83efacb03ba3cda2b251a0ebe60e1b7bed22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/77ea83efacb03ba3cda2b251a0ebe60e1b7bed22"}],"sha":"1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1382e778c5a2d4c6afe3bd52945c8370dc91cd30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/77ea83efacb03ba3cda2b251a0ebe60e1b7bed22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:02:24Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:02:24Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(gateway): add deterministic multi-issuer authentication manager resolver","tree":{"sha":"4b59ac507b97a26c64c905a00afc67f8766d1b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/4b59ac507b97a26c64c905a00afc67f8766d1b63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/77ea83efacb03ba3cda2b25