":"2026-08-19T11:05:15Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:05:15Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: add implementation plan for the integration sync scheduler\n\nCovers persisting extractionConfig (missing field discovered while\nplanning), sync-state/watermark tracking, cross-tenant active-profile\nlookup, the JDBC pipeline, and the tick-based per-profile scheduler.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a283c416e95fd92481a046687cdb62fa1061e56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/trees/2a283c416e95fd92481a046687cdb62fa1061e56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/git/commits/1f71a8864fcd903ca462036021251da7bdf4f421","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/1f71a8864fcd903ca462036021251da7bdf4f421","node_id":"C_kwDOT58gyNoAKDFmNzFhODg2NGZjZDkwM2NhNDYyMDM2MDIxMjUxZGE3YmRmNGY0MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/systemintegrator/commit/20ae08a8f5b011fa701286fd2db04a8fc035615e","sha":"20ae08a8f5b011fa701286fd2db04a8fc035615e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/20ae08a8f5b011fa701286fd2db04a8fc035615e"}],"sha":"1f71a8864fcd903ca462036021251da7bdf4f421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/1f71a8864fcd903ca462036021251da7bdf4f421"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/systemintegrator/commits/20ae08a8f5b011fa701286fd2db04a8fc035615e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T02:50:38Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T02:50:38Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: add design spec for integration sync scheduler\n\nW