ab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/2bda0c25f960ee56180622849a4a12b07bbdfd21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:48:31Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:48:31Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"test(paper-parsing): regression tests for sub-topic grouping\n\nCompanion tests for the paper-upload sub-topic fix: compound (A)…(D) groups,\nnumbered 1) 2) 3) chains with restored markers and summed marks, lettered\na)…d) groups, table layouts, directive lines not treated as MCQ options,\nseparate (A)… questions staying separate, and the AI-output merge pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b13bad1e5ede3cc14f4a3a3813411f1bc62eaf98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/b13bad1e5ede3cc14f4a3a3813411f1bc62eaf98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/2bda0c25f960ee56180622849a4a12b07bbdfd21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events",