n- accent.ts: appearanceKey()/read/writeAppearancePref() scope localStorage\n  to vriddhi_<pref>__<uid>; applyStoredAppearanceForUser(uid) restores the\n  signed-in account''s accent and font size only\n- AuthContext: reapplies stored appearance on [isLoading, user?.uid] so\n  superadmin changes never bleed into college/faculty sessions\n- Settings.tsx + FacultySettings.tsx: read/write through the scoped keys\n\nSuperadmin-only placement prep and course assignments:\n- current-firestore.rules: writes to colleges/{id}/config/courses require\n  isSuperadmin(); tests added in functions/test/firestore.rules.test.ts\n- functions/src/routes/prep.ts: /companies/settings GET+PUT return 403 for\n  non-superadmins (server-side enforcement alongside the rules)\n- PrepContentStudioTab: platform-control helper text\n\nMobile staff header:\n- Layout.tsx: remove the top-bar sign-out button on mobile; sign-out stays\n  in the avatar menu, desktop sidebar and the More sheet\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"647908c5e5a9e161b6655a9f6296d535d6657755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/647908c5e5a9e161b6655a9f6296d535d6657755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/a6c48c06f6e47c747b8c0b386fd6ca785a549f7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_ur