4c7418c5a4d363a4eadc280a75de25981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:26:23Z","email":"agent@arena.ai","name":"Arena Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:26:23Z","email":"agent@arena.ai","name":"Arena Agent"},"message":"Merge origin/main into arena/01a0da31-vriddhi\n\nResolves the package.json conflict: keeps main''s test:unit additions\n(chunkReload, pdfRuntime, serverReportPdf, attendanceDigest,\nimportProgress) and re-adds courseModel.test.ts plus the\ntest:render:courses and validate:courses scripts.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7737c8fd299ab19849e38f5fd06ab061cd922add","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/7737c8fd299ab19849e38f5fd06ab061cd922add"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/29725ed4c7418c5a4d363a4eadc280a75de25981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/29725ed4c7418c5a4d363a4eadc280a75de25981","node_id":"C_kwDOT5_MGdoAKDI5NzI1ZWQ0Yzc0MThjNWE0ZDM2M2E0ZWFkYzI4MGE3NWRlMjU5ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524","sha":"9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/028649d3eda99b1b48dbddd25037422b0afa2c1a","sha":"028649d3eda99b1b48dbddd25037422b0afa2c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/028649d3eda99b1b48dbddd25037422b0afa2c1a"}],"sha":"29725ed4c7418c5a4d363a4eadc280a75de25981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/29725ed4c7418c5a4d363a4eadc280a75de25981"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:24:21Z","email":"agent@arena.ai","name":"Arena Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:24:21Z","email":"agent@arena.ai","name":"Arena Agent"},"message":"Add GenAI certification course pack and in-app Course pages\n\nReplaces the inherited \"GenAI Certification Program\" outline with an\noriginal, complete 60-hour programme for non-technical undergraduates\n(B.Com / BBA / BA / B.Sc), packaged as content plus a student-facing\nCourse experience.\n\nContent pack — content/courses/genai-certification/\n- course.json manifest: VGC-101 \"GenAI for Career Impact\", 8 modules,\n  35 lessons + 6 projects, 60 h / 4 credits / 10 weeks, assessment\n  scheme (quizzes 15, projects 35, capstone 30, final 15, journal 5).\n- 35 full lessons (~1,350–2,100 words each): objectives, Indian\n  opening scenario, core ideas with prompts and tables, try-it-now,\n  timed hands-on lab with deliverable, common mistakes, takeaways,\n  reflection prompt, optional extension.\n- 175 quiz MCQs (5 per lesson) with explanations, per-module quiz.json.\n- Project briefs with rubrics: PB1 prompt playbook, PB2 campaign kit,\n  PB3 bilingual audio episode, PB4 automation/mini-app, PB5 ethics\n  audit, and the capstone AI product sprint.\n- assessments/: final-assessment blueprint (60 MCQ + 2 scenarios),\n  consolidated rubrics, certification policy; facilitator guide with a\n  10-week calendar and a \"verify before each batch\" tool-landscape\n  section; content/courses/README.md documents the pack format.\n\nApp — Courses\n- src/shared/courses: manifest types, pure course/progress model\n  (unit-tested), Vite glob loader (manifests + quizzes eager, lessons\n  lazy via ?raw), localStorage progress hook.\n- src/shared/components/courses: Markdown renderer (GFM tables, task\n  lists, prompt cards with copy, call-outs) and quiz UI with best-score\n  persistence.\n- src/modules/courses: catalog, overview and lesson pages, mounted at\n  /courses (public preview) and /student/courses (student portal nav).\n\nTooling\n- scripts/validate-course-pack.mjs (npm run validate:courses): manifest\n  paths, lesson structure and plan minutes, quiz ids/answers/counts,\n  stray files.\n- scripts/render-check/courses.mjs (npm run test:render:courses): jsdom\n  render of catalog/overview/lesson/quiz flows plus a sweep of all 41\n  lesson files.\n- courseModel.test.ts added to test:unit.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfe7a0598260dc628efdd678adaaf6e591f927c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/bfe7a0598260dc628efdd678adaaf6e591f927c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524","node_id":"C_kwDOT5_MGdoAKDlhZDA0ZTk0YWFlOTBhNmNmNTA5NDFlYzUzYWIyMTI0NzFiZGY1MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/2511fe9d0997b84782a636bc335e84cf4f6f66e3","sha":"2511fe9d0997b84782a636bc335e84cf4f6f66e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/2511fe9d0997b84782a636bc335e84cf4f6f66e3"}],"sha":"9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/9ad04e94aae90a6cf50941ec53ab212471bdf524"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/