ions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/a6fefc05f1448c0189d0f37bd3426f2e8b8866d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:48:39Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:48:39Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"feat(resume): Placement Pack extensions — cover letter, LinkedIn About, interview prep, readiness (item 4.2)\n\n- functions/src/resume/extras.ts (pure, 29 tests): prompt builders that carry the\n  candidate''s own facts and forbid invented ones; sanitisers that reject empty or\n  refusal output, strip a fence wherever it is plus preamble/chat sign-offs, remove\n  unfilled [placeholders] (the failure a recruiter notices), flag length, and drop\n  unusable/duplicate interview questions; a server-side readiness score for the\n  placement cell; CSV cell escaping.\n- Routes: POST /resume/cover-letter, /resume/linkedin-about and\n  /resume/interview-questions — gated by the existing resumeBuilder flags, spending\n  the SAME aiCallsPerStudent allowance (reserved before the model call), returned as\n  aiRemaining, and cached by the 4.1 engine on content-addressing keys only.\n- GET /resume/admin/placement-stats (+ ?format=csv): one row per saved resume with\n  readiness, band, gaps and downloads, summarised. The score is computed and stored\n  server-side on every PUT /resume/me (resumes/{uid}.placement) — a dashboard number\n  the browser cannot inflate. Older documents are scored on the fly.\n- Client: PlacementPackPanel on the student resume page (editable output, never\n  auto-written into the resume; allowance shown; the server''s own refusal message\n  kept verbatim) + resumeService functions.\n- Docs: docs/RESUME_BUILDER.md gains §6b (routes, tiers, cache keys, flags, sanitisers,\n  placement stats, and what is NOT included yet).\n\nfunctions 995/995, root 479/479, render 366 -> 382, vite build ok, both tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f15373d6a9de811a83eacd9f04a1a061b27dfd0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/f15373d6a9de811a83eacd9f04a1a061b27dfd0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/a6fefc05f1448c0189d0f37bd3426f2e8b8866d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/a6fefc05f1448c0189d0f37bd3426f2e8b8866d5","node_id":"C_kwDOT5_MGdoAKGE2ZmVmYzA1ZjE0NDhjMDE4OWQwZjM3YmQzNDI2ZjJlOGI4ODY2ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/0a220ee3bfdcc9d65455cc5378e9ad5f51b3