he role-specific parts as data\nand keeps every role''s text: student pitch, faculty benefits, admin Uniclare\nmatrix, plus the shared offline matrix and a notification paragraph that the\nfaculty/student copies never had. The three route wrappers pin their role — the\nrender checks caught the admin wrapper re-exporting the shared default, which\nwould have shown the student copy on the admin route.\n\nrender-check 347 -> 366 (four shared-role sections + three route wrappers),\nroot 479/479, tsc clean, vite build ok.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"046f068080b55eb40d6a9ba35107d140bcfa2003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/046f068080b55eb40d6a9ba35107d140bcfa2003"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/0a220ee3bfdcc9d65455cc5378e9ad5f51b3282b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/