nt_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:35:35Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"perf(pdf): split the Chrome routes into their own function and drop api to 512MiB (item 4.4)\n\n- functions/src/routes/pdf.ts: new ''pdf'' function (asia-south1, 2GiB, 120s,\n  maxInstances 5) mounting the three Chrome-launching handlers. It imports them\n  from the routers that own their HTML builders, so there is still exactly one\n  implementation of each route and of the 503-then-render-locally contract.\n- routes/papers.ts, routes/questions.ts, routes/resume.ts: the handlers are now\n  exported named functions (renderPaperPdf, exportQuestionsPdf, resumePdfHandler)\n  and are STILL registered on their own routers, so the old <api>/... paths keep\n  working for one release.\n- index.ts: api drops from 2GiB to 512MiB — ordinary API traffic no longer pays\n  for a Chrome-sized instance — and re-exports pdf.\n- Client: pdfUrl()/PDF_BASE_URL in src/shared/api/apiBase.ts (VITE_PDF_BASE_URL,\n  derived from VITE_API_BASE_URL by swapping /api for /pdf); pdfDownloader and\n  resumeService now target the pdf function; the Vite dev server proxies /pdf to\n  the emulator''s pdf function. .env.example documents the variable.\n\nfunctions 966/966, root 479/479, render 347/347, vite build ok, both tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"22970e4dcd1749e5e40bbe582013feaff3002270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/22970e4dcd1749e5e40bbe582013feaff3002270"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/28097d4df4d016fd5b52846faffe39c0cc484bcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/