made before implementation starts, the Cloud Functions view in\none table, the items deliberately out of scope, and the scoreboard to check afterwards.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"83b142a33ea71cc07c1f274ec5dcbf3c2247ff6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/83b142a33ea71cc07c1f274ec5dcbf3c2247ff6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/98404ab4f1c755a4ef0d01f352f70a7339f07bde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/98404ab4f1c755a4ef0d01f352f70a7339f07bde","node_id":"C_kwDOT5_MGdoAKDk4NDA0YWI0ZjFjNzU1YTRlZjBkMDFmMzUyZjcwYTczMzlmMDdiZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a","sha":"6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a"}],"sha":"98404ab4f1c755a4ef0d01f352f70a7339f07bde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/98404ab4f1c755a4ef0d01f352f70a7339f07bde"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:24:11Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:24:30Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"feat(superadmin): ZIP paper import pipeline into the universal question bank\n\nSuperadmin uploads a .zip (or single PDF) of previous-year papers; the api\nfunction unpacks it, transcribes each document with Gemini (text first,\nvision fallback for scans), normalises the questions and writes them into\nquestionBank_meta/questionBank_content as *pending drafts*. Nothing publishes\nitself — the existing Review Queue still approves.\n\nfunctions\n- utils/zipArchive.ts: dependency-free central-directory ZIP reader\n  (data-descriptor safe, ZIP64 flagged not parsed).\n- questionImport.ts: pure import core — limits, job types + reducers, prompts\n  and response schema, normaliser (client parity), language/legacy-font\n  detection, draft doc builder. Model id comes from QUESTION_IMPORT_AI_MODEL\n  (default gemini-2.5-flash), never a literal call site.\n- routes/questionImport.ts: POST /jobs (reserve), POST /jobs/:id/run (one\n  unit: 40-file unpack batch or one document, 42 s budget), GET /jobs/:id,\n  POST /jobs/:id/retry. Superadmin-only, importWorkerLimiter 300/15 min.\n- test/questionImport.test.ts: 27 tests incl. an in-memory ZIP writer.\n\nclient\n- api/questionImportApi.ts: reserve -> uploadBytesResumable -> drive the\n  worker loop; duplicate check (one questionBank_meta read, own-job rows\n  excluded, fingerprint comparison) and bulk reject. All Firebase/Storage\n  imports are confined here so the render check can stub the module.\n- components/PaperImportPanel.tsx + utils/importProgress.ts: form, progress,\n  \"needs attention\" list, duplicate report.\n- pages/SuperAdminQuestionBank.tsx: Pool / Review queue tabs + import panel.\n\nrules & storage\n- current-firestore.rules: questionBankImportJobs is server-only (Admin SDK\n  via the api function); drafts stay readable through questionBank_meta.\n- storage.rules: question-paper-imports/{uid}/{jobId}/{fileName}.\n- firestore.rules.test.ts: rules coverage for both new paths.\n\ngates: root tsc clean; root test:unit 461; functions test:unit 847;\nrender check 317/317 (0 crashes); vite build ok.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c4a7ec0eda2f51bee8da1e305b963b7a416b41e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/9c4a7ec0eda2f51bee8da1e305b963b7a416b41e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a","node_id":"C_kwDOT5_MGdoAKDZkMzU1ZTU2NGJhYjE5YjRlZTk4NTI4OWMzYTc3YmM3MzhlOTRlMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/7e69bf83769f4932de7036cf6905b198a286b61f","sha":"7e69bf83769f4932de7036cf6905b198a286b61f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/7e69bf83769f4932de7036cf6905b198a286b61f"}],"sha":"6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/6d355e564bab19b4ee985289c3a77bc738e94e0a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/7e69bf83769f4932de7036cf6905b198a286b61f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:58:34Z","email":"agent@arena.ai","name":"arena-agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:58:34Z","email":"agent@arena.ai","name":"arena-agent"},"message":"docs+tooling: review the 25 Sep optimisation hand-off; add PYQ corpus triage CLI\n\n- docs/HANDOFF_OPTIMISATION_2026-09-25.md: keep the plan in the repo\n- docs/HANDOFF_REVIEW_2026-09-25.md: clause review (11 added clauses), per-item\n  performance/UX analysis, corrected Gemini model lifecycle + cost scenarios,\n  and the English+Kannada paper-corpus intake plan\n- scripts/prep-import.mjs + scripts/prep-import-lib.mjs: dependency-free triage\n  for a ZIP/folder of previous-year papers (ZIP reader, script detection,\n  Nudi/KGP legacy-font detection, scan vs digital buckets, filename metadata)\n- scripts/prep-import-lib.test.mjs: 14 tests, listed in package.json test:unit\n\nGates: functions tsc + 820 unit tests; root tsc + 449 unit + 306 render; vite build.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a170f290ea0742e9083b11182c693cbdb78f4445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/a170f290ea0742e9083b11182c693cbdb78f4445"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/7e69bf83769f4932de7036cf6905b198a286b61f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/7e69bf83769f4932de7036cf6905b198a286b61f","node_id":"C_kwDOT5_MGdoAKDdlNjliZjgzNzY5ZjQ5MzJkZTcwMzZjZjY5MDViMTk4YTI4NmI2MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/2511fe9d0997b84782a636bc335e84cf4f6f66e3","sha":"2511fe9d0997b84782a636bc335e84cf4f6f66e3","ur