ve college\n  document (e.g. a college code stamped before the resolver existed), and\n  names the college it appears to mean so a single re-grant fixes it.\n- College detail header shows the Firestore document id with a copy\n  button, next to the code it is so easily confused with.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdd5011c433ab5742bc5fb38e20672718468bf31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/cdd5011c433ab5742bc5fb38e20672718468bf31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/75eb67cfecd67b2ed104b6072012bd574072e6e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/75eb67cfecd67b2ed104b6072012bd574072e6e3","node_id":"C_kwDOT5_MGdoAKDc1ZWI2N2NmZWNkNjdiMmVkMTA0YjYwNzIwMTJiZDU3NDA3MmU2ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commit/bb3e420212f56618b06eb5f0d0541d26c748dabf","sha":"bb3e420212f56618b06eb5f0d0541d26c748dabf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/bb3e420212f56618b06eb5f0d0541d26c748dabf"}],"sha":"75eb67cfecd67b2ed104b6072012bd574072e6e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/75eb67cfecd67b2ed104b6072012bd574072e6e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/commits/bb3e420212f56618b06eb5f0d0541d26c748dabf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:33:06Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:33:06Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"fix(access-control): accept the college code (or name) as the College ID when granting a role\n\nThe Access Control grant form asked for a ''College ID'' but only accepted the\ncollege''s Firestore document id — an opaque auto-id that appears nowhere in\nthe product except the URL. Operators know a college by the code they chose\non Create College (shown on the Colleges page, used by every CSV), so a\ncorrectly typed code was refused as ''college does not exist''.\n\n- functions/src/collegeResolve.ts: resolve id → exact code → case-insensitive\n  code → exact name; refuse ambiguous matches; explain failures by listing\n  the known colleges. grantUserRole now stamps the resolved id and echoes\n  the college name/code.\n- AccessControl.tsx: the box is a searchable college picker (freeSolo) that\n  resolves typed code/name/id locally, confirms the match under the field\n  and sends the document id; success message names the college.\n- Tests: functions/test/collegeResolve.test.ts (11), shared\n  collegeReference.test.ts (6), and a render check that types the code into\n  the real form and asserts the payload carries the id.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"30a57e8e3e3bf6d59eb4736291d9b6d9a3c59b55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/trees/30a57e8e3e3bf6d59eb4736291d9b6d9a3c59b55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi/git/commits/bb3e420212f56618b06eb5f0d0541d26c748dabf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab"