e and self-delete protection), while the\naccountant sees no Users menu and a permission card on direct visits.\nThe UserDto now carries createdAt, exposed by both the users and auth\nendpoints. Sidebar gates the menu on the admin role; the API 403\nremains the backstop.","tree":{"sha":"fda9511a9c1d6ede269be0c7f3a39a24b415b977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/trees/fda9511a9c1d6ede269be0c7f3a39a24b415b977"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/commits/872c9aa07179a1e8cd1cbb4254e9538c14285de8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24928372?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eryzerz","id":24928372,"login":"eryzerz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTI4Mzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eryzerz/mini-erp/commit/872c9aa07179a1e8cd1cbb4254e9538c14285de8","node_id":"C_kwDOT6DZI9oAKDg3MmM5YWEwNzE3OWExZThjZDFjYmI0MjU0ZTk1MzhjMTQyODVkZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eryzerz/mini-erp/commit/bcdf02634aa29b51655cdc34628ebaf82dddcfe2","sha":"bcdf02634aa29b51655cdc34628ebaf82dddcfe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/commits/bcdf02634aa29b51655