/mini-erp/commits/8fc7dbf5c86f9ce721aa315d82d6611244489b13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:48:25Z","email":"eryzero@gmail.com","name":"Rizqullah T"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:48:25Z","email":"eryzero@gmail.com","name":"Rizqullah T"},"message":"fix: serialize item quantity and unit price without trailing zeros\n\nFixed-point decimals came back as \"1.0000\" and \"750000.0000\",\nwhich read as a wrong data type in the edit form. The DTO now trims\ntrailing zeros at the serialization boundary (storage keeps its\ndeclared precision), so whole quantities render as 1 and fractional\nones keep their decimals. The quantity and unit-price inputs also get\nthe decimal keypad on mobile.","tree":{"sha":"312d10836a57895b7cf59e10cf1a1e5228871c29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/trees/312d10836a57895b7cf59e10cf1a1e5228871c29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/commits/8fc7dbf5c86f9ce721aa315d82d6611244489b13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24928372?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eryzerz","id":24928372,"login":"eryzerz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTI4Mzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com