:"Rizqullah T"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T15:23:39Z","email":"eryzero@gmail.com","name":"Rizqullah T"},"message":"fix: bind the api to all interfaces on the injected port\n\nRender routes health checks through the service URL to the platform-\ninjected PORT; the old Dockerfile EXPOSE 4000 could point routing at a\nport nothing listens on, keeping deploys stuck on the health check.\nListen explicitly on 0.0.0.0 and drop the EXPOSE declaration.","tree":{"sha":"1764eda8c92c078022e2ef86bc924249d94b6795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/trees/1764eda8c92c078022e2ef86bc924249d94b6795"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/commits/972510dd598ebc3f1486399b366ab3d10139fcbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24928372?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eryzerz","id":24928372,"login":"eryzerz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTI4Mzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eryzerz/mini-erp/commit/972510dd598ebc3f1486399b366ab3d10139fcbf","node_id":"C_kwDOT6DZI9oAKDk3MjUxMGRkNTk4ZWJjM2YxNDg2Mzk5YjM2NmFiM2QxMDEzOWZjYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.