/eryzerz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/commits/9d9f0c1c26534d9ac1ffce90ec3b9c25208070a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T12:43:00Z","email":"eryzero@gmail.com","name":"Rizqullah T"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T12:43:00Z","email":"eryzero@gmail.com","name":"Rizqullah T"},"message":"refactor: adopt shadcn ui primitives\n\nReplace the hand-rolled component layer in @repo/ui with the shadcn\nregistry (radix-ui, tw-animate-css): button, card, input, label,\ntextarea, select, dialog, dropdown-menu, table, badge, tabs, skeleton,\navatar, pagination, sonner, form and chart. Tokens stay ours (Dusk\nIndigo), so the visual identity is unchanged.\n\nForms migrate to the registry''s React Hook Form wrapper, which wires\nfield errors into the accessibility tree out of the box. A registry\nCalendar + Popover date picker replaces the native date input in the\ninvoice forms, fixing the unstyled calendar and dark-mode rendering.\nThe dashboard chart now builds on the registry chart primitives.","tree":{"sha":"6517e19bf57f8087cb3ed0a254f40d79a0e5acc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/trees/6517e19bf57f8087cb3ed0a254f40d79a0e5acc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eryzerz/mini-erp/git/commits/9d9f0c1c26534d9ac1ffce90ec3b9c25208070a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24928372?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eryzerz/following{/other_user}","gists_u