ogo Paza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T20:45:25Z","email":"paza@educabiz.com","name":"Diogo Paza"},"message":"Adiciona Parte 3.2 - Extra: Nexus como registro self-hosted\n\nEtapa propria (nao mais opcional dentro da 3.1) para subir Nexus via\nDocker, republicar a mesma lib compartilhada la, e reconfigurar\npayment-service/account-service para buscar dele em vez do GitHub\nPackages. Prova via log real que a dependencia veio do Nexus. Foco\nem mostrar que trocar de registro e mudanca de config, nao de codigo.","tree":{"sha":"13caa02ff820170e699abf7a9344d77c2f9d56a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diogopaza/Desafio-Completo-Sistema-Financeiro-Boletos-1-Milhao-Requisicoes/git/trees/13caa02ff820170e699abf7a9344d77c2f9d56a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diogopaza/Desafio-Completo-Sistema-Financeiro-Boletos-1-Milhao-Requisicoes/git/commits/5c6a0af4437a19a4104f0d735a3661e1d87ca0ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238465953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paza-a11y","id":238465953,"login":"paza-a11y","node_id":"U_kgDODjazoQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://