ogo Paza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:10:08Z","email":"paza@educabiz.com","name":"Diogo Paza"},"message":"Detalha metodologia de otimizacao iterativa na Parte 8 (teste de carga)\n\nDeixa explicito que o JMeter em si consegue gerar volume alto -- o\nlimite real esta na infraestrutura do servidor. Adiciona processo de\nvarias rodadas (medir, achar gargalo, ajustar, medir de novo), com as\nalavancas concretas (pool HikariCP, cache vs escrita real, GC) e a\nrecomendacao de rodar o load generator numa maquina separada do\nservidor para nao contaminar a medicao.","tree":{"sha":"89b9d147e2f6c6235562a8d1534c2dcdfad92be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diogopaza/Desafio-Completo-Sistema-Financeiro-Boletos-1-Milhao-Requisicoes/git/trees/89b9d147e2f6c6235562a8d1534c2dcdfad92be3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diogopaza/Desafio-Completo-Sistema-Financeiro-Boletos-1-Milhao-Requisicoes/git/commits/de90d1c5c1520768f9be4bd497d20c97a62ccd3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238465953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paza-a11y","id":238465953,"login":"paza-a11y","node_id":"U_kgDODjazoQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza