ucabiz.com","name":"Diogo Paza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T19:04:44Z","email":"paza@educabiz.com","name":"Diogo Paza"},"message":"Documenta roadmap completo do desafio (Partes 22-31 + Extra custo)\n\nBaseado no artigo de Cleyton Chagas sobre sistema financeiro para 1M\nreq/min. Introduz Arquitetura Hexagonal (novidade na serie) e\nintegracao real com a API de boletos da Tecnospeed (homologacao).\nDocumenta expectativa honesta sobre o teste de carga: volume real\ntestado contra o proprio sistema com stub (Parte 29), API real usada\nso para corretude em baixo volume (Parte 30), nunca as duas coisas\njuntas. WAF/ECS-Fargate ficam teoricos; Route53 via LocalStack\nCommunity; Kubernetes local no lugar do ECS/Fargate pago.","tree":{"sha":"7a7e11d05cc8f425e1cdebdd1e0a9cad9face2f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diogopaza/Desafio-Completo-Sistema-Financeiro-Boletos-1-Milhao-Requisicoes/git/trees/7a7e11d05cc8f425e1cdebdd1e0a9cad9face2f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diogopaza/Desafio-Completo-Sistema-Financeiro-Boletos-1-Milhao-Requisicoes/git/commits/24af850e4893f13ddf5ae11a699363d1e28e38fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238465953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paza-a11y","id":238465953,"login":"paza-a11y","node_id":"U_kgDODjazoQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paza-a11y/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p