.com/users/dhynesmnk-cyber/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhynesmnk-cyber/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhynesmnk-cyber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhynesmnk-cyber/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhynesmnk-cyber","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhynesmnk-cyber/Harcourt-valley/commits/d394dc20455446231fce02d106a674f7ec5a5876/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:11:31Z","email":"d.hynes.mnk@gmail.com","name":"dhynesmnk-cyber"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:11:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add text/background colour controls, and rebuild BeeSearch around your own accounts (#13)\n\nText & background colours:\n- Text colour, light background, and dark background (nav/footer/dark\n  buttons) are now independently admin-controllable, separate from the\n  season accent palette. Borders and shadows are deliberately untouched —\n  granite-900 stays fixed; new --text-ink and --bg-dark tokens carry only\n  the roles that should move, and --color-bone is now var-backed the same\n  way the accent colours already were.\n\nBeeSearch:\n- Replaced the abstract \"target profile\" concept with a real, editable\n  account roster (BeeSearchAccount) — add the stockists and planners you\n  already work with, edit or remove them any time.\n- \"Discover new ones\" is now seeded directly from that roster by kind\n  (\"Find more stockists/planners like mine\"), excludes anything already\n  on the roster, and dropped the \"read your bookings\" auto-analysis flow\n  that no longer fit the new two-step model.\n- Page restructured into three explicit steps (accounts → discover →\n  outbox) instead of one screen mixing setup, search and outreach.\n- New beesearch_accounts table/migration; the old beesearch_profiles\n  table is left in place, unused.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96c93d6224a24740067a95663d4fd34f2806ad80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhynesmnk-cyber/Harcourt-valley/git/trees/96c93d6224a24740067a95663d4fd34f2806ad80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhynesmnk-cyber/Harcourt-valley/git/commits/d394dc20455446231fce02d106a674f7ec5a5876","verification":{"payload":"tree 96c93d6224a24740067a95663d4fd34f2806ad80\nparent 7fb1c3b7ac36779eb95e9ec25c894ac238a11a01\nauthor dhynesmnk-cyber <d.hynes.mnk@gmail.com> 1788192691 +1000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788192691 +1000\n\nAdd text/background colour controls, and rebuild BeeSearch around your own accounts (#13)\n\nText & background colours:\n- Text colour, light background, and dark background (nav/footer/dark\n  buttons) are now independently admin-controllable, separate from the\n  season accent palette. Borders and shadows are deliberately untouched —\n  granite-900 stays fixed; new --text-ink and --bg-dark tokens carry only\n  the roles that should move, and --color-bone is now var-backed the same\n  way the accent colours already were.\n\nBeeSearch:\n- Replaced the abstract \"target profile\" concept with a real, editable\n  account roster (BeeSearchAccount) — add the stockists and planners you\n  already work with, edit or remove them any time.\n- \"Discover new ones\" is now seeded directly from that roster by kind\n  (\"Find more stockists/planners like mine\"), excludes anything already\n  on the roster, and dropped the \"read your bookings\" auto-analysis flow\n  that no longer fit the new two-step model.\n- Page restructured into three explicit steps (accounts → discover →\n  outbox) instead of one screen mixing setup, search and outreach.\n- New beesearch_accounts table/migration; the old beesearch_profiles\n  table is left in place, unused.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlaezCRC1aQ7uu5