rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harisankar95-s","id":74041671,"login":"harisankar95-s","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDQxNjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/033c6fec3b3e2751656a4f1455eed5dabd6a1918/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:56:04Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:56:04Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"message":"fix(catalog): await get_sample_data in the sample-data route\n\nread_sample_data was a plain `def` calling the async\nget_sample_data(...) without awaiting it, so FastAPI received an\nunresolved coroutine instead of the actual rows and failed response\nvalidation with \"coroutine was never awaited\" — breaking the Sample\nData tab for every table in the Data Catalog UI.\n\nMade the route async and awaited the call, matching how the adjacent\nadd_table_from_file route already does it correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a1636775ae96e77fbdd5a80a5cec44b36ab3538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/git/trees/0a1636775ae96e77fbdd5a80a5cec44b36ab3538"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/