ad0b95407094a2b11d537dec019d22536"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74041671?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harisankar95-s","id":74041671,"login":"harisankar95-s","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDQxNjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/e54cc7c180151ba89c4f8c4dc0226c042a20c976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:11:27Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:11:27Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"message":"fix(llm): send Gemini tool results with role=user, not role=tool\n\nGemini''s API has no \"tool\" role — valid roles are USER/MODEL/etc. Any\ntool call on a Gemini-backed agent failed with a 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT\nas soon as the tool''s result was sent back to the model. Function\nresponses must go back as role=\"user\" wrapping a FunctionResponse\npart, matching how the adjacent _build_gemini_text_content already\nmaps assistant->model / everything else->user.\n\nDiscovered while testing the new MLflow tool against a Gemini-backed\nagent, but affects every tool on Gemini, not just this one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6df3e0c247d3d524dd3f14fa7d039518d40e1553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/git/trees/6df3e0c247d3d524dd3f14fa7d039518d40e1553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/git/commits/e54cc7c180151ba89c4f8c4dc0226c042a20c976","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74041671?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harisankar95-s","id":74041671,"login":"harisankar95-s","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDQxNjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/compassx-platform/compassx/commit/e54cc7c180151ba89c4f8c4dc0226c042a20c976","node_id":"C_kwDOT6oMfNoAKGU1NGNjN2MxODAxNTFiYTg5YzRmOGM0ZGMwMjI2YzA0MmEyMGM5NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/compassx-platform/compassx/commit/11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb","sha":"11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb"}],"sha":"e54cc7c180151ba89c4f8c4dc0226c042a20c976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/e54cc7c180151ba89c4f8c4dc0226c042a20c976"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74041671?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harisankar95-s","id":74041671,"login":"harisankar95-s","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDQxNjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:11:19Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:11:19Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"message":"feat(notebooks): bake mlflow into the DuckDB kernel image\n\nKernels spawned for notebook execution now have `mlflow` available on\nimport without needing `!pip install mlflow` per session. Lets notebook\ncode log experiments/runs against the platform''s MLflow server directly\nvia the real client (mlflow.set_tracking_uri(\"http://mlflow:5000\")),\nas an independent path alongside the agent tool.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64d01d0314f1ca959f5b22b96199cf5c9454d864","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/git/trees/64d01d0314f1ca959f5b22b96199cf5c9454d864"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/git/commits/11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74041671?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harisankar95-s","id":74041671,"login":"harisankar95-s","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDQxNjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/compassx-platform/compassx/commit/11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb","node_id":"C_kwDOT6oMfNoAKDExOTY2YWU5NWU1N2RkYmM3ZjE3ZDFkM2QxZWI0MDAzNzYwNGFiZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/compassx-platform/compassx/commit/c69e416ec41719a97b17e6e6a18148962e988fb2","sha":"c69e416ec41719a97b17e6e6a18148962e988fb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/c69e416ec41719a97b17e6e6a18148962e988fb2"}],"sha":"11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/11966ae95e57ddbc7f17d1d3d1eb40037604abeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74041671?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harisankar95-s","id":74041671,"login":"harisankar95-s","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDQxNjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/commits/c69e416ec41719a97b17e6e6a18148962e988fb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:11:12Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:11:12Z","email":"hsrvhari2112@gmail.com","name":"Harisankar"},"message":"feat(mlflow): add MLflow as a platform tool and connection type\n\nRuns an MLflow tracking server in the local-dev/docker compose stacks\n(backend store on the shared Postgres, artifact store on the shared\nMinIO), exposes it as a connection type in the Catalog Connections\nregistry (app/catalog/connections/providers/ml_providers.py) so it''s\nselectable from the Connections UI, and adds MlflowTool — a BaseTool\ncovering experiments, runs, param/metric/batch logging, and the full\nmodel registry (register, versions, stage transitions, aliases) — so\nagents can use it once granted.\n\nThe tool talks to MLflow''s REST API directly via httpx rather than the\nmlflow client library, since that library authenticates through\nprocess-wide environment variables, which isn''t safe for one backend\nprocess serving concurrent calls across different connections/creds.\n\nAlso registers `mlflow` in the frontend''s tool catalog\n(frontend/src/modules/agents/toolCatalog.ts) so it actually shows up\nas a selectable tool when editing an agent — the agent editor reads\nfrom this static list, not the backend tool registry.\n\nEvery operation was validated against a live server (raw REST calls,\nthen the actual dispatcher end to end) before being trusted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9a086e6133694c65828b4eef1aa3b51ddd34bdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/git/trees/f9a086e6133694c65828b4eef1aa3b51ddd34bdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/compassx-platform/compassx/git/commits/c69e416ec41719a97b17e6e6a18148962e988fb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74041671?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harisankar95-s","id":74041671,"login":"harisankar95-s","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDQxNjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar95-s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harisankar