robacion'' -> ''Responsables de aprobación''\n- El campo de correo no tenia un label visible arriba (a diferencia del\n  de nombre, que muestra el rol), por lo que quedaba mas alto que el\n  resto de la fila en toda la tabla de aprobadores. Ahora envuelve el\n  input en un <label>Correo</label> igual que el de nombre, quedando\n  ambos alineados a la misma altura. Se mantiene aria-label especifico\n  por rol para accesibilidad.","tree":{"sha":"a98abfa57f937cd09ad7a45f5699bef0e5121331","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/git/trees/a98abfa57f937cd09ad7a45f5699bef0e5121331"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/git/commits/cb89c3ed2af3681299d0c3f611dd25975f77da4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vicente-silva/mptest/commit/cb89c3ed2af3681299d0c3f611dd25975f77da4f","node_id":"C_kwDOT6t0X9oAKGNiODljM2VkMmFmMzY4MTI5OWQwYzNmNjExZGQyNTk3NWY3N2RhNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vicente-silva/mptest/commit/da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf","sha":"da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/commits/da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf"}],"sha":"cb89c3ed2af3681299d0c3f611dd25975f77da4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/commits/cb89c3ed2af3681299d0c3f611dd25975f77da4f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/commits/da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:41:50Z","email":"tuemail@example.com","name":"Vicente Silva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:41:50Z","email":"tuemail@example.com","name":"Vicente Silva"},"message":"Mejorar calidad de codigo: nombres descriptivos y formato consistente\n\n- Reemplazar parametros de una sola letra (r, a, m, n, x) por nombres\n  descriptivos (solicitud, approver, mail, amount, isoDate) en frontend\n  y backend, para mejor legibilidad.\n- Reformatear funciones muy comprimidas en una sola linea en server.js\n  y store.js a formato multilinea, consistente con el resto del proyecto.\n- Extraer comparador de ordenamiento duplicado a byCreatedAtDescending()\n  en store.js (DRY).\n- Renombrar estado ''data'' a ''approvalData'' en Aprobacion.jsx.","tree":{"sha":"2256d64efd37f466aca423f5e19abe000a63e4c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/git/trees/2256d64efd37f466aca423f5e19abe000a63e4c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/git/commits/da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vicente-silva/mptest/commit/da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf","node_id":"C_kwDOT6t0X9oAKGRhNTUyOTQ0MmRmMWFjNTUwNjQxYzZmYWE3M2FlNmJlNDUyZTQ4YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vicente-silva/mptest/commit/f5e224eb12574137e4e923ebf40ee4c80da9c56b","sha":"f5e224eb12574137e4e923ebf40ee4c80da9c56b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/commits/f5e224eb12574137e4e923ebf40ee4c80da9c56b"}],"sha":"da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/commits/da5529442df1ac550641c6faa73ae6be452e48bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/commits/f5e224eb12574137e4e923ebf40ee4c80da9c56b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:34:25Z","email":"tuemail@example.com","name":"Vicente Silva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:34:25Z","email":"tuemail@example.com","name":"Vicente Silva"},"message":"Documentar como consultar endpoints GET directo desde el navegador","tree":{"sha":"1b4250f975edbb9487fe4092004bcaca563ae571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vicente-silva/mptest/git/trees/1b4250f975edbb9487fe4092004bcaca563ae571"},"ur