s://api.github.com/users/vijayk108","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/94abd867f088ba9c7b2504eb36fbfef0f7d1df47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:37:14Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:37:14Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"message":"Rewrite LinkedIn post to reflect shipped features\n\nOld draft framed cost-aware routing recommendations, Loki portability,\nand shadow-confidence as future work. All three are now in the code:\nstructured RoutingRecommendation on the verdict, LOG_BACKEND=loki\none-env-var swap, and OpenAI logprob shadow check on P1 alerts.\n\nThree variants updated:\n- short (X / Threads / Bluesky, ~60 words)\n- medium (LinkedIn feed, ~340 words, default)\n- long (LinkedIn article, ~600 words)\n\nDesign bets lead with the specific failure modes (TTFT / cost runaway\n/ GPU pressure), then the four defensible technical decisions, then\nthe portability + honest \"not shipped yet\" tail. Tone tuned to read\nas experienced engineering, not AI slop — concrete numbers, named\ntools, understated close, no emoji or hashtag salad.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a36c47f62a0509b08fc20b5d162deefe8efbb5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/git/trees/a36c47f62a0509b08fc20b5d162deefe8efbb5d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/git/commits/94abd867f088ba9c7b2504eb36fbfef0f7d1df47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35860178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108","id":35860178,"login":"vijayk108","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODYwMTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commit/94abd867f088ba9c7b2504eb36fbfef0f7d1df47","node_id":"C_kwDOT6wULdoAKDk0YWJkODY3ZjA4OGJhOWM3YjI1MDRlYjM2ZmJmZWYwZjdkMWRmNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commit/6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289","sha":"6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289"}],"sha":"94abd867f088ba9c7b2504eb36fbfef0f7d1df47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/94abd867f088ba9c7b2504eb36fbfef0f7d1df47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35860178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108","id":35860178,"login":"vijayk108","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODYwMTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:29:56Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:29:56Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"message":"Shadow-confidence check via OpenAI logprobs for P1 verdicts\n\nGemini doesn''t expose per-token logprobs, so verdict trust can''t be\nmeasured directly. New shadow_confidence module runs the same alert +\ntimeline + runbook evidence through gpt-4o-mini with logprobs=True and\nreturns a ShadowResult (geometric-mean per-token p, low-conf token\ncount, trust_signal in {high, medium, low}) that gets attached to the\nFirestore incident record.\n\n- Opt-in via SHADOW_CONFIDENCE_ENABLED env; only fires on critical/P1.\n- Async: primary Slack/dashboard fan-out is not blocked. Shadow\n  annotation lands on the incident doc 1-3s later.\n- Graceful failure: missing OPENAI_API_KEY or openai import → warn,\n  skip. Primary pipeline continues unchanged.\n- Cost: ~$0.0002 per P1 alert. Cheap at any real scale.\n- Helm: new aiAnalyst.env.shadowEnabled + openaiSecretRef; both\n  keep the OPENAI_API_KEY secret optional so cluster boots without it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bdbf863ddc53256fa1cc218e9f93bb410e0e66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/git/trees/7bdbf863ddc53256fa1cc218e9f93bb410e0e66b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/git/commits/6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35860178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108","id":35860178,"login":"vijayk108","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODYwMTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commit/6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289","node_id":"C_kwDOT6wULdoAKDZhNWNiMDAyMjdmODUwN2RkZmVkMzEwMDNjZWZjOGVkMDVhZGMyODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commit/873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0","sha":"873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0"}],"sha":"6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/6a5cb00227f8507ddfed31003cefc8ed05adc289"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35860178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108","id":35860178,"login":"vijayk108","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODYwMTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T18:41:06Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T18:41:06Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"message":"Pluggable log backend (Cloud Logging / Loki / none) + GKE deploy fixes\n\nLog collector rewritten behind a LogCollector Protocol with three\nconcrete implementations (CloudLoggingLogCollector, LokiLogCollector,\nNoopLogCollector) selected via LOG_BACKEND env. Keeps the analyst\nprovider-neutral: a one-env-var flip runs the same pipeline on\nGrafana Cloud / self-hosted Loki instead of GCP Cloud Logging.\n\nDeploy hardening surfaced during first GKE Autopilot deploy:\n- ai-analyst: mount emptyDir at /tmp (readOnlyRootFilesystem breaks\n  qdrant-client''s portalocker which needs tempfile at import time).\n- dashboard: HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0 so Next.js standalone binds to all\n  interfaces (default binds to pod hostname, unreachable by kubelet\n  probes).\n- deploy.sh: --platform linux/amd64 on docker builds (Apple Silicon).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7996113d54181fb535e4c2da92463a41bc48f0cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/git/trees/7996113d54181fb535e4c2da92463a41bc48f0cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/git/commits/873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35860178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108","id":35860178,"login":"vijayk108","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODYwMTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commit/873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0","node_id":"C_kwDOT6wULdoAKDg3M2YzYjczY2Y1YWE5NTU2MjBjYjNlMDk1NGRiYzliZGEwODM1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commit/3f8be5b3e109f0cc0feb095b01d60a7dfdfdb736","sha":"3f8be5b3e109f0cc0feb095b01d60a7dfdfdb736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/3f8be5b3e109f0cc0feb095b01d60a7dfdfdb736"}],"sha":"873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/873f3b73cf5aa955620cb3e0954dbc9bda0835f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35860178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vijayk108","id":35860178,"login":"vijayk108","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODYwMTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vijayk108","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-analyst/commits/3f8be5b3e109f0cc0feb095b01d60a7dfdfdb736/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T02:04:47Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T02:04:47Z","email":"krishnakakarla90@gmail.com","name":"vijayk108"},"message":"Initial commit: AI SRE Analyst for LLM serving on Kubernetes\n\nEnd-to-end pipeline: Alertmanager webhook -> Redis dedup + cross-namespace\ncorrelation -> multi-source timeline (K8s Events + Deployments + Cloud Logs)\n-> cost-guard tiered dispatch -> tier-1 rules or tier-3 Gemini 2.5 Flash with\nRAG over Qdrant runbooks -> Firestore persistence -> Slack + dashboard + GCS\naudit fan-out.\n\nIncludes evidence-cited verdicts, structured cost-aware routing\nrecommendations, human-in-loop feedback via curated review queue, 4 mock\ninference workloads with scripted incident modes, Next.js 15 mission-control\ndashboard, Helm chart, Terraform for GKE Autopilot + IAM + Artifact Registry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99d1413ae7ae6cf4f4d58d4168687fe20a7b40a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vijayk108/ai-sre-