s://api.github.com/users/lianenguyen150/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lianenguyen150/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lianenguyen150/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lianenguyen150/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lianenguyen150/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lianenguyen150","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/c3f47c1cc10b494c4e08bdda2156722f2482cb30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:47:37Z","email":"101995278+lianenguyen150@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Liane Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:47:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(save-the-date): redesign the link preview image (#22)\n\n* feat(save-the-date): redesign the link preview image\n\nKeep the polaroid-and-card layout but make both pieces larger so the\nnames and date read at text-message size. Drop the drifting petals and\nedge ribbons, add roses from the garden frame in two corners, and keep\nthe card''s circle-lace border and \"Formal invitation to follow\" line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(save-the-date): set \"the\" in the link preview''s Save the Date like its neighbors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(save-the-date): drop \"You''re invited to\" from the link preview card\n\nA save-the-date comes before the invitation, so the eyebrow contradicted\n\"Formal invitation to follow\". Save the Date now opens the card, set a\nlittle larger, with the spacing rebalanced around the names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31f64df7a8e12f6b8326a467a7f45123bb00cad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/tre