"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:56:32Z","email":"101995278+lianenguyen150@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Liane Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:56:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(save-the-date): play the couple''s song from a self-hosted file (#19)\n\nThe record on the date card now plays a purchased copy of \"Dream\" served\nfrom public/dream.m4a instead of the YouTube video, so tapping it no\nlonger opens a visible player panel. The record is the only control;\nplayback starts inside the tap, the song loops, and nothing downloads\nuntil the first tap.\n\nRemoves the YouTube IFrame API loader and the panel''s copy and styles,\nand updates the record-player design doc.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ab83b3fb25737604f81c196bb9b06da5d3418ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/trees/9ab83b3fb25737604f81c196bb9b06da5d3418ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/commits/f0d73677e09241e4be97d9027313316a07c75c17","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ab83b3fb25737604f81c196bb9b06da5d3418ad\nparent a0dacb23e0ea257e2e6a3fd488d7be91e6c4c3b5\nauthor Liane Nguyen <101995278+lianenguyen150@users.noreply.github.com> 1791010592 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791010592 -0700\n\nfeat(save-the-date): play the couple''s song from a self-hosted file (#19)\n\nThe record on the date card now plays a purchased copy of \"Dream\" served\nfrom public/dream.m4a instead of the YouTube video, so tapping it no\nlonger opens a visible player panel. The record is the only control;\nplayback starts inside the tap, the song loops, and nothing downloads\nuntil the first tap.\n\nRemoves the YouTube IFrame API loader and the panel''s copy and styles,\nand updates the record-player design doc.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwKcgCRC1aQ7