":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/6d0cd613a5b66751a3e997a727579c2ebd22538f","node_id":"C_kwDOT6yInNoAKDZkMGNkNjEzYTViNjY3NTFhM2U5OTdhNzI3NTc5YzJlYmQyMjUzOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f","sha":"fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f"}],"sha":"6d0cd613a5b66751a3e997a727579c2ebd22538f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/6d0cd613a5b66751a3e997a727579c2ebd22538f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T14:38:30Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"penguyen72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T15:04:41Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"Peyton Nguyen"},"message":"fix(blackberry): generate Next.js types before type-checking\n\nCI''s Type-check step ran a bare `tsc --noEmit` on a fresh checkout, before\nBuild ever ran. `next-env.d.ts` (gitignored, providing next/image''s module\ntype declarations) is only created by `next dev`/`next build`, so a fresh\ncheckout had no image-import types yet, and typecheck failed on\n`import heroPhoto from \"@/assets/hero.jpeg\"` with \"Cannot find module ...\nor its corresponding type declarations.\" Passed locally only because this\nworktree already had a stale next-env.d.ts from earlier dev/build runs;\npassed on Vercel only because `next build` generates it before its own\ninternal check runs.\n\nRoot-caused and reproduced locally by removing next-env.d.ts and re-running\n`pnpm --filter @mocha/blackberry typecheck`, which hit the exact CI error.\n\nFix: add a `typegen` turbo task (`next typegen` — generates route/image\ntypes without a full build) that `typecheck` now depends on, so the\ndependency graph guarantees correct ordering for any invocation (CI, local,\nfuture), not just as a CI-specific workaround. Canton doesn''t need this\nyet (no image imports), and turbo skips a task a workspace doesn''t define,\nso apps/canton is untouched.\n\nVerified: reproduced the failure, applied the fix, confirmed `pnpm\ntypecheck` from a clean state (no pre-existing next-env.d.ts) now passes,\nthen re-ran the full lint/typecheck/test/build suite clean.","tree":{"sha":"23606f833c2692e74e17644c7b739ccfc3dae3a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/trees/23606f833c2692e74e17644c7b739ccfc3dae3a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/commits/fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f","node_id":"C_kwDOT6yInNoAKGZiNmMyOThjYWQyM2MxMDJhNDJhZDYwYzhmMDkyMzQwYWU5NGY5MmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2","sha":"f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2"}],"sha":"fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/fb6c298cad23c102a42ad60c8f092340ae94f92f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T04:38:41Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"penguyen72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T15:04:41Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"Peyton Nguyen"},"message":"fix(blackberry): replace truncated hero photo with the real, complete image\n\nThe previous asset was silently truncated by the claude_design MCP tool''s\nget_file 256 KiB cap (Task 9), rendering as ~95% flat grey under the\noverlay. Replaced with the real, complete photo (verified: valid JPEG EOI\nmarker, correct dimensions, visual decode confirmed).","tree":{"sha":"f09403c1b5795025bc3771bd443b207ce520f89e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/trees/f09403c1b5795025bc3771bd443b207ce520f89e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/commits/f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2","node_id":"C_kwDOT6yInNoAKGYwYTI5NGFhNjE1YWY0NTA1NGViZmI1YjQzOTFjNzFmNjJiMjdlZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3","sha":"13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3"}],"sha":"f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/f0a294aa615af45054ebfb5b4391c71f62b27ef2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T04:29:03Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"penguyen72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T15:04:41Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"Peyton Nguyen"},"message":"feat(ui): hide the hero scroll cue on scroll and tighten nav padding on scroll\n\nImplements two scroll-driven behaviors specified in the design\nreference doc that were missed in the initial port:\n\n- Extract the hero''s scroll cue into its own client component\n  (ScrollCue), since Hero itself is a server component with no scroll\n  awareness. ScrollCue hides itself once the page has scrolled past\n  10% of the viewport height, instead of rendering unconditionally\n  forever. It''s an internal implementation detail of Hero and is not\n  exported from the package entrypoint.\n- SiteNav''s padding now tightens on scroll (py-[22px] unscrolled,\n  py-4 scrolled), matching the existing background/text-color\n  crossfade instead of staying fixed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1253c1fec0ed9d48482645a9a6fa25954444614f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/trees/1253c1fec0ed9d48482645a9a6fa25954444614f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/commits/13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3","node_id":"C_kwDOT6yInNoAKDEzZDlmYzA1ZDkxMzBiMWQyNDQyN2Q1N2U4NGJmMDBlZTg2ZDllZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72/mocha/commit/61af42c4e7960d191c8c7ac2d93f159e8b36725b","sha":"61af42c4e7960d191c8c7ac2d93f159e8b36725b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/61af42c4e7960d191c8c7ac2d93f159e8b36725b"}],"sha":"13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/13d9fc05d9130b1d24427d57e84bf00ee86d9ed3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81111936?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penguyen72","id":81111936,"login":"penguyen72","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTExOTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penguyen72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/commits/61af42c4e7960d191c8c7ac2d93f159e8b36725b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T04:28:43Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"penguyen72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T15:04:41Z","email":"peytonn72@gmail.com","name":"Peyton Nguyen"},"message":"fix(blackberry): wire local --bb-* palette into Tailwind''s theme\n\nBlackberry''s local editorial custom properties (--bb-clay,\n--bb-terracotta, --bb-peach, --bb-blush, --bb-mauve, --bb-line,\n--bb-ink-black) were defined but never mapped into an @theme inline\nblock, so no bg-bb-clay-style utility existed — a future session\nwould have had to fall back to bg-[var(--bb-clay)] or inline styles.\nAdd the mapping to --color-bb-* tokens so these local swatches get\nreal Tailwind utility classes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b250bfc2e47b5a7672fe6b951526547cf6f2bec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/penguyen72/mocha/git/trees/2b250bfc2e47b5a7672fe6b951526547cf6f2bec"},"url":